(6669232, 994594, 66641, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful</td>', 'this is beautiful', '2012-02-10 02:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669234, 993630, 114233, '<td valign="top">Simply magnificent picture Rian... and all of this from a single exposure! The eye really get led on a journey from the rock up the stream between the hills and onto the mountain then the awesome clouds take over!</td>', 'Simply magnificent picture Rian... and all of this from a single exposure! The eye really get led on a journey from the rock up the stream between the hills and onto the mountain then the awesome clouds take over!', '2012-02-10 02:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669238, 998136, 114233, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful! Sadly I think the processing of the image let it down a little bit - there is too much chromatic abberation on the posts on the left hand side (cyan halo an the left and red halo on the right of each post)</td>', 'Simple and beautiful! Sadly I think the processing of the image let it down a little bit - there is too much chromatic abberation on the posts on the left hand side (cyan halo an the left and red halo on the right of each post)', '2012-02-10 02:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669242, 995690, 114233, '<td valign="top">Guessing it is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=121949" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sjhuls</a>. Good processing and it should do really well.<br/>In an effort to help all the shots I comment on in this challenge I would only say it feels a little heavy on the left, The clouds, mountains and girls are all weighted on the left hand side. This pic is great but would be over the top if the girls were on the right of the shot to balance it a bit more.</td>', 'Guessing it is  sjhuls. Good processing and it should do really well.In an effort to help all the shots I comment on in this challenge I would only say it feels a little heavy on the left, The clouds, mountains and girls are all weighted on the left hand side. This pic is great but would be over the top if the girls were on the right of the shot to balance it a bit more.', '2012-02-10 02:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669245, 997411, 66641, '<td valign="top">Oh god!  Breathtaking!  aagghhh!!! I LOVE this!!<br/> <br/>Coming back to this again - my choice for the blue.  This made me very emotional for some reason.  Would love a print of this.  This is ART.</td>', 'Oh god!  Breathtaking!  aagghhh!!! I LOVE this!! Coming back to this again - my choice for the blue.  This made me very emotional for some reason.  Would love a print of this.  This is ART.', '2012-02-10 03:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
