(6669484, 993597, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I just don´t like abstract work, it doesn´t appeal to me at all and all I see is a blurry pidgeon.  I mean no disrespect but rather wanted to explain why I gave this a 3 so at least you know it´s just my personal taste.</td>', 'Sorry but I just don´t like abstract work, it doesn´t appeal to me at all and all I see is a blurry pidgeon.  I mean no disrespect but rather wanted to explain why I gave this a 3 so at least you know it´s just my personal taste.', '2012-02-10 07:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669486, 996658, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome moment, you "nailed it".</td>', 'Awesome moment, you "nailed it".', '2012-02-10 07:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669487, 994113, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty much spot on with everything regarding image technique, the colors especially are wonderful.  Only negative thing I can say is I have seen so many of these type of shots they have long ago lost all points of originality for me personally but like I say, technically this shot is perfect.  Gave a 7.</td>', 'Pretty much spot on with everything regarding image technique, the colors especially are wonderful.  Only negative thing I can say is I have seen so many of these type of shots they have long ago lost all points of originality for me personally but like I say, technically this shot is perfect.  Gave a 7.', '2012-02-10 07:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669490, 996015, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an attitude from a bug!  I like this one, that little guy seems to be staring you/me down?</td>', 'Wow, what an attitude from a bug!  I like this one, that little guy seems to be staring you/me down?', '2012-02-10 07:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
