(6669494, 997816, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but a little flat and "gray" contrast wise for my taste.  There is another high contrast color photo of the same pyramid in this challenge wich I like a lot better.  Still gave a 6, this is definately above average photography.</td>', 'Not bad, but a little flat and "gray" contrast wise for my taste.  There is another high contrast color photo of the same pyramid in this challenge wich I like a lot better.  Still gave a 6, this is definately above average photography.', '2012-02-10 07:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
