(6669504, 994471, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really jaw struck by the lighting in this one, in my opinion this would have appealed a bit more to me if there was more fill lighting from the left, on his right hand especially.  Also the processing is a bit too "plastic" for lack of a better word, for my taste.  Anyway, nice concept and still gave it a 6.</td>', 'Not really jaw struck by the lighting in this one, in my opinion this would have appealed a bit more to me if there was more fill lighting from the left, on his right hand especially.  Also the processing is a bit too "plastic" for lack of a better word, for my taste.  Anyway, nice concept and still gave it a 6.', '2012-02-10 07:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669505, 996658, 7889, '<td valign="top">Life is all about timing and your timing is spot on here. Great shot</td>', 'Life is all about timing and your timing is spot on here. Great shot', '2012-02-10 07:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669506, 995951, 137576, '<td valign="top">seen this before this is orisis1984 or what ever the number is hehe, my 3yr old would love playing with this, nice dof, but not that sharp or singing to me 6 edit for spelling</td>', 'seen this before this is orisis1984 or what ever the number is hehe, my 3yr old would love playing with this, nice dof, but not that sharp or singing to me 6 edit for spelling', '2012-02-10 07:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669507, 997451, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great expression in this shot, I wonder what she is thinking? She is a cutie, bless her.</td>', 'Great expression in this shot, I wonder what she is thinking? She is a cutie, bless her.', '2012-02-10 07:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669508, 996155, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice wedding shot, I do however feel that the pier and boats kind of detract from it. Personally I would have gone through the trouble and edited them out, especially the boat coming out of the brides head, leaving just the couple, the islands/mountains at the horizon and the water/cliffs that they are on.  Like I said, nice shot, taken at the exact right time of day, I gave an 8 but might have been a 10 without the boats/pier.</td>', 'Nice wedding shot, I do however feel that the pier and boats kind of detract from it. Personally I would have gone through the trouble and edited them out, especially the boat coming out of the brides head, leaving just the couple, the islands/mountains at the horizon and the water/cliffs that they are on.  Like I said, nice shot, taken at the exact right time of day, I gave an 8 but might have been a 10 without the boats/pier.', '2012-02-10 07:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669510, 994157, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the toning/texture of it.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the toning/texture of it.', '2012-02-10 07:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
