(6669747, 994889, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I could see this being in a car brochure, it has that kind of quality to it.  For me though, who is not a car enthusiast, I don´t really find it interesting though, even though it´s well done, taken in a good spot, good lighting and well processed.  Gave a 6.</td>', 'Nice shot, I could see this being in a car brochure, it has that kind of quality to it.  For me though, who is not a car enthusiast, I don´t really find it interesting though, even though it´s well done, taken in a good spot, good lighting and well processed.  Gave a 6.', '2012-02-10 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
