(6670064, 993778, 3102, '<td valign="top">Gotta be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=11769" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jmritz</a>.  On one hand, I appreciate that you have a style and stick with it... but I have to admit that this type of entry does absolutely nothing for me.  I''m sure there are those who appreciate this kind of thing as abstract art, but to me it looks like an accident as the camera was dropped off a shelf in the dark or something.  Sorry...</td>', 'Gotta be  jmritz.  On one hand, I appreciate that you have a style and stick with it... but I have to admit that this type of entry does absolutely nothing for me.  I''m sure there are those who appreciate this kind of thing as abstract art, but to me it looks like an accident as the camera was dropped off a shelf in the dark or something.  Sorry...', '2012-02-10 12:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
