(6670389, 996747, 43463, '<td valign="top">She was inclined to pay him no mind.<br/>His kind offer cattily declined,<br/>he instead gave shelter to the fishing feline.<br/> <br/>Great street photography - love the juxtaposition of the real and unreal; reality and imagination. The colors and capture are perfect. I also love learning about and seeing new places - interesting street and history.</td>', 'She was inclined to pay him no mind.His kind offer cattily declined,he instead gave shelter to the fishing feline. Great street photography - love the juxtaposition of the real and unreal; reality and imagination. The colors and capture are perfect. I also love learning about and seeing new places - interesting street and history.', '2012-02-10 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
