(6670473, 993598, 61396, '<td valign="top">b/w works well here, as is the soft processing. the high key delivers a sense of heat (supported by the withered plant). hope she doesn''t wait for too long.</td>', 'b/w works well here, as is the soft processing. the high key delivers a sense of heat (supported by the withered plant). hope she doesn''t wait for too long.', '2012-02-10 17:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
