(6670517, 997232, 142833, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I feel the highlights from the fog are a bit overpowering. I think the photo would''ve been better served by about half the ''fog sky'' it currently has.</td>', 'I like this, but I feel the highlights from the fog are a bit overpowering. I think the photo would''ve been better served by about half the ''fog sky'' it currently has.', '2012-02-10 18:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670518, 997435, 107506, '<td valign="top">I think i would have preferred a tighter crop</td>', 'I think i would have preferred a tighter crop', '2012-02-10 18:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670519, 993597, 142833, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like this style, but I like this photo, how it suggests the bird without showing its details. Love the tinge of orange that is just enough to tell me they are feet.</td>', 'I don''t normally like this style, but I like this photo, how it suggests the bird without showing its details. Love the tinge of orange that is just enough to tell me they are feet.', '2012-02-10 18:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670523, 997171, 142833, '<td valign="top">Cute! Wish the photo was zoomed in more.</td>', 'Cute! Wish the photo was zoomed in more.', '2012-02-10 18:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670524, 994089, 107506, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at, nothing compelling here</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at, nothing compelling here', '2012-02-10 18:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670525, 997137, 94265, '<td valign="top">A very pretty scenery shot with a few different points of interest, nice colours too.</td>', 'A very pretty scenery shot with a few different points of interest, nice colours too.', '2012-02-10 18:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670527, 994920, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great moody portrait, nice clear details of the freckles and eyelashes.</td>', 'Great moody portrait, nice clear details of the freckles and eyelashes.', '2012-02-10 18:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670528, 994053, 94265, '<td valign="top">His expression made me chuckle, he looks so cross!</td>', 'His expression made me chuckle, he looks so cross!', '2012-02-10 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670529, 994338, 94265, '<td valign="top">Simplistic, crisp and beautiful, very nice work.</td>', 'Simplistic, crisp and beautiful, very nice work.', '2012-02-10 18:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670531, 997451, 100393, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely portrait but (in my view) thoroughly undermined by the selective desaturation. Your b&amp;w toning is far too good to have diluted it with gratuitous colour.</td>', 'Such a lovely portrait but (in my view) thoroughly undermined by the selective desaturation. Your b&w toning is far too good to have diluted it with gratuitous colour.', '2012-02-10 18:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670535, 995627, 94265, '<td valign="top">I found it hard to find a focal point in this shot, with the sweep of trees, chunks of rock and thick cloud, it''s like it''s simple but too much at the same time. Not sure if that''s entirely a bad thing though as it did make me study the image; it is well-composed, the moody sky looks great and the scenery itself is gorgeous. It is a very good shot generally.</td>', 'I found it hard to find a focal point in this shot, with the sweep of trees, chunks of rock and thick cloud, it''s like it''s simple but too much at the same time. Not sure if that''s entirely a bad thing though as it did make me study the image; it is well-composed, the moody sky looks great and the scenery itself is gorgeous. It is a very good shot generally.', '2012-02-10 18:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670538, 998047, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is very sweet, lovely happy little faces, nice focus on them. I don''t even really mind the blown highlights in the background as the little ones are so engaging. Nice work.</td>', 'This is very sweet, lovely happy little faces, nice focus on them. I don''t even really mind the blown highlights in the background as the little ones are so engaging. Nice work.', '2012-02-10 18:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670539, 993604, 107506, '<td valign="top">I have stared at this photo for an unusual amount of time on different occasions.  That is all.</td>', 'I have stared at this photo for an unusual amount of time on different occasions.  That is all.', '2012-02-10 18:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670545, 994646, 94265, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nicely-kept location but I''m personally not keen on the processing, the blue tint is unappealing and the foliage becomes a bit overbearing. I think I''d have preferred seeing this in proper full colour.</td>', 'Looks like a nicely-kept location but I''m personally not keen on the processing, the blue tint is unappealing and the foliage becomes a bit overbearing. I think I''d have preferred seeing this in proper full colour.', '2012-02-10 18:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670546, 997912, 107506, '<td valign="top">Compelling, but i''m wanting to see more detail on her body.  Maybe if her arm was moved back (left) a little and it wasn''t so bright on her stomach. Or if it were cropped up from the bottom.  Idk, it''s on the verge of me really liking it.</td>', 'Compelling, but i''m wanting to see more detail on her body.  Maybe if her arm was moved back (left) a little and it wasn''t so bright on her stomach. Or if it were cropped up from the bottom.  Idk, it''s on the verge of me really liking it.', '2012-02-10 18:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670548, 997793, 73942, '<td valign="top">wow, the sky definitely showed up for this</td>', 'wow, the sky definitely showed up for this', '2012-02-10 18:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670549, 996805, 94265, '<td valign="top">As a photograph, I''m not keen on the soft processing as it has begun to look like a painting. As a painting, it would be lovely, lol; nice subject, good bokeh, attractive colours. Maybe go a little easier in PP next time; still quite like it though.</td>', 'As a photograph, I''m not keen on the soft processing as it has begun to look like a painting. As a painting, it would be lovely, lol; nice subject, good bokeh, attractive colours. Maybe go a little easier in PP next time; still quite like it though.', '2012-02-10 18:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670552, 997788, 94265, '<td valign="top">An interesting arrangement of branches, an intriguing path; a nice place to take a photograph. The heavy over-saturation on the greens spoils this for me though, I don''t think it needed such vibrant tones, in fact the slightly eerie look of this road would have suited a more muted tone.</td>', 'An interesting arrangement of branches, an intriguing path; a nice place to take a photograph. The heavy over-saturation on the greens spoils this for me though, I don''t think it needed such vibrant tones, in fact the slightly eerie look of this road would have suited a more muted tone.', '2012-02-10 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670553, 997130, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful light</td>', 'beautiful light', '2012-02-10 18:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670554, 995129, 73942, '<td valign="top">very nicely done</td>', 'very nicely done', '2012-02-10 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670556, 997864, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what her story is but this image makes me want to know. Very sad. Very well-taken too; great focus, rich colours and thought-provoking overall. Good work.</td>', 'I don''t know what her story is but this image makes me want to know. Very sad. Very well-taken too; great focus, rich colours and thought-provoking overall. Good work.', '2012-02-10 18:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670558, 998084, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful family moment, those faces are precious, mummy looks so protective yet tender. Why so thin on the crop though? I''d have liked to see a little more of this scene. Lovely shot.</td>', 'Beautiful family moment, those faces are precious, mummy looks so protective yet tender. Why so thin on the crop though? I''d have liked to see a little more of this scene. Lovely shot.', '2012-02-10 18:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670561, 996917, 94265, '<td valign="top">A portrait with potential; nice model, clean colourless scheme besides her hair, good eye contact. The light from behind in her hair is a little harsh though and while the focus is fine, it could stand to be sharpened up some.</td>', 'A portrait with potential; nice model, clean colourless scheme besides her hair, good eye contact. The light from behind in her hair is a little harsh though and while the focus is fine, it could stand to be sharpened up some.', '2012-02-10 18:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670563, 996148, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lush scenery, the road meandering through is a nice change in a shot such as this. Good vantage point here and lovely rich greens. Good work.</td>', 'Lush scenery, the road meandering through is a nice change in a shot such as this. Good vantage point here and lovely rich greens. Good work.', '2012-02-10 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670564, 995981, 73942, '<td valign="top">amazing capture</td>', 'amazing capture', '2012-02-10 18:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670565, 994896, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait</td>', 'beautiful portrait', '2012-02-10 18:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670566, 996742, 94265, '<td valign="top">The rich b&amp;w, the darkening sky and the sign claiming ''no lifeguard on duty'' makes this quite an ominous image for me, in a good way. Very nicely taken, I really like this.</td>', 'The rich b&w, the darkening sky and the sign claiming ''no lifeguard on duty'' makes this quite an ominous image for me, in a good way. Very nicely taken, I really like this.', '2012-02-10 18:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670568, 996394, 73942, '<td valign="top">you''ve got some really nice detail</td>', 'you''ve got some really nice detail', '2012-02-10 18:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670569, 998084, 73942, '<td valign="top">cute family portrait</td>', 'cute family portrait', '2012-02-10 18:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670570, 997469, 73942, '<td valign="top">they look like they are floating, pretty cool</td>', 'they look like they are floating, pretty cool', '2012-02-10 18:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670571, 996817, 94265, '<td valign="top">This has a very ethereal feel to it, quite beautiful really; I like the single figure and the title is super. I''d have removed those specks from the top left corner but otherwise, this is very pretty and I wouldn''t be surprised if posthumous hangs it in his ''fantasy gallery''.</td>', 'This has a very ethereal feel to it, quite beautiful really; I like the single figure and the title is super. I''d have removed those specks from the top left corner but otherwise, this is very pretty and I wouldn''t be surprised if posthumous hangs it in his ''fantasy gallery''.', '2012-02-10 18:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670572, 996873, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lush interior, what a beautiful place; excellent perspective to shoot from, love the curves and colours.</td>', 'Lush interior, what a beautiful place; excellent perspective to shoot from, love the curves and colours.', '2012-02-10 18:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670575, 996176, 94265, '<td valign="top">A very interesting sculpture and beautifully captured here; the slightly bluish tint is a great compliment to the shiny metal structure. Good exposure and perspective.</td>', 'A very interesting sculpture and beautifully captured here; the slightly bluish tint is a great compliment to the shiny metal structure. Good exposure and perspective.', '2012-02-10 18:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670576, 995602, 73942, '<td valign="top">this is really pretty, but I think the border hurts more than helps, this can stand on it own without a border, IMO</td>', 'this is really pretty, but I think the border hurts more than helps, this can stand on it own without a border, IMO', '2012-02-10 18:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670580, 994314, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scenery, I could imagine standing at this vantage point and the local kids running past me to go leaping in the water to play. Good work.</td>', 'Very pretty scenery, I could imagine standing at this vantage point and the local kids running past me to go leaping in the water to play. Good work.', '2012-02-10 18:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670581, 998014, 73942, '<td valign="top">such concentration</td>', 'such concentration', '2012-02-10 18:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670584, 997771, 94265, '<td valign="top">Pretty lilac tones, nice curves and shapes, a lovely image. I might not have bothered with the border, I find the block black lines detract a bit from the soft, feminine-like subject.</td>', 'Pretty lilac tones, nice curves and shapes, a lovely image. I might not have bothered with the border, I find the block black lines detract a bit from the soft, feminine-like subject.', '2012-02-10 18:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670586, 997411, 73942, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful</td>', 'this is beautiful', '2012-02-10 18:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670587, 993680, 94265, '<td valign="top">How adorable! He is almost lost amidst the patterns the water is making but not quite, he''s still sharp enough to stand out; if the water was a bold enough blue, I might have submitted this in colour to help the penguin pop more. A very good capture overall.</td>', 'How adorable! He is almost lost amidst the patterns the water is making but not quite, he''s still sharp enough to stand out; if the water was a bold enough blue, I might have submitted this in colour to help the penguin pop more. A very good capture overall.', '2012-02-10 18:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670588, 996747, 91783, '<td valign="top">this is really pretty. wonderful job with the colors and leaving that texture in there. superb job! (not voting)</td>', 'this is really pretty. wonderful job with the colors and leaving that texture in there. superb job! (not voting)', '2012-02-10 18:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670589, 996576, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is well-taken enough but seems a bit of a holiday snapshot to me, just not a very engaging subject. Nice vibrancy on the colours, perhaps a little strong on the cyans.</td>', 'This is well-taken enough but seems a bit of a holiday snapshot to me, just not a very engaging subject. Nice vibrancy on the colours, perhaps a little strong on the cyans.', '2012-02-10 18:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670590, 994149, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty little home but the shot is a bit snapshottish; the crop feels too tight, I think showing more of the surroundings might have brought more interest. The image could do with a wee bit of rotating to the left too.</td>', 'This is a pretty little home but the shot is a bit snapshottish; the crop feels too tight, I think showing more of the surroundings might have brought more interest. The image could do with a wee bit of rotating to the left too.', '2012-02-10 18:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670592, 994122, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, great focus on the little strands there on the green, a really great macro shot. The composition is good, although I wish a bit more of the petals were in view, purely because that red is gorgeous.</td>', 'Nice colours, great focus on the little strands there on the green, a really great macro shot. The composition is good, although I wish a bit more of the petals were in view, purely because that red is gorgeous.', '2012-02-10 18:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670593, 998157, 94265, '<td valign="top">Pretty skyline, good clarity; I wish the image were bigger, I''d like to see a shade more detail on the water and pier and I feel this size prevents that.</td>', 'Pretty skyline, good clarity; I wish the image were bigger, I''d like to see a shade more detail on the water and pier and I feel this size prevents that.', '2012-02-10 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670594, 998095, 94265, '<td valign="top">Impressive bike! Very nice clear shot, I kinda wish the older fellow in the background wasn''t there though as I find his pink hair needlessly distracting. I might have asked to photograph the man in the forground with his bike and without the other chap in the shot. Good focus and colours overall.</td>', 'Impressive bike! Very nice clear shot, I kinda wish the older fellow in the background wasn''t there though as I find his pink hair needlessly distracting. I might have asked to photograph the man in the forground with his bike and without the other chap in the shot. Good focus and colours overall.', '2012-02-10 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670598, 993604, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great job isolating her from the crowd; it''s an odd vantage point, I''m curious as to where you took this from. Good focus on her, an interesting image, she looks lost in thought as well as being seperate from the other people, makes the title work even better.</td>', 'Great job isolating her from the crowd; it''s an odd vantage point, I''m curious as to where you took this from. Good focus on her, an interesting image, she looks lost in thought as well as being seperate from the other people, makes the title work even better.', '2012-02-10 19:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670599, 996575, 73942, '<td valign="top">wonderful detail</td>', 'wonderful detail', '2012-02-10 19:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670600, 993917, 94265, '<td valign="top">What a vulgar and horrific piece of ''art'', lol. The shot is Ok in itself but the subject is unappealing and the crop is a bit tight. Perhaps pulling back and showing a bit more of the surroundings would have helped.</td>', 'What a vulgar and horrific piece of ''art'', lol. The shot is Ok in itself but the subject is unappealing and the crop is a bit tight. Perhaps pulling back and showing a bit more of the surroundings would have helped.', '2012-02-10 19:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670602, 997409, 73942, '<td valign="top">what a cutie</td>', 'what a cutie', '2012-02-10 19:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670605, 998157, 73942, '<td valign="top">Too bad this isn''t a little bigger, it''s a wonderful entry but may get voted down a little for bring smaller, can''t fully appreciate it.</td>', 'Too bad this isn''t a little bigger, it''s a wonderful entry but may get voted down a little for bring smaller, can''t fully appreciate it.', '2012-02-10 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
