(6670620, 996622, 113411, '<td valign="top">I love your pov. It is a very interesting shot!</td>', 'I love your pov. It is a very interesting shot!', '2012-02-10 19:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670623, 998139, 94265, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m sitting at the edge of one of these cliffs looking out over the scenery, it''s very peaceful and stunning, a rich range of colours. Great shot.</td>', 'I feel like I''m sitting at the edge of one of these cliffs looking out over the scenery, it''s very peaceful and stunning, a rich range of colours. Great shot.', '2012-02-10 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670625, 997693, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is really cute, their wee costumes are great and their poses are fab. Nice composition. I''m not sure about only one looking at the camera though, I wish either they all were looking or none of them.</td>', 'This is really cute, their wee costumes are great and their poses are fab. Nice composition. I''m not sure about only one looking at the camera though, I wish either they all were looking or none of them.', '2012-02-10 19:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670626, 995604, 94265, '<td valign="top">I quite like the processing here. Nice focus on the bridge, makes me wonder where it leads and what''s in the forest that might be worth venturing to see. A tad too hazy in the top left corner but otherwise, a very nice image.</td>', 'I quite like the processing here. Nice focus on the bridge, makes me wonder where it leads and what''s in the forest that might be worth venturing to see. A tad too hazy in the top left corner but otherwise, a very nice image.', '2012-02-10 19:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670627, 997323, 94265, '<td valign="top">A great range of angles created by the shadows and colours, the damaged house and colourful surroundings put me in mind of the Wizard of Oz, lol. Very nice.</td>', 'A great range of angles created by the shadows and colours, the damaged house and colourful surroundings put me in mind of the Wizard of Oz, lol. Very nice.', '2012-02-10 19:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670629, 998027, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is very sad and a little surreal. I can see what you''re going for here but it doesn''t quite work for me personally, for an emotional subject I prefer clear focus and details to really take everything in.</td>', 'This is very sad and a little surreal. I can see what you''re going for here but it doesn''t quite work for me personally, for an emotional subject I prefer clear focus and details to really take everything in.', '2012-02-10 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670630, 995633, 94265, '<td valign="top">A pleasing range of colours here.</td>', 'A pleasing range of colours here.', '2012-02-10 19:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670642, 993598, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the white hazy vignette but this is a very interesting image. Nice focus on the fence and those little leaves, the way they curl around the wire is akin to the ring curling around her finger; the image feels solemn, which makes me wonder about why she is there. Is her fiance coming, is she merely wearing a ring in hope that someone will one day come, is she standing at the gate to a cemetary where her deceased fiance is interred? Sorry for the arty farty ramble, haha; your shot just really made me ponder. Great job.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the white hazy vignette but this is a very interesting image. Nice focus on the fence and those little leaves, the way they curl around the wire is akin to the ring curling around her finger; the image feels solemn, which makes me wonder about why she is there. Is her fiance coming, is she merely wearing a ring in hope that someone will one day come, is she standing at the gate to a cemetary where her deceased fiance is interred? Sorry for the arty farty ramble, haha; your shot just really made me ponder. Great job.', '2012-02-10 19:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670649, 997410, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. So energetic. So fragile.</td>', 'Beautiful. So energetic. So fragile.', '2012-02-10 20:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670650, 993654, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Colors might be a little over the top.</td>', 'Beautiful. Colors might be a little over the top.', '2012-02-10 20:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670651, 994088, 76335, '<td valign="top">Skin is pale and makes him look -- pale. Is that a criticism? It started out as one. But I can''t really imagine this any other way. <br/> <br/>Yes.</td>', 'Skin is pale and makes him look -- pale. Is that a criticism? It started out as one. But I can''t really imagine this any other way.  Yes.', '2012-02-10 20:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670652, 997596, 73942, '<td valign="top">nice job on the long exposure, the water looks so silky</td>', 'nice job on the long exposure, the water looks so silky', '2012-02-10 20:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670653, 995975, 76335, '<td valign="top">Funny on the surface, but kind of sad the longer you take it in.</td>', 'Funny on the surface, but kind of sad the longer you take it in.', '2012-02-10 20:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670654, 996015, 73942, '<td valign="top">I love the detail on the leg hairs and the concentration on his face.</td>', 'I love the detail on the leg hairs and the concentration on his face.', '2012-02-10 20:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
