(6670660, 994088, 82707, '<td valign="top">Strong image, I like the processing, but the hair accross the eye is distracting. I keep looking at the hair, not the eyes.</td>', 'Strong image, I like the processing, but the hair accross the eye is distracting. I keep looking at the hair, not the eyes.', '2012-02-10 20:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
