(6670696, 997411, 124815, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait; we know it can''t look at us and yet, here it is hypnotizing us all!</td>', 'What a great portrait; we know it can''t look at us and yet, here it is hypnotizing us all!', '2012-02-10 20:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
