(6670790, 997882, 66641, '<td valign="top">"Not quite being able to make out the object under the tree is what makes me score this lower than I want to..."<br/> <br/>...was going to be my comment.  And then I thought, it doesn''t matter that I can''t tell what''s under the tree (although I''m guessing a cow?) It''s still beautiful.  It''s just a great shot.  So, scoring this as if I knew for sure that that is a cow.</td>', '"Not quite being able to make out the object under the tree is what makes me score this lower than I want to..." ...was going to be my comment.  And then I thought, it doesn''t matter that I can''t tell what''s under the tree (although I''m guessing a cow?) It''s still beautiful.  It''s just a great shot.  So, scoring this as if I knew for sure that that is a cow.', '2012-02-10 21:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670803, 994471, 43463, '<td valign="top">For dinner I ordered duck, <br/>but along come this bold, little cluck.<br/>She ruffled her feathers daring me to pluck <br/>I had to laugh for the silly exchange left me dumb-struck<br/>As for my meal, I realized I was out of luck. <br/> <br/>What a fun and playful portrait! You can''t help but smile:-)</td>', 'For dinner I ordered duck, but along come this bold, little cluck.She ruffled her feathers daring me to pluck I had to laugh for the silly exchange left me dumb-struckAs for my meal, I realized I was out of luck.  What a fun and playful portrait! You can''t help but smile:-)', '2012-02-10 21:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6670809, 998065, 43463, '<td valign="top">Against the darkness,<br/>We trumpet our floral beauty.<br/>To nature''s rhythmic music,<br/>we unfurl our petal skirts and twirl.<br/> <br/>The colors pop visually off the dark backdrop and it calls our attention the beauty and interesting shape of this flower.</td>', 'Against the darkness,We trumpet our floral beauty.To nature''s rhythmic music,we unfurl our petal skirts and twirl. The colors pop visually off the dark backdrop and it calls our attention the beauty and interesting shape of this flower.', '2012-02-10 21:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
