(6670843, 994237, 43463, '<td valign="top">Investigating if my roses had matured,<br/>I came upon a little ladybird.<br/>I stopped &amp; watched her crawl around.<br/>My curiosity abound,<br/>I drew out my magnifying glass<br/>and gasped for she was a hairy lass!<br/> <br/>There are some AMAZING details in this shot! Great macro shot - I love how this little insect has hairs that are as fine as the hairs on the leaf of that rosebud.</td>', 'Investigating if my roses had matured,I came upon a little ladybird.I stopped & watched her crawl around.My curiosity abound,I drew out my magnifying glassand gasped for she was a hairy lass! There are some AMAZING details in this shot! Great macro shot - I love how this little insect has hairs that are as fine as the hairs on the leaf of that rosebud.', '2012-02-10 22:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
