(6670910, 995245, 43463, '<td valign="top">Like swans, they dance &amp; twirl in the spotlight.<br/>I picture myself dressed in their white plumage.<br/>Arms extended to the sky and ready to take flight.<br/>I watch and wait in the wings.<br/> <br/>What a fortuitous capture! I love how the little girl looks on from offstage. It makes me think of Swan Lake and she is the little cygnet waiting her turn to take flight on stage.</td>', 'Like swans, they dance & twirl in the spotlight.I picture myself dressed in their white plumage.Arms extended to the sky and ready to take flight.I watch and wait in the wings. What a fortuitous capture! I love how the little girl looks on from offstage. It makes me think of Swan Lake and she is the little cygnet waiting her turn to take flight on stage.', '2012-02-10 23:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
