(6670924, 995265, 103032, '<td valign="top">Lighting makes this seem sterile. For how the model is presented, I think moodier lighting (more shadows surrounding her, less light) would have made this more alluring. Just one opinion of course.<br/>Pose is fine, like the eye contact. Perhaps consider the framing a bit more as to not have the wood flooring show.</td>', 'Lighting makes this seem sterile. For how the model is presented, I think moodier lighting (more shadows surrounding her, less light) would have made this more alluring. Just one opinion of course.Pose is fine, like the eye contact. Perhaps consider the framing a bit more as to not have the wood flooring show.', '2012-02-10 23:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
