(6671323, 997409, 43463, '<td valign="top">"The best things come to those who wait," he thought annoyed as he sat down in a huff. "It''s so easy for the big people to tell a little kid that. Waiting takes foooreeevvvver!" he grumpily plopped his head in his hands.<br/> <br/>I love the emotion in the face and pose of this little boy that tells a story!</td>', '"The best things come to those who wait," he thought annoyed as he sat down in a huff. "It''s so easy for the big people to tell a little kid that. Waiting takes foooreeevvvver!" he grumpily plopped his head in his hands. I love the emotion in the face and pose of this little boy that tells a story!', '2012-02-11 11:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671337, 997676, 43463, '<td valign="top">Branches stretch to the sky.<br/>Roots radiate out across earth.<br/>I thirst for touch<br/>of my fellow kind.<br/>In sight, but far from reach.<br/> <br/>What struck me as interesting in this shot is that the tree in the foreground seems to be reaching out in branch, root, and even the shadow to it tree brethren scattered far apart in the landscape. It makes the scene even more parch and desolate.</td>', 'Branches stretch to the sky.Roots radiate out across earth.I thirst for touchof my fellow kind.In sight, but far from reach. What struck me as interesting in this shot is that the tree in the foreground seems to be reaching out in branch, root, and even the shadow to it tree brethren scattered far apart in the landscape. It makes the scene even more parch and desolate.', '2012-02-11 11:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671339, 993654, 43463, '<td valign="top">I alone must walk the inner path.<br/>The tracks to enlightment <br/>lay before me as I meditate in the rain.<br/>It is my train of thought <br/>that carries me forward.<br/> <br/>I love the little slice of life you present here that captures a different culture and place. The train tracks can be a symbol for the path traveled in a spiritual trek to enlightenment. I wonder what thoughts travel through this monk''s mind as he travels along the train tracks.</td>', 'I alone must walk the inner path.The tracks to enlightment lay before me as I meditate in the rain.It is my train of thought that carries me forward. I love the little slice of life you present here that captures a different culture and place. The train tracks can be a symbol for the path traveled in a spiritual trek to enlightenment. I wonder what thoughts travel through this monk''s mind as he travels along the train tracks.', '2012-02-11 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
