(6671481, 996162, 43463, '<td valign="top">The journey home is a melody<br/>It rises with the high notes<br/>and dips with the low ones.<br/>Footfalls like beats <br/>on the measure of the road.<br/> <br/> <br/>The desat processing effectively focuses my attention instantly on the man with the guitar. He is the only element with some color. The road ahead is symbolic I feel for it is not just the physical journey home, but the musical one to attain validation and recognition as a musician.</td>', 'The journey home is a melodyIt rises with the high notesand dips with the low ones.Footfalls like beats on the measure of the road.  The desat processing effectively focuses my attention instantly on the man with the guitar. He is the only element with some color. The road ahead is symbolic I feel for it is not just the physical journey home, but the musical one to attain validation and recognition as a musician.', '2012-02-11 14:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671484, 997543, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a gorgeous little owl.</td>', 'Nice capture of a gorgeous little owl.', '2012-02-11 14:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
