(6671492, 994169, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus on a beautiful animal, you''ve caught some great details on her; the heavily burnt spots at the top left corner bother me some, I think I''d have actually rather seen the blown highlights of sun. The detail is so good on the elephant''s face that they wouldn''t have been particularly distracting.</td>', 'Very nice focus on a beautiful animal, you''ve caught some great details on her; the heavily burnt spots at the top left corner bother me some, I think I''d have actually rather seen the blown highlights of sun. The detail is so good on the elephant''s face that they wouldn''t have been particularly distracting.', '2012-02-11 14:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671493, 994889, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great job on cloning out the liscence plate. Something looks a bit odd on the back hubcap though, it might just be a funny light reflection but it''s almost like half of the cap is displaced. Still, good image, a very nice product shot in a pretty location.</td>', 'Great job on cloning out the liscence plate. Something looks a bit odd on the back hubcap though, it might just be a funny light reflection but it''s almost like half of the cap is displaced. Still, good image, a very nice product shot in a pretty location.', '2012-02-11 14:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671496, 995870, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very good for a first attempt, the colours are a bit strong for me personally (saturation looks too high) but you caught the droplet in very clear focus, well done.</td>', 'Very good for a first attempt, the colours are a bit strong for me personally (saturation looks too high) but you caught the droplet in very clear focus, well done.', '2012-02-11 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671497, 996747, 30364, '<td valign="top">I almost didn''t like it, then I did.  I have seen this picture before, sans fille.  The cat didn''t catch a fish then either.  It''s better this way, with the pretty girl, as is almost everything.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'I almost didn''t like it, then I did.  I have seen this picture before, sans fille.  The cat didn''t catch a fish then either.  It''s better this way, with the pretty girl, as is almost everything.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671498, 995766, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the crop, I like simple portraits like these to be more centered personally but it''s a very nice, clear shot of a lovely little lady.</td>', 'Not sure about the crop, I like simple portraits like these to be more centered personally but it''s a very nice, clear shot of a lovely little lady.', '2012-02-11 14:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
