(6671502, 997882, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture of the single cow lying under the tree (strange windswept trees like this always look awesome to me in photos) and it feels very moody and almost surreal. The sky is awfully dark and sort of overbearing, I''m not sure what time of day you took this but I might have tried to shoot with a lighter sky (or possibly dodged it a bit in PP.) Great shot overall though, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very cool capture of the single cow lying under the tree (strange windswept trees like this always look awesome to me in photos) and it feels very moody and almost surreal. The sky is awfully dark and sort of overbearing, I''m not sure what time of day you took this but I might have tried to shoot with a lighter sky (or possibly dodged it a bit in PP.) Great shot overall though, I like it a lot.', '2012-02-11 14:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671506, 995087, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, the rock formation is interesting and the blue of the sky and water is very pretty.</td>', 'Lovely shot, the rock formation is interesting and the blue of the sky and water is very pretty.', '2012-02-11 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671509, 993604, 30364, '<td valign="top">So weird, these tight clusters of people, as if they are involved in some wacky Japanese TV game show.  Perhaps the nonconformist is about to get bonked on the head by a giant polystyrene cupcake.  Or perhaps not, and I''m just foolishly toying with your excellent &amp; interesting picture.  It''s fun either way.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'So weird, these tight clusters of people, as if they are involved in some wacky Japanese TV game show.  Perhaps the nonconformist is about to get bonked on the head by a giant polystyrene cupcake.  Or perhaps not, and I''m just foolishly toying with your excellent & interesting picture.  It''s fun either way.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671511, 997875, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, very sweet image.</td>', 'Nice focus, very sweet image.', '2012-02-11 14:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671512, 994113, 94265, '<td valign="top">This one must be doing well; lovely vibrant colours, great clarity and sharpness, non-intrusive bokeh and a groovy subject. Well done.</td>', 'This one must be doing well; lovely vibrant colours, great clarity and sharpness, non-intrusive bokeh and a groovy subject. Well done.', '2012-02-11 14:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671513, 998191, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very lovely, simple, subtly lit, and altogether elegant and restrained.  All admirable though rare qualities in DPC portraits.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'Very lovely, simple, subtly lit, and altogether elegant and restrained.  All admirable though rare qualities in DPC portraits.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671515, 997171, 94265, '<td valign="top">This made me smile!</td>', 'This made me smile!', '2012-02-11 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671517, 998170, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the face, beautiful little bird, well done.</td>', 'Nice focus on the face, beautiful little bird, well done.', '2012-02-11 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671519, 996979, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love these birds, they''re so beautiful. The sunlight and shadows combined with the ruffles from preening makes lots of cool patterns on its back. Good job.</td>', 'I love these birds, they''re so beautiful. The sunlight and shadows combined with the ruffles from preening makes lots of cool patterns on its back. Good job.', '2012-02-11 14:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671520, 997409, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think his hat is a shade too big, lol. Cute image, love his little outfit. Nicely exposed too. I just wish there wasn''t hair in front of both his eyes, which kinda spoils the eye contact for me.</td>', 'I think his hat is a shade too big, lol. Cute image, love his little outfit. Nicely exposed too. I just wish there wasn''t hair in front of both his eyes, which kinda spoils the eye contact for me.', '2012-02-11 14:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671521, 993782, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s wickedly good!  I like everything about it; it''s a brilliant parody of itself.  And I love that negligent, ''after-midnight'' blue cast to it.  As if you have discounted the light.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'Oh that''s wickedly good!  I like everything about it; it''s a brilliant parody of itself.  And I love that negligent, ''after-midnight'' blue cast to it.  As if you have discounted the light.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671522, 997201, 30364, '<td valign="top">Edward Hopper played in reverse!  A picture filled with living.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'Edward Hopper played in reverse!  A picture filled with living.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671525, 998027, 30364, '<td valign="top">Crikey!  That''s spare, ain''t it?  My first thought was that it is a picture of Cormac McCarthy''s prose.  Thus I love it.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'Crikey!  That''s spare, ain''t it?  My first thought was that it is a picture of Cormac McCarthy''s prose.  Thus I love it.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671526, 995245, 30364, '<td valign="top">Cute. I don''t mind cute occasionally.  But only <i>very</i> occasionally, and even then only if done with some wit &amp; style.  Which this is.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'Cute. I don''t mind cute occasionally.  But only very occasionally, and even then only if done with some wit & style.  Which this is.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671527, 997882, 30364, '<td valign="top">Marge Simpson as tree.  Terrific!  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'Marge Simpson as tree.  Terrific!  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671530, 996566, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great light.  Thank you.  7.<br/> <br/>P.S.  Title seems inconsonant, like hanging fluffy dice in an Aston Martin.</td>', 'Great light.  Thank you.  7. P.S.  Title seems inconsonant, like hanging fluffy dice in an Aston Martin.', '2012-02-11 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671531, 997541, 30364, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know I liked it until I read the title.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'I didn''t know I liked it until I read the title.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671532, 997976, 30364, '<td valign="top">Seems weirdly suitable, and certainly a blessed relief from all those meticulously anal Ansel Adams style mountain pictures.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'Seems weirdly suitable, and certainly a blessed relief from all those meticulously anal Ansel Adams style mountain pictures.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671534, 994089, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a radio telescope (isn''t it?).  In which case the rendering of the sky is perfect for the subject.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'It''s a radio telescope (isn''t it?).  In which case the rendering of the sky is perfect for the subject.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
