(6671539, 996871, 30364, '<td valign="top">A bit freaky, but I like that in a girl.  Well, in a <i>photograph</i> of a girl.  Thank you.  7.</td>', 'A bit freaky, but I like that in a girl.  Well, in a photograph of a girl.  Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 14:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
