(6671545, 997741, 94265, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, perhaps a teeny bit dull light-wise but great nonetheless; crisp focus, clear details, awesome subject. Good work.</td>', 'Excellent shot, perhaps a teeny bit dull light-wise but great nonetheless; crisp focus, clear details, awesome subject. Good work.', '2012-02-11 14:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671549, 994088, 94265, '<td valign="top">Amusing, good focus, I like the muted tones. I would have taken out that hair in front of his eye though as it really grabs my attention.</td>', 'Amusing, good focus, I like the muted tones. I would have taken out that hair in front of his eye though as it really grabs my attention.', '2012-02-11 14:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671550, 997435, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Fantastic crisp focus, so much detail on the fur/hair. Lovely subject, great work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Fantastic crisp focus, so much detail on the fur/hair. Lovely subject, great work.', '2012-02-11 14:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671551, 994167, 30364, '<td valign="top">A rodeo picture I have never seen before.  The perfectly timed instant of the ''dogger dropping reveals what a surprisingly slow dance happens inside these few wild seconds. Thank you.  7.</td>', 'A rodeo picture I have never seen before.  The perfectly timed instant of the ''dogger dropping reveals what a surprisingly slow dance happens inside these few wild seconds. Thank you.  7.', '2012-02-11 15:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671555, 995862, 94265, '<td valign="top">Brilliant use of selective colour. Interesting patterns, love the lighting, overall a fantastic shot!</td>', 'Brilliant use of selective colour. Interesting patterns, love the lighting, overall a fantastic shot!', '2012-02-11 15:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671560, 997258, 94265, '<td valign="top">I find that face-pillow on the left a bit of a distraction, I''d have rather it was cut out of the shot and instead, a little more visible on the right so the woman wasn''t cropped through the arm. Very sweet moment though, mummy looks so happy; the little girl''s expression is priceless, it''s almost like she''s saying, Ok I tried, can we take it back now? Lol. Adorable.</td>', 'I find that face-pillow on the left a bit of a distraction, I''d have rather it was cut out of the shot and instead, a little more visible on the right so the woman wasn''t cropped through the arm. Very sweet moment though, mummy looks so happy; the little girl''s expression is priceless, it''s almost like she''s saying, Ok I tried, can we take it back now? Lol. Adorable.', '2012-02-11 15:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671564, 995125, 94265, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, I like the dark hair over her face, reminds me of typical Korean horror movies (which I love.) The image is a bit noisy though and the focus isn''t very strong. I think a less square crop would have been good too, maybe showing a little more of her surroundings, this crop doesn''t leave me much to wonder about - is she trapped in the corner, is she alone in the room, etc.</td>', 'Interesting idea, I like the dark hair over her face, reminds me of typical Korean horror movies (which I love.) The image is a bit noisy though and the focus isn''t very strong. I think a less square crop would have been good too, maybe showing a little more of her surroundings, this crop doesn''t leave me much to wonder about - is she trapped in the corner, is she alone in the room, etc.', '2012-02-11 15:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671571, 993927, 94265, '<td valign="top">Lovely pet portrait. Great composition, I love that the cat nearly fills the frame and is looking straight at us. She/he is a beautiful colour too. Well done!</td>', 'Lovely pet portrait. Great composition, I love that the cat nearly fills the frame and is looking straight at us. She/he is a beautiful colour too. Well done!', '2012-02-11 15:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671573, 995297, 94265, '<td valign="top">Always nice to see something different, I like the focus on the eyes even though I feel this could be sharper overall.</td>', 'Always nice to see something different, I like the focus on the eyes even though I feel this could be sharper overall.', '2012-02-11 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671574, 997002, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and clear focus, a very pretty image.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and clear focus, a very pretty image.', '2012-02-11 15:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671578, 996203, 94265, '<td valign="top">Interesting set-up, makes me curious as to what''s going on here; I can''t fathom it out but I like it. Nice tones and lighting, I don''t normally care for a through-the-face crop but it works here.</td>', 'Interesting set-up, makes me curious as to what''s going on here; I can''t fathom it out but I like it. Nice tones and lighting, I don''t normally care for a through-the-face crop but it works here.', '2012-02-11 15:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671579, 994027, 94265, '<td valign="top">A very pretty street scene, silhouetted figures going about their business at a beautiful time of day, very nice.</td>', 'A very pretty street scene, silhouetted figures going about their business at a beautiful time of day, very nice.', '2012-02-11 15:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671580, 995761, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, delicate and feminine image. I love the soft colours. I could see this selling well as a wall print. Well done.</td>', 'Very beautiful, delicate and feminine image. I love the soft colours. I could see this selling well as a wall print. Well done.', '2012-02-11 15:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6671581, 997411, 94265, '<td valign="top">The eyes look kinda ''dead'' with no catchlights, which is a shame as it spoils the shot a bit for me; still, I like the processing otherwise, very nice focus on his face, good composition, a beautiful animal.</td>', 'The eyes look kinda ''dead'' with no catchlights, which is a shame as it spoils the shot a bit for me; still, I like the processing otherwise, very nice focus on his face, good composition, a beautiful animal.', '2012-02-11 15:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
