(6672044, 998151, 30982, '<td valign="top">I swear I just saw this same scene.  Is that a waterfall about a third up from the bottom and in from the right?  Great sky and I like the dusting of snow.</td>', 'I swear I just saw this same scene.  Is that a waterfall about a third up from the bottom and in from the right?  Great sky and I like the dusting of snow.', '2012-02-11 22:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
