(6672217, 998140, 43463, '<td valign="top">He stopped and stood at the crossroads. "How like life''s path are these stairs," he contemplated, "Choose the higher path, and the climb is difficult. Or choose the lower path, and the descent is easy." Moments passed like heartbeats. He drew in a deep breath and cast his glance at the climb.<br/> <br/>You have a keen eye to see this moment in time. It is very symbolic of paths chosen in life.</td>', 'He stopped and stood at the crossroads. "How like life''s path are these stairs," he contemplated, "Choose the higher path, and the climb is difficult. Or choose the lower path, and the descent is easy." Moments passed like heartbeats. He drew in a deep breath and cast his glance at the climb. You have a keen eye to see this moment in time. It is very symbolic of paths chosen in life.', '2012-02-12 00:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6672261, 994610, 25773, '<td valign="top">Colors are well-balanced and it''s a view I am quite familiar with. I just wish it was a little more sharper (could be that the Erzsebet Bridge being a simple suspension bridge was just not still enough for the long night exposure).</td>', 'Colors are well-balanced and it''s a view I am quite familiar with. I just wish it was a little more sharper (could be that the Erzsebet Bridge being a simple suspension bridge was just not still enough for the long night exposure).', '2012-02-12 00:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6672280, 993697, 30364, '<td valign="top">So many unexpected twists and turns to this picture.  Macro clever, micro clever, title clever.  Thank you.  8.</td>', 'So many unexpected twists and turns to this picture.  Macro clever, micro clever, title clever.  Thank you.  8.', '2012-02-12 01:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6672281, 997842, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I love street, even though it''s often just like blues music ... the same old chord progression given yet one more interpretation.  And this is a classic street theme, with the echoes of the three girls.  The thing is, the echoes are so pure here that it still stands above the ordinary in street shots.  Thank you.  8.</td>', 'Well I love street, even though it''s often just like blues music ... the same old chord progression given yet one more interpretation.  And this is a classic street theme, with the echoes of the three girls.  The thing is, the echoes are so pure here that it still stands above the ordinary in street shots.  Thank you.  8.', '2012-02-12 01:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6672283, 997844, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully circular, is that path this picture takes us on.  It seems to be a contradiction, but really I think it''s a sort of gentle irony.  There''s a lovely ''hoist with his own petard'' sense to it.  Thank you.  8.</td>', 'Wonderfully circular, is that path this picture takes us on.  It seems to be a contradiction, but really I think it''s a sort of gentle irony.  There''s a lovely ''hoist with his own petard'' sense to it.  Thank you.  8.', '2012-02-12 02:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6672291, 996622, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  What I most admire is the ordering of the ''weights'' of the various elements of the picture.  I think of a piano:  left hand at the left, firm and solid; and right hand at the right, bright and airy.  I''m rarely interested in good photography for its own sake, but this shakes me up a bit.  Thank you.  8.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  What I most admire is the ordering of the ''weights'' of the various elements of the picture.  I think of a piano:  left hand at the left, firm and solid; and right hand at the right, bright and airy.  I''m rarely interested in good photography for its own sake, but this shakes me up a bit.  Thank you.  8.', '2012-02-12 02:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6672295, 996310, 30364, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of charm in this picture.  Not least is the way the calf takes the easy track while the person persists with the awkward side of the road.  It''s a simple, lovely picture.  Thank you.  8.</td>', 'There''s a lot of charm in this picture.  Not least is the way the calf takes the easy track while the person persists with the awkward side of the road.  It''s a simple, lovely picture.  Thank you.  8.', '2012-02-12 02:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
