(6672865, 995223, 43463, '<td valign="top">Sarah watched the little sandpipers dart long the sand. Off in the distance was the Pier where she knew her uncle was fishing. He never came down to the shoreline to walk the beach as that he did not like to get wet. The dinner table that evening was sure to have tuna or whatever he caught this afternoon. How ironic she thought, "Funny how we build things to fish on, while these little sandpipers do not fear getting their feet wet when fishing for food."<br/> <br/>Lovely and scenic landscape. Love the soft glow of light upon the birds, sand, and the pier.</td>', 'Sarah watched the little sandpipers dart long the sand. Off in the distance was the Pier where she knew her uncle was fishing. He never came down to the shoreline to walk the beach as that he did not like to get wet. The dinner table that evening was sure to have tuna or whatever he caught this afternoon. How ironic she thought, "Funny how we build things to fish on, while these little sandpipers do not fear getting their feet wet when fishing for food." Lovely and scenic landscape. Love the soft glow of light upon the birds, sand, and the pier.', '2012-02-12 13:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
