(6673169, 997650, 43463, '<td valign="top">Perched on high above the ocean waves,<br/>early morning chill these men brave.<br/>Time and tide marks the hours.<br/>They patiently fish from their wooden towers.<br/> <br/>This is an absolutely wonderful capture of a slice of life of another culture!!! I love the fishing action of these men that range from sitting, casting the rod, and standing. Wonderful details and the B&amp;W is excellently done; tones are very dynamic. Photo is akin to something I could see in National Geographic magazine...I just love learning new things and seeing new places.</td>', 'Perched on high above the ocean waves,early morning chill these men brave.Time and tide marks the hours.They patiently fish from their wooden towers. This is an absolutely wonderful capture of a slice of life of another culture!!! I love the fishing action of these men that range from sitting, casting the rod, and standing. Wonderful details and the B&W is excellently done; tones are very dynamic. Photo is akin to something I could see in National Geographic magazine...I just love learning new things and seeing new places.', '2012-02-12 18:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
