(6673263, 998188, 114285, '<td valign="top">I love the way the water looks, it''s quite alive. THe golden mountains are spectacular as well, bump.</td>', 'I love the way the water looks, it''s quite alive. THe golden mountains are spectacular as well, bump.', '2012-02-12 19:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6673287, 995056, 43463, '<td valign="top">Winter''s chill doth sing me to sleep.<br/>The Frost Queen no longer has cause to weep.<br/>Her snowflake quilt enfolds me with a gentile sweep,<br/>for I am the child she has chosen to keep.<br/> <br/>The blue-white tones really help invoke the cold chill of the scene. The girl looks peaceful as if she is sleeping in the comfort of her bed...dreaming. Perhaps...perhaps that is because she is the chosen child of the barren Winter Queen.</td>', 'Winter''s chill doth sing me to sleep.The Frost Queen no longer has cause to weep.Her snowflake quilt enfolds me with a gentile sweep,for I am the child she has chosen to keep. The blue-white tones really help invoke the cold chill of the scene. The girl looks peaceful as if she is sleeping in the comfort of her bed...dreaming. Perhaps...perhaps that is because she is the chosen child of the barren Winter Queen.', '2012-02-12 20:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6673296, 998027, 142483, '<td valign="top">Oh wow... very haunting. I usually don''t like blurred shots, but this one is so well suited, great shot</td>', 'Oh wow... very haunting. I usually don''t like blurred shots, but this one is so well suited, great shot', '2012-02-12 20:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6673300, 995800, 142483, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2012-02-12 20:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6673302, 995389, 76335, '<td valign="top">Futuristic. Love the purple glow.</td>', 'Futuristic. Love the purple glow.', '2012-02-12 20:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6673303, 994863, 76335, '<td valign="top">Still sickens me. Great document.</td>', 'Still sickens me. Great document.', '2012-02-12 20:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6673304, 993604, 43463, '<td valign="top">I leave the safety of the curb<br/>to venture across the street.<br/>It is as in life, <br/>there are those who choose<br/>to stand apart from the crowd.<br/> <br/>Great eye to spot this symbolic moment. Isolated - there are two perceptions that can be read here. Is she isolated because the crowd has banished/excluded? Or is she a risk taker? Is she one who has chosen to stand apart from the crowd to achieve success by venturing to the other side of the road?</td>', 'I leave the safety of the curbto venture across the street.It is as in life, there are those who chooseto stand apart from the crowd. Great eye to spot this symbolic moment. Isolated - there are two perceptions that can be read here. Is she isolated because the crowd has banished/excluded? Or is she a risk taker? Is she one who has chosen to stand apart from the crowd to achieve success by venturing to the other side of the road?', '2012-02-12 20:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6673305, 995633, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s Allegheny General, I think. Someone''s been on Moutn Washington. Nice one. I can almost see my office.</td>', 'That''s Allegheny General, I think. Someone''s been on Moutn Washington. Nice one. I can almost see my office.', '2012-02-12 20:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
