(6673358, 994663, 43774, '<td valign="top">The same place as this National Geographic photo it looks like. Nice!!<br/> <br/><a href="//photography.nationalgeographic.com/photography/photo-of-the-day/camel-thorn-trees-namibia/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//photography.nationalgeographic.com/photography/photo-of-the-day/camel-thorn-trees-namibia/</a></td>', 'The same place as this National Geographic photo it looks like. Nice!! //photography.nationalgeographic.com/photography/photo-of-the-day/camel-thorn-trees-namibia/', '2012-02-12 21:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
