(6673397, 997779, 83313, '<td valign="top">At 16 cycles, all males in tribe of Grog partake of great challunge to prove braveness. First part of challunge is to defeat hungry sharptooth tyger with only feather for weapon. (Grog tell you seekret is to find tickel spot beneath chin, but don''t tell youngling.) Second part of challenge is hard. Youngling must find gurl in tribe of widest hip and biggest breast and ask for date. If gurl aksepts, then must meet parunts. Few survive.</td>', 'At 16 cycles, all males in tribe of Grog partake of great challunge to prove braveness. First part of challunge is to defeat hungry sharptooth tyger with only feather for weapon. (Grog tell you seekret is to find tickel spot beneath chin, but don''t tell youngling.) Second part of challenge is hard. Youngling must find gurl in tribe of widest hip and biggest breast and ask for date. If gurl aksepts, then must meet parunts. Few survive.', '2012-02-12 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
