(6675015, 994167, 144202, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captures the moment. One can almost hear the thumping of the hooves. Love this picture.</td>', 'Beautifully captures the moment. One can almost hear the thumping of the hooves. Love this picture.', '2012-02-13 20:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
