(6675066, 997844, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh how I wish this was larger!  You can have up to 800 pixels on the long side (vertical in this case).  I like the layers, and trying to figure what goes where.  Intriguing!</td>', 'Oh how I wish this was larger!  You can have up to 800 pixels on the long side (vertical in this case).  I like the layers, and trying to figure what goes where.  Intriguing!', '2012-02-13 20:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
