(6675072, 997101, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really a very enjoyable photograph to visit.  The mass of the people in shadow, in dark and undistinguished clothes.  The two young ladies foreground, one in a bright red hat, sharing a secret, and that amazingly colorful structure completely at odds with its surroundings.</td>', 'Really a very enjoyable photograph to visit.  The mass of the people in shadow, in dark and undistinguished clothes.  The two young ladies foreground, one in a bright red hat, sharing a secret, and that amazingly colorful structure completely at odds with its surroundings.', '2012-02-13 20:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
