(6675140, 996203, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure that nutcases writing manifestos wear a coat and tie but it gives it an interesting noir aspect.  I do like the typewriter.  That does seem fitting to non-geek manifesto-writing types.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure that nutcases writing manifestos wear a coat and tie but it gives it an interesting noir aspect.  I do like the typewriter.  That does seem fitting to non-geek manifesto-writing types.', '2012-02-13 21:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
