(6675163, 994663, 86799, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic in the truest sense of the word.  So unreal, but convincing.  The composition yields high drama, warning of certain death.</td>', 'This is fantastic in the truest sense of the word.  So unreal, but convincing.  The composition yields high drama, warning of certain death.', '2012-02-13 21:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
