(6675405, 993778, 96751, '<td valign="top">In abstracts such as this, we try to grasp at something to make sense of it all.  We search the archives for hints of familiarity at the shapes, follow the direction of the blurs, investigate the tiny shards of sharpness scattered throughout.  I love this sort of exploration because suddenly, from the midst of chaos, rises an eye, a glance, a profound emotion.  This is brilliant.</td>', 'In abstracts such as this, we try to grasp at something to make sense of it all.  We search the archives for hints of familiarity at the shapes, follow the direction of the blurs, investigate the tiny shards of sharpness scattered throughout.  I love this sort of exploration because suddenly, from the midst of chaos, rises an eye, a glance, a profound emotion.  This is brilliant.', '2012-02-13 23:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
