(6675722, 994730, 119012, '<td valign="top">the skin smoothing is a little too much, i think you need to let a little more natural texture show through in the cheeks.</td>', 'the skin smoothing is a little too much, i think you need to let a little more natural texture show through in the cheeks.', '2012-02-14 07:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
