(6675754, 997397, 119012, '<td valign="top">seems like it out of focus on the spot where my eye goes first, at that the bottom third point, at the base of the leaf</td>', 'seems like it out of focus on the spot where my eye goes first, at that the bottom third point, at the base of the leaf', '2012-02-14 07:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675755, 996148, 118154, '<td valign="top">Weird how it looks all out of perspective.Fantastic image.</td>', 'Weird how it looks all out of perspective.Fantastic image.', '2012-02-14 07:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675756, 997776, 119012, '<td valign="top">it looks like to pushed the colors of the jackets too much and its distracting me from be able to look at the trees</td>', 'it looks like to pushed the colors of the jackets too much and its distracting me from be able to look at the trees', '2012-02-14 07:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675757, 997882, 118154, '<td valign="top">Classy shot.</td>', 'Classy shot.', '2012-02-14 07:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675759, 997596, 119012, '<td valign="top">thi would make a great desktop wallpaper. i love the details and colors in the rocks and the blur of the water over them is just enough.</td>', 'thi would make a great desktop wallpaper. i love the details and colors in the rocks and the blur of the water over them is just enough.', '2012-02-14 07:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675761, 996644, 119012, '<td valign="top">lots of great details and the sky isn''t distracting at all. it almost has a storm approaching feel to it.</td>', 'lots of great details and the sky isn''t distracting at all. it almost has a storm approaching feel to it.', '2012-02-14 07:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675763, 997759, 119012, '<td valign="top">i almost fell out of my chair.<br/> <br/>those eyes are awesome and that grin is even better.</td>', 'i almost fell out of my chair. those eyes are awesome and that grin is even better.', '2012-02-14 07:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675766, 997123, 119012, '<td valign="top">like i commented to someone else. this is a snapshot of someones elses art, you need to add your own spin to it to make it an interesting picture to me.<br/> <br/>perspective, better composition, adding some other subject (like a bird, for instance) or even make the lighting itself the subject.</td>', 'like i commented to someone else. this is a snapshot of someones elses art, you need to add your own spin to it to make it an interesting picture to me. perspective, better composition, adding some other subject (like a bird, for instance) or even make the lighting itself the subject.', '2012-02-14 07:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675768, 997201, 119012, '<td valign="top">lacking a distinct focal point.</td>', 'lacking a distinct focal point.', '2012-02-14 07:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675770, 995850, 119012, '<td valign="top">maybe a bit lighter, its too heavy on shadows and there is some great texture being lost</td>', 'maybe a bit lighter, its too heavy on shadows and there is some great texture being lost', '2012-02-14 07:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675771, 997085, 119012, '<td valign="top">seriously lacking in sharpness and detail in the trees.</td>', 'seriously lacking in sharpness and detail in the trees.', '2012-02-14 07:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675772, 996566, 119012, '<td valign="top">i''d like it much more it it was framed better and not so dead center.</td>', 'i''d like it much more it it was framed better and not so dead center.', '2012-02-14 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675774, 998170, 119012, '<td valign="top">too dark and not enough detail.</td>', 'too dark and not enough detail.', '2012-02-14 07:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675776, 997232, 129807, '<td valign="top">Lovely - serene.</td>', 'Lovely - serene.', '2012-02-14 08:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675777, 994053, 129807, '<td valign="top">The wing detail is excellent, as are the eyes.</td>', 'The wing detail is excellent, as are the eyes.', '2012-02-14 08:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675778, 997672, 119012, '<td valign="top">i think you need to focus on the beauty of one of the subjects here, either the flowers or the dew drops, as it stands there is too much of everything and the beauty gets lost</td>', 'i think you need to focus on the beauty of one of the subjects here, either the flowers or the dew drops, as it stands there is too much of everything and the beauty gets lost', '2012-02-14 08:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675780, 996605, 129807, '<td valign="top">S/he obviously loves doing this!</td>', 'S/he obviously loves doing this!', '2012-02-14 08:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675782, 994269, 119012, '<td valign="top">really nice autumn feel to this one, being windmills i like to see less foreground and more sky. for instance if you put the windmill on the bottom left third point.</td>', 'really nice autumn feel to this one, being windmills i like to see less foreground and more sky. for instance if you put the windmill on the bottom left third point.', '2012-02-14 08:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675785, 998150, 129807, '<td valign="top">The beast behind the gate doesn''t much care for the ones in front! To my eye, the focus is soft but this may be what you were chasing.</td>', 'The beast behind the gate doesn''t much care for the ones in front! To my eye, the focus is soft but this may be what you were chasing.', '2012-02-14 08:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675787, 997941, 119012, '<td valign="top">the saturation is way overdone. it might actually be better is you made a black and white and cropped out just over the waves and focus on the fog and rocks.</td>', 'the saturation is way overdone. it might actually be better is you made a black and white and cropped out just over the waves and focus on the fog and rocks.', '2012-02-14 08:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675788, 997410, 129807, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours. I like the way the sky almost blends completely with the water, but still retains just enough separation.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours. I like the way the sky almost blends completely with the water, but still retains just enough separation.', '2012-02-14 08:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675789, 997874, 119012, '<td valign="top">you have some processing halos around the building and structure. the tilt works really well.</td>', 'you have some processing halos around the building and structure. the tilt works really well.', '2012-02-14 08:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675791, 993927, 119012, '<td valign="top">didn''t you already win a ribbon with this cat?</td>', 'didn''t you already win a ribbon with this cat?', '2012-02-14 08:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675792, 996986, 129807, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice focus and a tick for the humour/unusual element.</td>', 'Good composition, nice focus and a tick for the humour/unusual element.', '2012-02-14 08:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675793, 997232, 119012, '<td valign="top">i think it would have been better in black and white</td>', 'i think it would have been better in black and white', '2012-02-14 08:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675794, 995727, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.</td>', 'Excellent portrait.', '2012-02-14 08:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675795, 995985, 119012, '<td valign="top">that a great perspective for rock show. i may have liked to see the focus point elsewhere then where you picked.</td>', 'that a great perspective for rock show. i may have liked to see the focus point elsewhere then where you picked.', '2012-02-14 08:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675796, 995627, 119012, '<td valign="top">put the topaz away.</td>', 'put the topaz away.', '2012-02-14 08:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675798, 997874, 129807, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, terrific reflection (obviously). I''m not sure, but I think I can see some sensor dust type marks? One on the bean, a few in the sky around the skyscraper.</td>', 'Interesting angle, terrific reflection (obviously). I''m not sure, but I think I can see some sensor dust type marks? One on the bean, a few in the sky around the skyscraper.', '2012-02-14 08:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675799, 993650, 119012, '<td valign="top">use of leading lines and perspective is perfect</td>', 'use of leading lines and perspective is perfect', '2012-02-14 08:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675801, 996541, 119012, '<td valign="top">needs more detail and sharpness</td>', 'needs more detail and sharpness', '2012-02-14 08:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675802, 996408, 119012, '<td valign="top">i may have tried a tighter crop, try removing some of the right and bottom of the image and leave the empty space in the upper right.</td>', 'i may have tried a tighter crop, try removing some of the right and bottom of the image and leave the empty space in the upper right.', '2012-02-14 08:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675803, 996148, 129807, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great view. Scary road. Processing is vibrant - still trying to decide if it''s a smidge too vibrant, but I like it.</td>', 'Wow. Great view. Scary road. Processing is vibrant - still trying to decide if it''s a smidge too vibrant, but I like it.', '2012-02-14 08:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675804, 994149, 119012, '<td valign="top">crop looks too tight, give me more scenery.</td>', 'crop looks too tight, give me more scenery.', '2012-02-14 08:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675805, 997258, 129807, '<td valign="top">The little girl looks like she doesn''t quite understand why the new one is upset!</td>', 'The little girl looks like she doesn''t quite understand why the new one is upset!', '2012-02-14 08:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675806, 997409, 119012, '<td valign="top">excels where so many other portraits have failed in this challenge. you are conveying a sense of interest that transcends the fact that i dont know or care about this boy.</td>', 'excels where so many other portraits have failed in this challenge. you are conveying a sense of interest that transcends the fact that i dont know or care about this boy.', '2012-02-14 08:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675807, 993599, 119012, '<td valign="top">perfect composition and the colors are reflection are great</td>', 'perfect composition and the colors are reflection are great', '2012-02-14 08:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675808, 995467, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like the very shallow dof - the catchlights (particularly in the animal''s right eye) are excellent.</td>', 'I like the very shallow dof - the catchlights (particularly in the animal''s right eye) are excellent.', '2012-02-14 08:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675809, 995862, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent repetitious lines and patterns - almost makes me dizzy.</td>', 'Excellent repetitious lines and patterns - almost makes me dizzy.', '2012-02-14 08:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675810, 993606, 119012, '<td valign="top">my eyes dont go right to face like they should, try adjusting you composition so they do.</td>', 'my eyes dont go right to face like they should, try adjusting you composition so they do.', '2012-02-14 08:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675811, 996154, 129807, '<td valign="top">Amazing technique required to capture these types of shots. Love that splash of red.</td>', 'Amazing technique required to capture these types of shots. Love that splash of red.', '2012-02-14 08:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675812, 997886, 119012, '<td valign="top">has a nice sense of motion, though cropping off some of the tail is distracting.</td>', 'has a nice sense of motion, though cropping off some of the tail is distracting.', '2012-02-14 08:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675815, 997480, 129807, '<td valign="top">Completely excellent image.</td>', 'Completely excellent image.', '2012-02-14 08:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675816, 998191, 129807, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve composed this shot with her face framed between her dark hair and the darkened doorway (?) behind her.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve composed this shot with her face framed between her dark hair and the darkened doorway (?) behind her.', '2012-02-14 08:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675817, 997797, 129807, '<td valign="top">The detail in this is just astounding.</td>', 'The detail in this is just astounding.', '2012-02-14 08:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675818, 993650, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent leading lines, simple compositional elements and colours.</td>', 'Excellent leading lines, simple compositional elements and colours.', '2012-02-14 08:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675820, 998191, 119012, '<td valign="top">i cant make a connection to your subject.<br/> <br/>if this is part of a set then maybe that will help to make the connection. but judging as an individual image it lacking in some sort, i dont know what she is looking at, i can sense some emotion but is not clear what it is, sadness? wonder? boredom? it really could be any of those.<br/> <br/>its not a bad picture, its actually quite nice, there is just nothing connecting me to her and her thoughts and it needs that for ME to be emotionally vested in it.<br/> <br/>there are some other portraits in this challenge that are able to transcend the gap for some reason, either its eye contact or the background contributes or even the emotion in the face strikes a cord with me.</td>', 'i cant make a connection to your subject. if this is part of a set then maybe that will help to make the connection. but judging as an individual image it lacking in some sort, i dont know what she is looking at, i can sense some emotion but is not clear what it is, sadness? wonder? boredom? it really could be any of those. its not a bad picture, its actually quite nice, there is just nothing connecting me to her and her thoughts and it needs that for ME to be emotionally vested in it. there are some other portraits in this challenge that are able to transcend the gap for some reason, either its eye contact or the background contributes or even the emotion in the face strikes a cord with me.', '2012-02-14 08:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675827, 997414, 129807, '<td valign="top">Apart from the red doors, the colours in this almost seem a little washed out. Compositionally, the centred tree isn''t working (for me). That bright red does keep drawing my eye, so maybe a different crop of this scene would work better (for me) :)</td>', 'Apart from the red doors, the colours in this almost seem a little washed out. Compositionally, the centred tree isn''t working (for me). That bright red does keep drawing my eye, so maybe a different crop of this scene would work better (for me) :)', '2012-02-14 08:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675829, 996604, 129807, '<td valign="top">This ''feels'' like you were all lined up to take a snap of your friend when this speedy dog zoomed past and you were ''lucky'' enough to grab a snap!</td>', 'This ''feels'' like you were all lined up to take a snap of your friend when this speedy dog zoomed past and you were ''lucky'' enough to grab a snap!', '2012-02-14 08:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675831, 995951, 129807, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of dof.</td>', 'Excellent use of dof.', '2012-02-14 08:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675832, 996175, 129807, '<td valign="top">Almost feels like Singapore Sling Shot!</td>', 'Almost feels like Singapore Sling Shot!', '2012-02-14 08:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675834, 997707, 129807, '<td valign="top">Restful. I do like this. I would have cropped differently so as to remove the blocky fence on the right - but that''s me, not you, and it''s your pic!</td>', 'Restful. I do like this. I would have cropped differently so as to remove the blocky fence on the right - but that''s me, not you, and it''s your pic!', '2012-02-14 08:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6675838, 994233, 129807, '<td valign="top">Spiralling it is. Like the reflection too.</td>', 'Spiralling it is. Like the reflection too.', '2012-02-14 08:37:17.000000', NULL, 1);
