(6676072, 996203, 129807, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what to make of this. Old typewriter, old suit... new coffee cup (and too clean!) and I don''t know much about guns at all but that looks plastic-y. I know that this image is trying to tell me a story, I think it''s about ''suits'' making policies that are forced on the majority, but I''m not sure if it pulls it off convincingly. I''ll stop rambling now...</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what to make of this. Old typewriter, old suit... new coffee cup (and too clean!) and I don''t know much about guns at all but that looks plastic-y. I know that this image is trying to tell me a story, I think it''s about ''suits'' making policies that are forced on the majority, but I''m not sure if it pulls it off convincingly. I''ll stop rambling now...', '2012-02-14 10:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
