(6676209, 997303, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, although it may not be obvious to anyone who has not tried (&amp; failed, alas) to get an interesting shot of a lavender blossom. They''re such funny little things &amp; look so different thru the lens. Well done &amp; thank you!</td>', 'This is excellent, although it may not be obvious to anyone who has not tried (& failed, alas) to get an interesting shot of a lavender blossom. They''re such funny little things & look so different thru the lens. Well done & thank you!', '2012-02-14 11:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
