(6676752, 995766, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute kid. The lighting is good and the shot is razor sharp. Her expression isn''t the most endearing I''ve ever seen on a child, but not terrible either. I don''t feel the composition works for a portrait like this, however. The kid is way off to the side, and part of her hair is cut off at frame edge. I''m not sure if that aspect of framing was intentional or not. I''ve done some out of balance entries myself, but for me it just doesn''t seem to work for this one. Sorry.</td>', 'A cute kid. The lighting is good and the shot is razor sharp. Her expression isn''t the most endearing I''ve ever seen on a child, but not terrible either. I don''t feel the composition works for a portrait like this, however. The kid is way off to the side, and part of her hair is cut off at frame edge. I''m not sure if that aspect of framing was intentional or not. I''ve done some out of balance entries myself, but for me it just doesn''t seem to work for this one. Sorry.', '2012-02-14 18:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
