(6676792, 997976, 69668, '<td valign="top">As I sit here and look at this (have been for about two minutes) I can''t decide if I love it or just like it.  The thing that bothers me the most are the two prominent orange lines at the bottom....I do wish they were removed....it would soften the image into an abstract landscape...which I do like.  For some reason they make the image seem sloppy to me.  Yes, this is just my opinion....but I do overall like it, I think it could have had more impact without those orange lines.  Anyway....I give you a solid 7.</td>', 'As I sit here and look at this (have been for about two minutes) I can''t decide if I love it or just like it.  The thing that bothers me the most are the two prominent orange lines at the bottom....I do wish they were removed....it would soften the image into an abstract landscape...which I do like.  For some reason they make the image seem sloppy to me.  Yes, this is just my opinion....but I do overall like it, I think it could have had more impact without those orange lines.  Anyway....I give you a solid 7.', '2012-02-14 19:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
