(6677177, 997061, 93565, '<td valign="top">An interesting nude shot, surely. The pose looks quite awkward for the model, but is visually interesting. I really like the lighting to show all the definition, and the toning works great.</td>', 'An interesting nude shot, surely. The pose looks quite awkward for the model, but is visually interesting. I really like the lighting to show all the definition, and the toning works great.', '2012-02-15 01:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677179, 997323, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the dead weathered grass that surrounds the collapsed building, the whole thing sitting as an island on a sea of green. Cool.</td>', 'I really enjoy the dead weathered grass that surrounds the collapsed building, the whole thing sitting as an island on a sea of green. Cool.', '2012-02-15 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677181, 996525, 93565, '<td valign="top">Really nice combination of desert elements here. I like the sands and the hoodoos, with the cliff faces in the background. The desert trifecta. Your hoodoos seem to maybe have some slight haloing going on.</td>', 'Really nice combination of desert elements here. I like the sands and the hoodoos, with the cliff faces in the background. The desert trifecta. Your hoodoos seem to maybe have some slight haloing going on.', '2012-02-15 01:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677183, 996067, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very different from the other entries- I like this. The light really accentuates the texture of the ground. Everything looks so barren.</td>', 'Very different from the other entries- I like this. The light really accentuates the texture of the ground. Everything looks so barren.', '2012-02-15 01:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
