(6677187, 993908, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really like that you entered such an atypical shot from such a well known place. Entering a candid from a land known for landscapes shows a great appreciation for watching what unfolds around you, and I congratulate you on this. Very good.</td>', 'I really like that you entered such an atypical shot from such a well known place. Entering a candid from a land known for landscapes shows a great appreciation for watching what unfolds around you, and I congratulate you on this. Very good.', '2012-02-15 01:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
