(6677334, 998066, 119012, '<td valign="top">poor baby just wants to nap and you prop them up to take pictures. <br/> <br/>really nice colors, excellent sharpness and lighting. i also like the use of blur to enhance the focus. somebody is really happy with this portrait.</td>', 'poor baby just wants to nap and you prop them up to take pictures.  really nice colors, excellent sharpness and lighting. i also like the use of blur to enhance the focus. somebody is really happy with this portrait.', '2012-02-15 06:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
