(6677343, 997734, 119012, '<td valign="top">i like this alot, its a great clean silhouette, nice little sun flare, great colors. i like how you didnt over process the sky and let the subject steal the show.</td>', 'i like this alot, its a great clean silhouette, nice little sun flare, great colors. i like how you didnt over process the sky and let the subject steal the show.', '2012-02-15 06:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677344, 997469, 119012, '<td valign="top">great job capturing the joy and fun the girls are having.</td>', 'great job capturing the joy and fun the girls are having.', '2012-02-15 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677345, 995151, 119012, '<td valign="top">i dont like the composition at all, the bridge needs to be focus or complementing the scene. it cant be both. there is too much uninteresting scenery on the right, its too dark and overpowering and really detracts from a well lit bridge image.</td>', 'i dont like the composition at all, the bridge needs to be focus or complementing the scene. it cant be both. there is too much uninteresting scenery on the right, its too dark and overpowering and really detracts from a well lit bridge image.', '2012-02-15 06:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677346, 994110, 119012, '<td valign="top">great emotion capture on the boys face, however the rest of the scene doesn''t complement it.</td>', 'great emotion capture on the boys face, however the rest of the scene doesn''t complement it.', '2012-02-15 06:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677347, 995981, 119012, '<td valign="top">needs to be sharper.</td>', 'needs to be sharper.', '2012-02-15 06:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677349, 997590, 119012, '<td valign="top">almost works. you have lots of great hard edges to play with but you didn''t light them properly. the shadows need to be darker. see how the shadow on the face blends almost perfectly with the black visor and black lines? you needed to do that on the whole body. i shouldn''t be able to see the right arm or leg.</td>', 'almost works. you have lots of great hard edges to play with but you didn''t light them properly. the shadows need to be darker. see how the shadow on the face blends almost perfectly with the black visor and black lines? you needed to do that on the whole body. i shouldn''t be able to see the right arm or leg.', '2012-02-15 06:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677351, 996316, 119012, '<td valign="top">the tones are too flat, the sky is a bit to dramatic, tone it down. the location of the subject is off, try moving him over to the bottom right third point, placing the horizon as close as possible to the bottom third line and zoom in some.</td>', 'the tones are too flat, the sky is a bit to dramatic, tone it down. the location of the subject is off, try moving him over to the bottom right third point, placing the horizon as close as possible to the bottom third line and zoom in some.', '2012-02-15 06:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677352, 997771, 119012, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t appear very clean. its almost looks like you smudged some stuff in photoshop.</td>', 'this doesn''t appear very clean. its almost looks like you smudged some stuff in photoshop.', '2012-02-15 06:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677353, 995417, 119012, '<td valign="top">nice lightning capture, but there is no foreground to speak of so the houses are really detracting from this image.</td>', 'nice lightning capture, but there is no foreground to speak of so the houses are really detracting from this image.', '2012-02-15 06:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677354, 994702, 119012, '<td valign="top">great atmosphere, the use of tilt is great really adds a sense of world turning over to it.</td>', 'great atmosphere, the use of tilt is great really adds a sense of world turning over to it.', '2012-02-15 06:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677355, 998133, 119012, '<td valign="top">excellent sharpness, nothing that wows me about this picture of a bird.</td>', 'excellent sharpness, nothing that wows me about this picture of a bird.', '2012-02-15 06:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677356, 997864, 119012, '<td valign="top">great grit and detail. this style of processing really lends itself well to older people.</td>', 'great grit and detail. this style of processing really lends itself well to older people.', '2012-02-15 06:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6677357, 997757, 119012, '<td valign="top">much too dark. no details to speak of.</td>', 'much too dark. no details to speak of.', '2012-02-15 06:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
