(6678633, 997304, 114225, '<td valign="top">Those things sound hilarious when they fly :)<br/>Extremely good details. Looks like yuu had some nice gold light to work with.</td>', 'Those things sound hilarious when they fly :)Extremely good details. Looks like yuu had some nice gold light to work with.', '2012-02-15 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678634, 997758, 38032, '<td valign="top">love the lines and the way the eye jumps around and then finds everything but still my eyes can''t sit still.</td>', 'love the lines and the way the eye jumps around and then finds everything but still my eyes can''t sit still.', '2012-02-15 22:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678635, 997554, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing image. The juxtaposition of the water tank and the umbrellas is interesting.</td>', 'Very intriguing image. The juxtaposition of the water tank and the umbrellas is interesting.', '2012-02-15 22:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678637, 997864, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing a part of the wok many of us don''t see.</td>', 'Great job capturing a part of the wok many of us don''t see.', '2012-02-15 22:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678638, 997410, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the calming color pallet here.</td>', 'I like the calming color pallet here.', '2012-02-15 22:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678640, 997845, 38032, '<td valign="top">Love the classic elements here. Very cute shot. I almost wish it was all soft focus -the metal in focus seems a shame with those beautiful baby eyes begging for detail.</td>', 'Love the classic elements here. Very cute shot. I almost wish it was all soft focus -the metal in focus seems a shame with those beautiful baby eyes begging for detail.', '2012-02-15 22:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678641, 993924, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you got the guy in the shot. Gives life to this image.</td>', 'I''m glad you got the guy in the shot. Gives life to this image.', '2012-02-15 22:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678642, 994155, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. Even though I think focusing on the shoulder is a bit odd, this image has a lot of interest to it.</td>', 'I like this. Even though I think focusing on the shoulder is a bit odd, this image has a lot of interest to it.', '2012-02-15 22:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678644, 996747, 38032, '<td valign="top">Seems a tad set up to me  merely because i would probably do that ;)<br/>Interesting find here for sure and a nice result. A real black cat would have been amazing to add to all this ;)</td>', 'Seems a tad set up to me  merely because i would probably do that ;)Interesting find here for sure and a nice result. A real black cat would have been amazing to add to all this ;)', '2012-02-15 22:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678645, 997912, 114225, '<td valign="top">The washed out tones work well with this photo.</td>', 'The washed out tones work well with this photo.', '2012-02-15 22:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678647, 994762, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice repetitive pattern.</td>', 'Nice repetitive pattern.', '2012-02-15 22:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678649, 997677, 114225, '<td valign="top">I very much like how the background has interesting light. It actually seems to help make her eyes pop.</td>', 'I very much like how the background has interesting light. It actually seems to help make her eyes pop.', '2012-02-15 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678652, 997874, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like your angle on the bean.</td>', 'I like your angle on the bean.', '2012-02-15 22:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678654, 994361, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice depth, well done.</td>', 'Nice depth, well done.', '2012-02-15 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678657, 995763, 57447, '<td valign="top">Well done in the slot.</td>', 'Well done in the slot.', '2012-02-15 22:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678715, 997976, 25773, '<td valign="top">Daring stuff for "Best of the year"... hard to judge it against all the high-quality figurative entries. Not voting.</td>', 'Daring stuff for "Best of the year"... hard to judge it against all the high-quality figurative entries. Not voting.', '2012-02-16 00:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678718, 997689, 25773, '<td valign="top">Technically great! Title wise, they rather look like the target would be winning a price on a dog show (leash and muzzle restrainer on: they don''t look like being ready to fetch...).</td>', 'Technically great! Title wise, they rather look like the target would be winning a price on a dog show (leash and muzzle restrainer on: they don''t look like being ready to fetch...).', '2012-02-16 00:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678734, 994122, 93565, '<td valign="top">As I said, I did remember this off the top of my head, so it stuck in there after looking at it and it also struck me a bit when I saw it, but not enough to originally make me comment.<br/>I like all the texture you''ve got going on, and the light on the leafy bits is really quite nice, as it sculpts them very well. I like how three dimensional the whole thing feels. I also like how the petals sorta blend together, they look much more ephemeral in comparison to the green parts. Your choice to go with a photo of a flower that is largely not flower is interesting, but I like it. It''s nice to see flowers from ways we don''t normally. It''s a very nicely done floral shot, in my mind.</td>', 'As I said, I did remember this off the top of my head, so it stuck in there after looking at it and it also struck me a bit when I saw it, but not enough to originally make me comment.I like all the texture you''ve got going on, and the light on the leafy bits is really quite nice, as it sculpts them very well. I like how three dimensional the whole thing feels. I also like how the petals sorta blend together, they look much more ephemeral in comparison to the green parts. Your choice to go with a photo of a flower that is largely not flower is interesting, but I like it. It''s nice to see flowers from ways we don''t normally. It''s a very nicely done floral shot, in my mind.', '2012-02-16 00:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6678752, 998095, 97225, '<td valign="top">Gosh, what a great paint job. It really looks like it''s on fire. Nice shot, great sky too.</td>', 'Gosh, what a great paint job. It really looks like it''s on fire. Nice shot, great sky too.', '2012-02-16 01:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
