(6679058, 995146, 11854, '<td valign="top">So fascinating to look at. Excellent make up. 10 from me.</td>', 'So fascinating to look at. Excellent make up. 10 from me.', '2012-02-16 09:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679060, 997903, 11854, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous nature shot! Love it!</td>', 'Gorgeous nature shot! Love it!', '2012-02-16 09:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679061, 994155, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2012-02-16 09:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679062, 996813, 11854, '<td valign="top">Picture postcard beautiful! Love the old time feel.</td>', 'Picture postcard beautiful! Love the old time feel.', '2012-02-16 09:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679064, 997629, 11854, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2012-02-16 09:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679069, 997554, 11854, '<td valign="top">What a fun, bizarre capture! Your first instinct is umbrellas in the rain. But who has a glassed in pool? Anyway, love it.</td>', 'What a fun, bizarre capture! Your first instinct is umbrellas in the rain. But who has a glassed in pool? Anyway, love it.', '2012-02-16 09:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679072, 996488, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the rich greens and the lighting is gorgeous.  Did you shoot this through glass?  It looks so clear!</td>', 'Love the rich greens and the lighting is gorgeous.  Did you shoot this through glass?  It looks so clear!', '2012-02-16 09:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679073, 997532, 11854, '<td valign="top">Awesome processing.</td>', 'Awesome processing.', '2012-02-16 09:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679074, 995635, 92953, '<td valign="top">I have seeing the great stories of this Beetle from Nat-Geo. Now I have the oppoturnity to view it in image. Great shot and well done!</td>', 'I have seeing the great stories of this Beetle from Nat-Geo. Now I have the oppoturnity to view it in image. Great shot and well done!', '2012-02-16 09:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679075, 994633, 11854, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, stunning scenery. Well done with the b&amp;w conversion as well.</td>', 'Gorgeous, stunning scenery. Well done with the b&w conversion as well.', '2012-02-16 09:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679077, 997864, 11854, '<td valign="top">So sad.</td>', 'So sad.', '2012-02-16 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679079, 995545, 11854, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Looks to have a little stylize in there. LOL! Love it!</td>', 'Gorgeous! Looks to have a little stylize in there. LOL! Love it!', '2012-02-16 09:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679080, 997779, 11854, '<td valign="top">Jungle boy! Great processing!</td>', 'Jungle boy! Great processing!', '2012-02-16 09:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679083, 998144, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful spot!</td>', 'Beautiful spot!', '2012-02-16 09:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679103, 995800, 67697, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I love how the wind was working with you on this day.  The red is such a beautiful contrast to the sand.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I love how the wind was working with you on this day.  The red is such a beautiful contrast to the sand.', '2012-02-16 09:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679110, 997862, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is quite freaky, and fascinating at the same time.  What a creative idea for a shot.  The lensbaby? blur really adds a dramatic effect.  I wish the stick wasn''t sticking out of the one mask.  It kind of puts a dent in the illusion of floating faces.</td>', 'This is quite freaky, and fascinating at the same time.  What a creative idea for a shot.  The lensbaby? blur really adds a dramatic effect.  I wish the stick wasn''t sticking out of the one mask.  It kind of puts a dent in the illusion of floating faces.', '2012-02-16 09:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679112, 996747, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a smart photo.  The red flower is a great tie-in to the umbrella.  Love the colortone processing too.</td>', 'What a smart photo.  The red flower is a great tie-in to the umbrella.  Love the colortone processing too.', '2012-02-16 09:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679119, 997845, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5 and I''ll tell you why.  The title leads me to believe that the cutie pie in the carrier is the apple of your eye.  But then the focus is on the carriage.  So which is it?  My preference would have been to see the babe in focus.  Also, since you have such beautiful softness in the background, I would have wanted to see complementary lightness in front, instead of this strong black color.</td>', 'I gave this a 5 and I''ll tell you why.  The title leads me to believe that the cutie pie in the carrier is the apple of your eye.  But then the focus is on the carriage.  So which is it?  My preference would have been to see the babe in focus.  Also, since you have such beautiful softness in the background, I would have wanted to see complementary lightness in front, instead of this strong black color.', '2012-02-16 09:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679126, 994122, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like how the colors just burst up.  I wish there was more of that, and less of the stem here.  All the same, it''s a good shot!</td>', 'I like how the colors just burst up.  I wish there was more of that, and less of the stem here.  All the same, it''s a good shot!', '2012-02-16 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679129, 996668, 141542, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  Definitely a smart concept.</td>', 'Interesting!  Definitely a smart concept.', '2012-02-16 09:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679132, 997895, 141542, '<td valign="top">Good shot!</td>', 'Good shot!', '2012-02-16 10:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679149, 996604, 7889, '<td valign="top">Interesting ! Really like this shot, not certain if it is the dog running off at an angle or the person that I find interesting. Maybe a combination of both and the fact that the head is missing. You probably know that a lot of people will pass this by. It made me look and think about this photo and at the end of the day that is all you can hope people will do. Originally gave you an 8 but I am bumping this up to a 9 and I don''t give out many of those, trust me.</td>', 'Interesting ! Really like this shot, not certain if it is the dog running off at an angle or the person that I find interesting. Maybe a combination of both and the fact that the head is missing. You probably know that a lot of people will pass this by. It made me look and think about this photo and at the end of the day that is all you can hope people will do. Originally gave you an 8 but I am bumping this up to a 9 and I don''t give out many of those, trust me.', '2012-02-16 10:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679150, 995484, 141542, '<td valign="top">A good, posed shot with pop.  I like it.</td>', 'A good, posed shot with pop.  I like it.', '2012-02-16 10:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679154, 998111, 141542, '<td valign="top">Untouched sand, and (most likely) untouched snow, together at once?  Very cool.  Where is this?  Gobi Desert?</td>', 'Untouched sand, and (most likely) untouched snow, together at once?  Very cool.  Where is this?  Gobi Desert?', '2012-02-16 10:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679158, 995245, 141542, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, well spotted.  I think there are a few elements that could be improved here, but, being an amateur I can''t put my finger on them exactly.  Maybe a slightly different framing/crop?  <br/> <br/>Opinions, though...I like the shot. 7.</td>', 'Hahaha, well spotted.  I think there are a few elements that could be improved here, but, being an amateur I can''t put my finger on them exactly.  Maybe a slightly different framing/crop?   Opinions, though...I like the shot. 7.', '2012-02-16 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679160, 994598, 141542, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, and appropriately vibrant.</td>', 'Very well composed, and appropriately vibrant.', '2012-02-16 10:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679165, 997621, 141542, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and silhouette.  Horizon seems a little off.  Perhaps your intention, so I won''t really knock you on that too much.  Solid image, 7.</td>', 'Very nice color and silhouette.  Horizon seems a little off.  Perhaps your intention, so I won''t really knock you on that too much.  Solid image, 7.', '2012-02-16 10:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679167, 997677, 141542, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and sensual.  An appropriate title too.</td>', 'Beautiful, and sensual.  An appropriate title too.', '2012-02-16 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679171, 996541, 141542, '<td valign="top">Mountain goats indeed.  Nothing too exciting here, but it''s certainly a couple of well photographed goats! 7</td>', 'Mountain goats indeed.  Nothing too exciting here, but it''s certainly a couple of well photographed goats! 7', '2012-02-16 10:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679174, 994082, 141542, '<td valign="top">So many powerful layers to this image.</td>', 'So many powerful layers to this image.', '2012-02-16 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6679176, 996873, 141542, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to find a focal point here, because there are so many things to be interested in.  It''s certainly appealing.</td>', 'It''s hard to find a focal point here, because there are so many things to be interested in.  It''s certainly appealing.', '2012-02-16 10:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679183, 993629, 141542, '<td valign="top">Well composed and the colors, which might be boring and muted to the naked eye, are very strong here and the foundation to an interesting image.</td>', 'Well composed and the colors, which might be boring and muted to the naked eye, are very strong here and the foundation to an interesting image.', '2012-02-16 10:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679187, 997629, 141542, '<td valign="top">On a second look, I find this flower to be more deserving of an 8 than a 7.</td>', 'On a second look, I find this flower to be more deserving of an 8 than a 7.', '2012-02-16 10:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679191, 997409, 141542, '<td valign="top">A classic portrait.  Well done, but it''s not as creative as some of the other entries.  Still, good photography is good photography and this is a 7 in my opinion.</td>', 'A classic portrait.  Well done, but it''s not as creative as some of the other entries.  Still, good photography is good photography and this is a 7 in my opinion.', '2012-02-16 10:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679195, 997836, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like this, although the highlight in the barely open mouth is a bit distracting to me.</td>', 'I like this, although the highlight in the barely open mouth is a bit distracting to me.', '2012-02-16 10:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679196, 998047, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like the action here, and the flowing pattern of the girls, but the processing kind of kills it.</td>', 'I like the action here, and the flowing pattern of the girls, but the processing kind of kills it.', '2012-02-16 10:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679199, 998026, 141542, '<td valign="top">Good stuff...like you''re taking a peek into a claustrophobic''s nightmare.</td>', 'Good stuff...like you''re taking a peek into a claustrophobic''s nightmare.', '2012-02-16 10:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679200, 996226, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like the processing here.  You certainly took what I''m sure was a fairly average image and made it really pop!</td>', 'I like the processing here.  You certainly took what I''m sure was a fairly average image and made it really pop!', '2012-02-16 10:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679208, 995633, 141542, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.</td>', 'Awesome shot.', '2012-02-16 10:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679209, 997258, 141542, '<td valign="top">Precious.  A great moment.</td>', 'Precious.  A great moment.', '2012-02-16 10:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679211, 998051, 141542, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Not overwhelming or trying too hard.  Just relaxing.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Not overwhelming or trying too hard.  Just relaxing.', '2012-02-16 10:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679214, 993630, 141542, '<td valign="top">Splendid scene, but I feel it''s a little muted.</td>', 'Splendid scene, but I feel it''s a little muted.', '2012-02-16 10:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679217, 993782, 141542, '<td valign="top">If I see a stranger photo for this challenge, I''ll come back and make a comment.  For now, you win the "Scales'' Strangest Photo Award" which I just made up for this image.</td>', 'If I see a stranger photo for this challenge, I''ll come back and make a comment.  For now, you win the "Scales'' Strangest Photo Award" which I just made up for this image.', '2012-02-16 10:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679221, 997002, 141542, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  One of the strongest flowers in the competition.</td>', 'I love this shot.  One of the strongest flowers in the competition.', '2012-02-16 10:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679222, 996316, 141542, '<td valign="top">Classic and impressive.</td>', 'Classic and impressive.', '2012-02-16 10:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679236, 994594, 141542, '<td valign="top">If this is street, then this is the epitome of it.</td>', 'If this is street, then this is the epitome of it.', '2012-02-16 10:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679238, 994167, 141542, '<td valign="top">Moment perfectly captured.  10.</td>', 'Moment perfectly captured.  10.', '2012-02-16 10:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679239, 996148, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best landscapes I''ve ever seen.  10, obviously.</td>', 'This is one of the best landscapes I''ve ever seen.  10, obviously.', '2012-02-16 10:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679247, 998150, 30364, '<td valign="top">What a great picture!  It will be <i>impossible</i> for all those sad, simple souls who blather on about ''distractions'', ''blurry'', ''no clear subject'', ''rule-of-turds'', ''lens flare'', and all that rubbish to fail to recognize the quality of this photograph.  I''ve seen some wonderful, exuberant, original photographs that were shamefully overlooked at DPC, but surely not this time?  This one is just so unequivocally damn good that it <i>must</i> penetrate. <br/> <br/>Your picture is a celebration of <i>the photograph</i>, rather than of photography.  In fact it''s pretty much anti-photography, and that''s always a very good thing in a photograph.  <br/> <br/>An emphatic 10 for you, a ''Thank You'', and the following posthumous* <strike>Purple Heart</strike> , I mean Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/> <br/><i>(* the ''posthumous'' <strike>Purple Heart</strike> is not connected with the well-known mad poet and twisted art critic of the same name)</i></td>', 'What a great picture!  It will be impossible for all those sad, simple souls who blather on about ''distractions'', ''blurry'', ''no clear subject'', ''rule-of-turds'', ''lens flare'', and all that rubbish to fail to recognize the quality of this photograph.  I''ve seen some wonderful, exuberant, original photographs that were shamefully overlooked at DPC, but surely not this time?  This one is just so unequivocally damn good that it must penetrate.  Your picture is a celebration of the photograph, rather than of photography.  In fact it''s pretty much anti-photography, and that''s always a very good thing in a photograph.   An emphatic 10 for you, a ''Thank You'', and the following posthumous* Purple Heart , I mean Order of the Thumb:   (* the ''posthumous'' Purple Heart is not connected with the well-known mad poet and twisted art critic of the same name)', '2012-02-16 10:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679251, 996604, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph!  So unexpected, so unusual, and yet so absolutely right.  Two human figures forced into anonymous irrelevance (one by the tyranny of distance, one by the indifference of the frame); one has no arms, the other has but chooses to keep them furled; both of them apparently stationary while pointed on a north-south heading.  And one wee dog rocketing through the scene in an exuberant west-east dash, as if in a mad act of insurrection, or fleeing the scene of a crime.  If Elliott Erwitt saw this I''m sure he would laugh out loud and give you a big pat on the back.  Perhaps an autographed copy of <a href="//www.magnumphotos.com/c.aspx?VP=XSpecific_MAG.BookDetail_VPage&amp;pid=2K7O3RHWZ7EX" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this.</a> <br/>Best I can do is a 10.5 score as my top choice in the challenge, a sincere thank you, and one of these things, which makes a very fine doorstop:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph!  So unexpected, so unusual, and yet so absolutely right.  Two human figures forced into anonymous irrelevance (one by the tyranny of distance, one by the indifference of the frame); one has no arms, the other has but chooses to keep them furled; both of them apparently stationary while pointed on a north-south heading.  And one wee dog rocketing through the scene in an exuberant west-east dash, as if in a mad act of insurrection, or fleeing the scene of a crime.  If Elliott Erwitt saw this I''m sure he would laugh out loud and give you a big pat on the back.  Perhaps an autographed copy of this. Best I can do is a 10.5 score as my top choice in the challenge, a sincere thank you, and one of these things, which makes a very fine doorstop:', '2012-02-16 10:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679253, 998144, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like he movement of the clouds and how it mimics the lines in the sand.<br/> <br/>I do fins myself wishing the rocks were either fully black (silhouette) or brighter to show more detail.</td>', 'I really like he movement of the clouds and how it mimics the lines in the sand. I do fins myself wishing the rocks were either fully black (silhouette) or brighter to show more detail.', '2012-02-16 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679255, 994027, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool use of light and shadows. The sun really appeared at the perfect time from the wall of clouds.</td>', 'Cool use of light and shadows. The sun really appeared at the perfect time from the wall of clouds.', '2012-02-16 10:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679256, 995545, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice bold colors in the flowers and the leaves.</td>', 'Very nice bold colors in the flowers and the leaves.', '2012-02-16 10:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679257, 994122, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool. Looks like perhaps there is a light from inside the flower as well to give a nice glow.</td>', 'Cool. Looks like perhaps there is a light from inside the flower as well to give a nice glow.', '2012-02-16 10:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679258, 994053, 114225, '<td valign="top">Those intense red eyes are menacing.</td>', 'Those intense red eyes are menacing.', '2012-02-16 10:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679259, 994609, 114225, '<td valign="top">This feels like it could be a postcard for rural America.</td>', 'This feels like it could be a postcard for rural America.', '2012-02-16 10:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679260, 996316, 114225, '<td valign="top">Love the composition on this. Takes such a large animal and really puts it into perspective.</td>', 'Love the composition on this. Takes such a large animal and really puts it into perspective.', '2012-02-16 10:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679261, 998180, 114225, '<td valign="top">This image is done in such a way as I could see it being used as a look back into history. Nicely done.</td>', 'This image is done in such a way as I could see it being used as a look back into history. Nicely done.', '2012-02-16 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679263, 995800, 114225, '<td valign="top">The way the movement of the dress coincides with the movement of the dunes is genus.</td>', 'The way the movement of the dress coincides with the movement of the dunes is genus.', '2012-02-16 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679264, 995787, 114225, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely. The way the clouds seem to emanate from the ice is mesmerizing.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely. The way the clouds seem to emanate from the ice is mesmerizing.', '2012-02-16 10:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679265, 997650, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cool view. I like how you gave us a glimpse into something exotic (to most people) but what is mundane for these fishermen.</td>', 'What a cool view. I like how you gave us a glimpse into something exotic (to most people) but what is mundane for these fishermen.', '2012-02-16 10:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679267, 997793, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well composed shots. The lines in this image are so pwerful.</td>', 'Very well composed shots. The lines in this image are so pwerful.', '2012-02-16 10:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679269, 997842, 114225, '<td valign="top">So well seen and framed.</td>', 'So well seen and framed.', '2012-02-16 10:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
