(6679327, 998066, 94265, '<td valign="top">Forgive me if I''m wrong but it looks to me like there''s been a poor cloning job on the baby''s right shoulder/arm, it looks warped and misshapen, which kills an otherwise lovely image for me. Besides the arm issue, the image is adorable, in good focus and nicely lit.</td>', 'Forgive me if I''m wrong but it looks to me like there''s been a poor cloning job on the baby''s right shoulder/arm, it looks warped and misshapen, which kills an otherwise lovely image for me. Besides the arm issue, the image is adorable, in good focus and nicely lit.', '2012-02-16 12:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
