(6679348, 997862, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the super thick borders are necessary, this image is fine as a landscape crop and doesn''t need to be square. Awesome shot nonetheless, it''s like something from a Neil Gaiman story; kind of eerie but ultimately intriguing. Well done; I give this an 8, I would have probably gone to a 9 or even a 10 were it not for what I find to be the super-distracting borders.</td>', 'I don''t think the super thick borders are necessary, this image is fine as a landscape crop and doesn''t need to be square. Awesome shot nonetheless, it''s like something from a Neil Gaiman story; kind of eerie but ultimately intriguing. Well done; I give this an 8, I would have probably gone to a 9 or even a 10 were it not for what I find to be the super-distracting borders.', '2012-02-16 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
