(6679627, 995129, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful romantic image, a small niggle would be that the cup of her bodice(?) doesn''t seem to fit entirely and it sticks out. Otherwise, very pretty image, good focus, lovely golden hues.</td>', 'Beautiful romantic image, a small niggle would be that the cup of her bodice(?) doesn''t seem to fit entirely and it sticks out. Otherwise, very pretty image, good focus, lovely golden hues.', '2012-02-16 15:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
