(6679654, 994149, 54778, '<td valign="top">That''s one tiny house. I''m trying to imagine how many rooms it could have. Through your edit you have managed to remove the effects of harsh sunlight, somewhat but I think the house would have been better represented in some other time of the day when the sun wasn''t so harsh.</td>', 'That''s one tiny house. I''m trying to imagine how many rooms it could have. Through your edit you have managed to remove the effects of harsh sunlight, somewhat but I think the house would have been better represented in some other time of the day when the sun wasn''t so harsh.', '2012-02-16 15:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679655, 996148, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely image of an amazingly cool looking valley.</td>', 'Lovely image of an amazingly cool looking valley.', '2012-02-16 15:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6679656, 997427, 114225, '<td valign="top">The layers and lighting in this are breathtaking.</td>', 'The layers and lighting in this are breathtaking.', '2012-02-16 15:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
