(6679660, 994131, 54778, '<td valign="top">Getting a sharp bird shot is extremely difficult so it''s great that you''ve managed that. Not entirely convinced on the edit. It''s slightly too smooth and the odd halos on the wings are distracting.</td>', 'Getting a sharp bird shot is extremely difficult so it''s great that you''ve managed that. Not entirely convinced on the edit. It''s slightly too smooth and the odd halos on the wings are distracting.', '2012-02-16 15:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
