(6680062, 998180, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a waste of energy! Shouldn''t they close the windows so they don''t lose all the air conditioning? &lt;/humorAttempt&gt;. There are many good things to say about this picture. I especially like the tones on the side of the bus, and the folks looking out the windows'' faces are nicely in focus. Not sure about the blurry guy in the foreground, but even he gives depth to the shot.</td>', 'What a waste of energy! Shouldn''t they close the windows so they don''t lose all the air conditioning? </humorAttempt>. There are many good things to say about this picture. I especially like the tones on the side of the bus, and the folks looking out the windows'' faces are nicely in focus. Not sure about the blurry guy in the foreground, but even he gives depth to the shot.', '2012-02-16 21:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
