(6680134, 995265, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, exposure, and detail. I find the large expanse of leg in the left foreground and headboard triangle in the upper right very distracting. IMO, the focal point (where my eye is drawn first) is to the left of her left hand. Her left eye has a dark spot between it and the eyebrow, and her expression says she can''t wait to get out of there / or that she''s bored. Probably my favorite part of this shot is her dark hair against the white pillow case and her arm.</td>', 'Nice lighting, exposure, and detail. I find the large expanse of leg in the left foreground and headboard triangle in the upper right very distracting. IMO, the focal point (where my eye is drawn first) is to the left of her left hand. Her left eye has a dark spot between it and the eyebrow, and her expression says she can''t wait to get out of there / or that she''s bored. Probably my favorite part of this shot is her dark hair against the white pillow case and her arm.', '2012-02-16 22:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
