(6680445, 996605, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is a cool photo but it brings back to mind a near disaster. Luckily we heard distress sounds and splashing, and investigated them. An old black dog was near to drowning in our neighbour''s pool. We managed to save him, luckily, but he was totally exhausted.</td>', 'This is a cool photo but it brings back to mind a near disaster. Luckily we heard distress sounds and splashing, and investigated them. An old black dog was near to drowning in our neighbour''s pool. We managed to save him, luckily, but he was totally exhausted.', '2012-02-17 01:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
