(6680452, 996408, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m a bad idea...when sparks fly...she''s awesome!...first photo I believe of Taylor at DPC...great job....(...some noise in the background that I think could have been smoothed over...) This photo deserves a score of 13...</td>', 'I''m a bad idea...when sparks fly...she''s awesome!...first photo I believe of Taylor at DPC...great job....(...some noise in the background that I think could have been smoothed over...) This photo deserves a score of 13...', '2012-02-17 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
