(6680589, 994762, 35086, '<td valign="top">I really like depth created this way, I always found it fascinating and try to use it whenever I can.  Beautiful tones in this picture.</td>', 'I really like depth created this way, I always found it fascinating and try to use it whenever I can.  Beautiful tones in this picture.', '2012-02-17 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
