(6680598, 996154, 35086, '<td valign="top">Pretty crisp.  With the composition and bokeh, I imagine this was cropped?  Quality is still very good.</td>', 'Pretty crisp.  With the composition and bokeh, I imagine this was cropped?  Quality is still very good.', '2012-02-17 07:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6680600, 994152, 35086, '<td valign="top">The downside of these kind of pictures is that it''s hard to make them stick out among the rest and it also makes it hard to vote on.  <br/> <br/>But I really like it, the composition, the movement, the direction of light and just the overall feel.  It makes me want to be there.  :)</td>', 'The downside of these kind of pictures is that it''s hard to make them stick out among the rest and it also makes it hard to vote on.   But I really like it, the composition, the movement, the direction of light and just the overall feel.  It makes me want to be there.  :)', '2012-02-17 07:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6680601, 993590, 35086, '<td valign="top">I really like the strong saturation and crisp details.</td>', 'I really like the strong saturation and crisp details.', '2012-02-17 07:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6680602, 998139, 35086, '<td valign="top">The sky is a bit over-saturated and is a distraction to the rest of this beautiful scene.  Still, it''s a very charming view. :)</td>', 'The sky is a bit over-saturated and is a distraction to the rest of this beautiful scene.  Still, it''s a very charming view. :)', '2012-02-17 07:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
