(6680942, 994271, 43463, '<td valign="top">Honey Bees bumble<br/>Flutterby Butterfly tumble<br/>Spring sings<br/>Romance is in the wings<br/> <br/>Love the bold orange hue that just pops off the soft greens. The capture of the two butterflies in a twirled flight is not an easy feat. Congrats on being able to get this shot. The colors, the flowers, the twirled flight all sing spring to me.</td>', 'Honey Bees bumbleFlutterby Butterfly tumbleSpring singsRomance is in the wings Love the bold orange hue that just pops off the soft greens. The capture of the two butterflies in a twirled flight is not an easy feat. Congrats on being able to get this shot. The colors, the flowers, the twirled flight all sing spring to me.', '2012-02-17 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
