(6681391, 997435, 43463, '<td valign="top">Across the wild Savanna''s spread,<br/>deadly paws in silence tread.<br/>The hunt begins with the chase<br/>the lion pride keeping pace<br/>until prey falls to their embrace.<br/> <br/> <br/>Great details in the fur coat and face of this predator! Love the colors and details. She looks as if she is scanning the horizon for the pride''s next dinner.</td>', 'Across the wild Savanna''s spread,deadly paws in silence tread.The hunt begins with the chasethe lion pride keeping paceuntil prey falls to their embrace.  Great details in the fur coat and face of this predator! Love the colors and details. She looks as if she is scanning the horizon for the pride''s next dinner.', '2012-02-17 18:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
