(6681546, 997848, 49018, '<td valign="top">The flavour of reality. 9</td>', 'The flavour of reality. 9', '2012-02-17 22:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681547, 995466, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, but for me the blue/silver of the mask doesn''t mesh well with the yellow / chartreuse of the background. The mix of warm and cool colors adds tension to the picture. Her hand is a bit hot. Nice exposure and focus on the mask.</td>', 'Cute picture, but for me the blue/silver of the mask doesn''t mesh well with the yellow / chartreuse of the background. The mix of warm and cool colors adds tension to the picture. Her hand is a bit hot. Nice exposure and focus on the mask.', '2012-02-17 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681548, 995382, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah! Makes me want to sing and stroll. Wonderful lighting, sun path, water &amp; woods.</td>', 'Ah! Makes me want to sing and stroll. Wonderful lighting, sun path, water & woods.', '2012-02-17 22:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681550, 993782, 49018, '<td valign="top">Physical attraction and fear of the unknown, two edges to the same blade.<br/>And a postprocessing with the right intent to keep them both sharp.<br/>Excellent.</td>', 'Physical attraction and fear of the unknown, two edges to the same blade.And a postprocessing with the right intent to keep them both sharp.Excellent.', '2012-02-17 22:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681552, 996407, 49018, '<td valign="top">Best of nature shots.</td>', 'Best of nature shots.', '2012-02-17 22:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681553, 996226, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and processed.</td>', 'Very well composed and processed.', '2012-02-17 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681555, 996917, 49018, '<td valign="top">Fascinating portrait and wonderful model. Diffraction really works subtly here. 9</td>', 'Fascinating portrait and wonderful model. Diffraction really works subtly here. 9', '2012-02-17 22:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681557, 995800, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. To me, this feels contrived and incongruent. The shot give no apparent reason or excuse for an overdressed lady in beautiful billowing red silks, posing unusually to be out in the middle of the dunes (nice job in not having any footprints in the shot, btw).</td>', 'Very nicely done. To me, this feels contrived and incongruent. The shot give no apparent reason or excuse for an overdressed lady in beautiful billowing red silks, posing unusually to be out in the middle of the dunes (nice job in not having any footprints in the shot, btw).', '2012-02-17 22:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681558, 993924, 49018, '<td valign="top">Best of emotive architecture.</td>', 'Best of emotive architecture.', '2012-02-17 22:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681559, 995909, 77196, '<td valign="top">This has an other-worldly feel to it - love the vines hanging down from the tree, dwarfing the park bench.</td>', 'This has an other-worldly feel to it - love the vines hanging down from the tree, dwarfing the park bench.', '2012-02-17 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681562, 996148, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not for the faint of heart. Looks like you don''t want to miss a turn. Nice brightness even in the shadow of the valley.</td>', 'Not for the faint of heart. Looks like you don''t want to miss a turn. Nice brightness even in the shadow of the valley.', '2012-02-17 22:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681563, 996060, 49018, '<td valign="top">Great image. When seen within a certain style, truly outstanding. It looks like the result of 1/40 of second backed up by several years of work.<br/>10</td>', 'Great image. When seen within a certain style, truly outstanding. It looks like the result of 1/40 of second backed up by several years of work.10', '2012-02-17 22:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681564, 996097, 77196, '<td valign="top">Little Red Riding Hood - without her ride and hood! Ah, the carefree innocence of youth. Looks like she''s having a good time.</td>', 'Little Red Riding Hood - without her ride and hood! Ah, the carefree innocence of youth. Looks like she''s having a good time.', '2012-02-17 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681565, 994053, 49018, '<td valign="top">What an incredible wing span, when they spread them.</td>', 'What an incredible wing span, when they spread them.', '2012-02-17 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681568, 997739, 49018, '<td valign="top">Soft contrast was the best choice, in the end. Excellent.</td>', 'Soft contrast was the best choice, in the end. Excellent.', '2012-02-17 22:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681569, 997863, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very well commposed, good job.</td>', 'Very well commposed, good job.', '2012-02-17 22:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681570, 996073, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-action shot capturing detail on the bird, and capture of the water droplets above/behind it. For me, the fence/railing is very, very distracting, but there is no way to crop it out. Worse, it leads the eye through and out of the picture, bypassing the bird.</td>', 'Nice stop-action shot capturing detail on the bird, and capture of the water droplets above/behind it. For me, the fence/railing is very, very distracting, but there is no way to crop it out. Worse, it leads the eye through and out of the picture, bypassing the bird.', '2012-02-17 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681571, 997480, 49018, '<td valign="top">Great capture and compositions.</td>', 'Great capture and compositions.', '2012-02-17 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681573, 998180, 49018, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I can almost feel it moving, by the sheer force of all those gazes pointing forward.</td>', 'Excellent, I can almost feel it moving, by the sheer force of all those gazes pointing forward.', '2012-02-17 22:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681575, 998106, 49018, '<td valign="top">Best of still life takes. I love the general choice of tones..</td>', 'Best of still life takes. I love the general choice of tones..', '2012-02-17 22:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681576, 996919, 49018, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2012-02-17 22:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681577, 997695, 49018, '<td valign="top">It certainly conveys well the feeling of entrapment.</td>', 'It certainly conveys well the feeling of entrapment.', '2012-02-17 22:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681578, 998047, 49018, '<td valign="top">Great composition and duotone.</td>', 'Great composition and duotone.', '2012-02-17 22:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681580, 993598, 77196, '<td valign="top">There are so many nice things to say about this. Love the vine on the fence, ring on her left hand, the old-fashioned looking haircut. Having her behind the fence implies that she is captive because of what (who) she is waiting for. The vine implies hope, and yet her expression is not worried - she has every hope that the one she waits for will come - she just does not know when. There''s probably more, but this image is art, and deserves to be hanging in a galley. The only nit is that the double earrings do not seem to match (period-wise) the rest of her look.</td>', 'There are so many nice things to say about this. Love the vine on the fence, ring on her left hand, the old-fashioned looking haircut. Having her behind the fence implies that she is captive because of what (who) she is waiting for. The vine implies hope, and yet her expression is not worried - she has every hope that the one she waits for will come - she just does not know when. There''s probably more, but this image is art, and deserves to be hanging in a galley. The only nit is that the double earrings do not seem to match (period-wise) the rest of her look.', '2012-02-17 22:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681582, 997137, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the echo of the red in the bridge in the barge. You even managed to get a seagull in the shot. Nice colors, detail, and textures.</td>', 'Very nice. Love the echo of the red in the bridge in the barge. You even managed to get a seagull in the shot. Nice colors, detail, and textures.', '2012-02-17 22:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681583, 998045, 77196, '<td valign="top">Looks like lots of evergreens on them thar hills. Very nice colors in the leaves, contrasting with the evergreens, with a rugged mountain backdrop, presided over by a very nice sky. The picture looks tilted, but the horizon is level.</td>', 'Looks like lots of evergreens on them thar hills. Very nice colors in the leaves, contrasting with the evergreens, with a rugged mountain backdrop, presided over by a very nice sky. The picture looks tilted, but the horizon is level.', '2012-02-17 22:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681585, 994089, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of a static, web of steel against the fluid and ever-changing sky. Almost looks like a jet trail in the sky, rather than a line of clouds. There is also some nice color contrasts here too - the white against the dark blue.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of a static, web of steel against the fluid and ever-changing sky. Almost looks like a jet trail in the sky, rather than a line of clouds. There is also some nice color contrasts here too - the white against the dark blue.', '2012-02-17 22:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681586, 997884, 77196, '<td valign="top">Oh, Margie, look! He''s molting! Great capture.</td>', 'Oh, Margie, look! He''s molting! Great capture.', '2012-02-17 22:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681587, 997278, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, nice detail in dogs, great expression on the guy. Looks like the dogs are a bit wet...</td>', 'Interesting perspective, nice detail in dogs, great expression on the guy. Looks like the dogs are a bit wet...', '2012-02-17 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681588, 994633, 77196, '<td valign="top">Stepping out of his cabin, Gary looked up at the mountain towering above. Wisps of clouds clung to its sides, obscuring its face here and there. The mountain gave him comfort. One could never be sure of the mountain, but it was always there - watching, waiting, sometimes revealing its face, sometimes hiding behind its shroud of clouds. <br/>Nice use of b&amp;w - definitely has a wispy mystical look to it.</td>', 'Stepping out of his cabin, Gary looked up at the mountain towering above. Wisps of clouds clung to its sides, obscuring its face here and there. The mountain gave him comfort. One could never be sure of the mountain, but it was always there - watching, waiting, sometimes revealing its face, sometimes hiding behind its shroud of clouds. Nice use of b&w - definitely has a wispy mystical look to it.', '2012-02-17 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681589, 996525, 43463, '<td valign="top">Within this desert sea with shifting sands<br/>are stone sentinels who stand silent and grand.<br/>Wind, rain, sun, and time paint these rocks.<br/>Look close at the brushstrokes to see earth''s epochs.<br/> <br/>Absolutely beautiful - love the lines the undulate in the sand. The desert rock and stone sentinels in the foreground are nature''s beauty at such a grand scale it just makes you feel small and takes your breath away.</td>', 'Within this desert sea with shifting sandsare stone sentinels who stand silent and grand.Wind, rain, sun, and time paint these rocks.Look close at the brushstrokes to see earth''s epochs. Absolutely beautiful - love the lines the undulate in the sand. The desert rock and stone sentinels in the foreground are nature''s beauty at such a grand scale it just makes you feel small and takes your breath away.', '2012-02-17 22:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681591, 994076, 77196, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Oregon Coastal Range forests. Very pretty waterfalls, and great color.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Oregon Coastal Range forests. Very pretty waterfalls, and great color.', '2012-02-17 22:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681593, 997650, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not something you see every day in downtown New York... Very nice use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Not something you see every day in downtown New York... Very nice use of B&W.', '2012-02-17 22:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681594, 996668, 77196, '<td valign="top">The kid''s expression and head orientation sell this shot. There is no indication he is jumping or looking where he might land, just serenely, effortlessly, floating down the stairway. I think the harsh shadows on the wall add to the surreal feel.</td>', 'The kid''s expression and head orientation sell this shot. There is no indication he is jumping or looking where he might land, just serenely, effortlessly, floating down the stairway. I think the harsh shadows on the wall add to the surreal feel.', '2012-02-17 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681595, 993599, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and reflections.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and reflections.', '2012-02-17 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681596, 997864, 25773, '<td valign="top">Hotpasta? In any case it''s very effective; (sadly) good lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Hotpasta? In any case it''s very effective; (sadly) good lighting and contrast.', '2012-02-17 22:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681598, 996541, 77196, '<td valign="top">Incredible animals - not always the most pretty (especially wild ones) or photogenic. This is a great capture - love the front hoof being visible, and the dandelions in the grass.</td>', 'Incredible animals - not always the most pretty (especially wild ones) or photogenic. This is a great capture - love the front hoof being visible, and the dandelions in the grass.', '2012-02-17 23:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681599, 997844, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is about, but it has the feeling of an artist, deeply concentrating on his work in his studio with no wish to be interrupted.</td>', 'Not sure what this is about, but it has the feeling of an artist, deeply concentrating on his work in his studio with no wish to be interrupted.', '2012-02-17 23:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681600, 998119, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail. How did you get him to pose with his foot on the finial? Great color and capture.</td>', 'Wonderful detail. How did you get him to pose with his foot on the finial? Great color and capture.', '2012-02-17 23:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681601, 995597, 25773, '<td valign="top">LOL+nicely done... very nicely 10</td>', 'LOL+nicely done... very nicely 10', '2012-02-17 23:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681603, 993657, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast between the white of teh building and the blackening skys. The gentle curves of the "sails" and the ragged leading edge of the storm, and the flags trying to get away from their poles.</td>', 'Wonderful contrast between the white of teh building and the blackening skys. The gentle curves of the "sails" and the ragged leading edge of the storm, and the flags trying to get away from their poles.', '2012-02-17 23:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681604, 994185, 77196, '<td valign="top">Live action shots are tough. Nice detail on his face - neck area a bit too dark. Great expression and pose. Nice, uncluttered background.</td>', 'Live action shots are tough. Nice detail on his face - neck area a bit too dark. Great expression and pose. Nice, uncluttered background.', '2012-02-17 23:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681606, 994646, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''m into the aqua cast. Looks like a winter scene. The tombstones almost are hidden by the processing.</td>', 'Not sure I''m into the aqua cast. Looks like a winter scene. The tombstones almost are hidden by the processing.', '2012-02-17 23:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
