(6681610, 997862, 25773, '<td valign="top">The more I look, the more I like it (fear it? :)). Voters not looking long enough might rate it low. Very unique and a bit spine chilling. 9 on my scale</td>', 'The more I look, the more I like it (fear it? :)). Voters not looking long enough might rate it low. Very unique and a bit spine chilling. 9 on my scale', '2012-02-17 23:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681611, 995627, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! Breathtaking! Love the textures in the clouds and mountains. It is especially interesting that the trees along the right side still have a coat of snow, the those in the valley and to the left don''t - differences in shadows &amp; sunlight. The sky is incredible.</td>', 'Wow! Breathtaking! Love the textures in the clouds and mountains. It is especially interesting that the trees along the right side still have a coat of snow, the those in the valley and to the left don''t - differences in shadows & sunlight. The sky is incredible.', '2012-02-17 23:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681612, 995975, 100831, '<td valign="top">excellent. love it. such quirkiness... great tones... and what a face!!!</td>', 'excellent. love it. such quirkiness... great tones... and what a face!!!', '2012-02-17 23:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681613, 998061, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and mirror-like surface.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and mirror-like surface.', '2012-02-17 23:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681614, 997650, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wow. Such an interesting display for those of us who''ve never witnessed this. Plus the rich tones and composition and so good - it just sparkles with life and color. Love it.</td>', 'Wow. Such an interesting display for those of us who''ve never witnessed this. Plus the rich tones and composition and so good - it just sparkles with life and color. Love it.', '2012-02-17 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681618, 994699, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. I like the use of DOF to blur the items in the background, yet they are readily recognizable symbols of the Christian faith. Not sure about the lighting / shadows on the left side of his face.</td>', 'Nice lighting. I like the use of DOF to blur the items in the background, yet they are readily recognizable symbols of the Christian faith. Not sure about the lighting / shadows on the left side of his face.', '2012-02-17 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
