(6681640, 997677, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nope. A home run hit! Wonderful lighting, flying hair, skin tones, and expression. She''s checking you out, and slightly amused / intrigued by what she sees.</td>', 'Nope. A home run hit! Wonderful lighting, flying hair, skin tones, and expression. She''s checking you out, and slightly amused / intrigued by what she sees.', '2012-02-17 23:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
