(6681648, 994053, 25773, '<td valign="top">Enviable focusing and nicely frozen motion. The light from the sky  in the background is a bit distracting... Maybe next time you could ask the owl to fly a little lower:))</td>', 'Enviable focusing and nicely frozen motion. The light from the sky  in the background is a bit distracting... Maybe next time you could ask the owl to fly a little lower:))', '2012-02-17 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681649, 997626, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ruins always fascinate me. Who was here, when, what were they like, what happened that this place, so carefully and lovingly constructed, was abandoned and fell into ruin? The lighting on this is very nice - great contrast and detail.</td>', 'Ruins always fascinate me. Who was here, when, what were they like, what happened that this place, so carefully and lovingly constructed, was abandoned and fell into ruin? The lighting on this is very nice - great contrast and detail.', '2012-02-17 23:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
