(6681667, 996709, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture on many fronts - one boot on and one boot off. Got to love the color of that door! Not quite chartreuse, but very close. Love the old woodwork on the top of the door frame, and the transom above the door. Rustic unpainted wooden shutters on the window look like they were added recently.</td>', 'Very interesting picture on many fronts - one boot on and one boot off. Got to love the color of that door! Not quite chartreuse, but very close. Love the old woodwork on the top of the door frame, and the transom above the door. Rustic unpainted wooden shutters on the window look like they were added recently.', '2012-02-17 23:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681668, 998151, 108069, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo. Fresh and crisp and wonderfully composed to capture the expanse of evergreens. Beautiful.</td>', 'Stunning photo. Fresh and crisp and wonderfully composed to capture the expanse of evergreens. Beautiful.', '2012-02-17 23:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681671, 998051, 108069, '<td valign="top">I can certainly see why you''d select this for your photo of the year. I would have. It''s beautiful, and a beautiful story.</td>', 'I can certainly see why you''d select this for your photo of the year. I would have. It''s beautiful, and a beautiful story.', '2012-02-17 23:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681672, 994184, 77196, '<td valign="top">Quite soft focus - not sure I like the blurry indistinct area between the front and back leaves - to me it is strong enough to detract from the overall shot. It also looks like you did some tonal adjustment to move thsi towards the pink / purple / blue range.</td>', 'Quite soft focus - not sure I like the blurry indistinct area between the front and back leaves - to me it is strong enough to detract from the overall shot. It also looks like you did some tonal adjustment to move thsi towards the pink / purple / blue range.', '2012-02-17 23:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
