(6681683, 997805, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Definitely conveys the feeling of the storm, with the rain in the distance. Also looks like there is an interesting ruins in the foreground on the edge of a plateau. Like the red in the near cloud too.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Definitely conveys the feeling of the storm, with the rain in the distance. Also looks like there is an interesting ruins in the foreground on the edge of a plateau. Like the red in the near cloud too.', '2012-02-18 00:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
