(6681686, 997874, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. A lot of dust on your sensor, but the angle of composition of the photo overrules that and the whole thing is still quite nice.</td>', 'Nice composition. A lot of dust on your sensor, but the angle of composition of the photo overrules that and the whole thing is still quite nice.', '2012-02-18 00:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681688, 997708, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ah, Lake Michigan - really an inland sea - large enough that you almost can''t see across it. This is a great shot, with folks strolling along and the wonderful colorful sunset and lighthouse. Just a subtle sun path on the water and flying gulls.</td>', 'Ah, Lake Michigan - really an inland sea - large enough that you almost can''t see across it. This is a great shot, with folks strolling along and the wonderful colorful sunset and lighthouse. Just a subtle sun path on the water and flying gulls.', '2012-02-18 00:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681690, 997873, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice minimalist shot, with very nice colors on the duck.</td>', 'Very nice minimalist shot, with very nice colors on the duck.', '2012-02-18 00:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681691, 993681, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a rugged, beautiful place, excellently captured. love the outflow of the fjord splashing down the mountainside to the valley below.</td>', 'What a rugged, beautiful place, excellently captured. love the outflow of the fjord splashing down the mountainside to the valley below.', '2012-02-18 00:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681693, 994702, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of all of this - looks like parts of a stair in the foreground, but unless it is grossly distorted, that would make the (child, I presume) way too small. But even comparing the child to the stones in the wall, he/she seems too small. The tilt of the shot adds to its mystery. Not sure this conveys the feeling of being chased, however.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of all of this - looks like parts of a stair in the foreground, but unless it is grossly distorted, that would make the (child, I presume) way too small. But even comparing the child to the stones in the wall, he/she seems too small. The tilt of the shot adds to its mystery. Not sure this conveys the feeling of being chased, however.', '2012-02-18 00:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681694, 995597, 77196, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I tell you we had too much food? These folks look fully satisfied. Great capture, use of DOF. Nice detail and textures.</td>', 'Didn''t I tell you we had too much food? These folks look fully satisfied. Great capture, use of DOF. Nice detail and textures.', '2012-02-18 00:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
