(6681814, 997693, 69668, '<td valign="top">Ha...love those expressions.  Don''t know if the group is overall happy or not.  Makes me smile though.</td>', 'Ha...love those expressions.  Don''t know if the group is overall happy or not.  Makes me smile though.', '2012-02-18 01:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681815, 998027, 119419, '<td valign="top">Good intensity with a number of stories to be found.</td>', 'Good intensity with a number of stories to be found.', '2012-02-18 01:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681816, 993681, 69668, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous landscape image with incredible DOF.</td>', 'Gorgeous landscape image with incredible DOF.', '2012-02-18 01:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681817, 995800, 119419, '<td valign="top">Zowie! lookout Vogue ;)</td>', 'Zowie! lookout Vogue ;)', '2012-02-18 01:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681818, 997912, 69668, '<td valign="top">Looks like a vintage ad for Vogue magazine.  I really like the way this is processed.</td>', 'Looks like a vintage ad for Vogue magazine.  I really like the way this is processed.', '2012-02-18 01:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681819, 994200, 119419, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2012-02-18 01:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681820, 995975, 69668, '<td valign="top">Teriffic ''slice of life'' image.</td>', 'Teriffic ''slice of life'' image.', '2012-02-18 01:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681821, 995129, 119419, '<td valign="top">dynamic image</td>', 'dynamic image', '2012-02-18 01:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681822, 996067, 69668, '<td valign="top">This image is really different....which is so refreshing!!!</td>', 'This image is really different....which is so refreshing!!!', '2012-02-18 01:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681823, 998047, 119419, '<td valign="top">Very cool, Neat at a guess, warms my heart ;)</td>', 'Very cool, Neat at a guess, warms my heart ;)', '2012-02-18 01:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681824, 996871, 69668, '<td valign="top">Gritty and engaging image.</td>', 'Gritty and engaging image.', '2012-02-18 01:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681825, 998196, 119419, '<td valign="top">Mr Icon himself, nice.</td>', 'Mr Icon himself, nice.', '2012-02-18 01:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681826, 996060, 119419, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot, has action, story and muted intrigue.</td>', 'Like it a lot, has action, story and muted intrigue.', '2012-02-18 01:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681827, 995146, 69668, '<td valign="top">Ths is quite the make-up and outfit.  She looks like something I have seen at the San Deigo Zoo....but with a bit more clothing on.  Different, and that is a good thing.</td>', 'Ths is quite the make-up and outfit.  She looks like something I have seen at the San Deigo Zoo....but with a bit more clothing on.  Different, and that is a good thing.', '2012-02-18 01:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681828, 997621, 69668, '<td valign="top">I really like the joyous mood this image has.  I can feel their happiness!! <br/> <br/>(voted earlier, coming back to comment)</td>', 'I really like the joyous mood this image has.  I can feel their happiness!!  (voted earlier, coming back to comment)', '2012-02-18 01:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681829, 997758, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, bright and crisp, good composition. A bit heavy handed on the saturation and HDR</td>', 'Lovely scene, bright and crisp, good composition. A bit heavy handed on the saturation and HDR', '2012-02-18 01:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681830, 993598, 69668, '<td valign="top">I do wish I could see her face more.....she looks like a very interesting and beautiful woman.  The focus is on the dead flowers....and I am not sure why?  Sometimes I do understand that images are vague and the viewer interpets them as she/he sees.  I am having a difficult time interpreting the story here though.</td>', 'I do wish I could see her face more.....she looks like a very interesting and beautiful woman.  The focus is on the dead flowers....and I am not sure why?  Sometimes I do understand that images are vague and the viewer interpets them as she/he sees.  I am having a difficult time interpreting the story here though.', '2012-02-18 01:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681831, 994078, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Other worldly. Not liking the tilted horison. I understand why as if left level it may not have had the impact you wanted.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Other worldly. Not liking the tilted horison. I understand why as if left level it may not have had the impact you wanted.', '2012-02-18 01:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681832, 997842, 69668, '<td valign="top">Mirror, mirror on the street.  :O)</td>', 'Mirror, mirror on the street.  :O)', '2012-02-18 01:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681833, 998181, 69668, '<td valign="top">Lots of stories to be told with that amazing face.</td>', 'Lots of stories to be told with that amazing face.', '2012-02-18 01:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681834, 997795, 69668, '<td valign="top">The baby looks very enchanted with the light.  Good expression that leaves me wondering what he/she see''s.</td>', 'The baby looks very enchanted with the light.  Good expression that leaves me wondering what he/she see''s.', '2012-02-18 01:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681837, 993654, 69668, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, do wish it was toned down just a bit.  Seems quite bright on my monitor (and it is calibrated).  I do like the center composition.....the images works well how it is composed.</td>', 'I like the colors, do wish it was toned down just a bit.  Seems quite bright on my monitor (and it is calibrated).  I do like the center composition.....the images works well how it is composed.', '2012-02-18 02:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681838, 997856, 108580, '<td valign="top">Love it. Has a distinct 70''s feel to it. Can''t explain it in artsy terms but reminds me of the advertising and imagery of that time.</td>', 'Love it. Has a distinct 70''s feel to it. Can''t explain it in artsy terms but reminds me of the advertising and imagery of that time.', '2012-02-18 02:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681840, 997328, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love these little blokes. Sharp where it needs to be. Bokeh where it needs to be. Nicely processed balanced image.</td>', 'Great shot. Love these little blokes. Sharp where it needs to be. Bokeh where it needs to be. Nicely processed balanced image.', '2012-02-18 02:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681842, 996605, 69668, '<td valign="top">Pup is having a great time!!!</td>', 'Pup is having a great time!!!', '2012-02-18 02:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681844, 996709, 69668, '<td valign="top">Good framing of the man.  Interesting image with strong emotion.</td>', 'Good framing of the man.  Interesting image with strong emotion.', '2012-02-18 02:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681846, 996456, 69668, '<td valign="top">Great timing on this capture.  Way over-sharpened....not sure if you could have toned that down and still get some details in the water and shark.  However, that is a once in a lifetime capture of that amazing creature.<br/> <br/>(voted earlier, commenting now)</td>', 'Great timing on this capture.  Way over-sharpened....not sure if you could have toned that down and still get some details in the water and shark.  However, that is a once in a lifetime capture of that amazing creature. (voted earlier, commenting now)', '2012-02-18 02:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681847, 996906, 69668, '<td valign="top">Nice details on the feathers....just a tad oversharpened.  Good colors and nice background sky....not over-blown.</td>', 'Nice details on the feathers....just a tad oversharpened.  Good colors and nice background sky....not over-blown.', '2012-02-18 02:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681848, 998095, 69668, '<td valign="top">Cool bikes....hope you raised money for the charity.  Wish the lines in the background were cloned out.</td>', 'Cool bikes....hope you raised money for the charity.  Wish the lines in the background were cloned out.', '2012-02-18 02:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681849, 998127, 69668, '<td valign="top">Good composition.....harsh lighting.  The large rock with the peak looks like a man ready to sneeze (carved out on the side).  Cute.</td>', 'Good composition.....harsh lighting.  The large rock with the peak looks like a man ready to sneeze (carved out on the side).  Cute.', '2012-02-18 02:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681850, 997397, 69668, '<td valign="top">Nice color, not over-satureated.  A bit more clarity would be good with such a macro image.</td>', 'Nice color, not over-satureated.  A bit more clarity would be good with such a macro image.', '2012-02-18 02:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681851, 996659, 69668, '<td valign="top">Looks lie fossil foliage.  Cool!</td>', 'Looks lie fossil foliage.  Cool!', '2012-02-18 02:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681852, 997123, 69668, '<td valign="top">Night time photography can be difficult.  Good control here with your exposure.</td>', 'Night time photography can be difficult.  Good control here with your exposure.', '2012-02-18 02:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681854, 997844, 69668, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.....yes.  My eyes are wandering all over the place.</td>', 'Interesting image.....yes.  My eyes are wandering all over the place.', '2012-02-18 02:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681855, 997581, 69668, '<td valign="top">A bit over exposed, which can be so difficult with night photography.  I would like to see this myself someday.</td>', 'A bit over exposed, which can be so difficult with night photography.  I would like to see this myself someday.', '2012-02-18 02:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681866, 993778, 119419, '<td valign="top">In a New York sate of mind..</td>', 'In a New York sate of mind..', '2012-02-18 03:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681867, 997882, 119419, '<td valign="top">Wonderful effort, the longer I sit with it the better it becomes.</td>', 'Wonderful effort, the longer I sit with it the better it becomes.', '2012-02-18 03:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6681874, 996015, 101668, '<td valign="top">This absolutely is my pick to win. I''ll keep my fingers crossed. This is so good.</td>', 'This absolutely is my pick to win. I''ll keep my fingers crossed. This is so good.', '2012-02-18 04:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
