(6683291, 997171, 43463, '<td valign="top">I lean my back onto it''s supportive trunk.<br/>The shelter of the shade, <br/>sings to me with the rustle of leaves.<br/>My thoughts follow the tangle of the tree,<br/>and find two, timid eyes staring back at me.<br/>I greet the little, masked fellow with a hello<br/>and I leave him to the branches cozy hug,<br/>for we have both sought the comfort of the tree.<br/> <br/>We spend so much time rushing about, looking down or straight forward. In those rare times we look up, we might find someone or something looking down at us:-) Quite an unexpected surprise. Nature gives us shelter in many different ways:-)</td>', 'I lean my back onto it''s supportive trunk.The shelter of the shade, sings to me with the rustle of leaves.My thoughts follow the tangle of the tree,and find two, timid eyes staring back at me.I greet the little, masked fellow with a helloand I leave him to the branches cozy hug,for we have both sought the comfort of the tree. We spend so much time rushing about, looking down or straight forward. In those rare times we look up, we might find someone or something looking down at us:-) Quite an unexpected surprise. Nature gives us shelter in many different ways:-)', '2012-02-19 14:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
