(6683368, 994863, 103142, '<td valign="top">Love the starkness. Love the lines. Love the choice of lens. I think I''d like it cropped up from the bottom a bit, but I''m not sure. Doesn''t matter -- it''s a 9 anyway. :)</td>', 'Love the starkness. Love the lines. Love the choice of lens. I think I''d like it cropped up from the bottom a bit, but I''m not sure. Doesn''t matter -- it''s a 9 anyway. :)', '2012-02-19 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
