(6683370, 997278, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell if the boy is looking at the camera or not, it looks like he''s looking just beyond it which throws me off a little but the focus and crispness on the dogs is spot on, lovely pets picture.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell if the boy is looking at the camera or not, it looks like he''s looking just beyond it which throws me off a little but the focus and crispness on the dogs is spot on, lovely pets picture.', '2012-02-19 16:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
