(6683379, 994730, 94265, '<td valign="top">Her skin looks a little over-processed. Nice crisp focus on her lips. I don''t mind close-in face shots but I''m not keen on the choice to crop through her chin. Pretty model.</td>', 'Her skin looks a little over-processed. Nice crisp focus on her lips. I don''t mind close-in face shots but I''m not keen on the choice to crop through her chin. Pretty model.', '2012-02-19 16:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
