(6683402, 994699, 94265, '<td valign="top">This would be great for a church website or newsletter, has a very commercial feel. Did you burn the book in the background? Looks like it''s had a go with the burn tool up a bit too high. Not immensely distracting though. Nice focus on the fellow.</td>', 'This would be great for a church website or newsletter, has a very commercial feel. Did you burn the book in the background? Looks like it''s had a go with the burn tool up a bit too high. Not immensely distracting though. Nice focus on the fellow.', '2012-02-19 16:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
