(6683405, 997739, 109227, '<td valign="top">Love the processing of this one; the person almost looks like he doesn''t fit in the scene; need a cow or horse, lol.  (voted earlier)</td>', 'Love the processing of this one; the person almost looks like he doesn''t fit in the scene; need a cow or horse, lol.  (voted earlier)', '2012-02-19 16:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
