(6683407, 996226, 2333, '<td valign="top">Looking at this, I can feel the heat and humidity, even though it''s been four years since I''ve visited there. I love the processing, especially the sky. To me it looks like a *little* rotation clockwise might be in order; the pyramid looks like it leans slightly left. The near corner is vertical, but it still seems to lean left.</td>', 'Looking at this, I can feel the heat and humidity, even though it''s been four years since I''ve visited there. I love the processing, especially the sky. To me it looks like a *little* rotation clockwise might be in order; the pyramid looks like it leans slightly left. The near corner is vertical, but it still seems to lean left.', '2012-02-19 16:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683408, 996772, 2333, '<td valign="top">That''s a tough moment to capture. Nice catch!</td>', 'That''s a tough moment to capture. Nice catch!', '2012-02-19 16:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683409, 994454, 94265, '<td valign="top">The sharpness feels a little strong for me, I''m seeing some quite jagged edges on the rocks and the plants. Still, lovely place, good capture on the water movement.</td>', 'The sharpness feels a little strong for me, I''m seeing some quite jagged edges on the rocks and the plants. Still, lovely place, good capture on the water movement.', '2012-02-19 16:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
