(6683664, 998178, 43463, '<td valign="top">I wander. <br/>I roam.<br/>I dare you<br/>to take me home.<br/> <br/>You captured great detail on the eyes and face. And that stare. That full on stare at us is trying to measure whether he should run for it or *allow* us to approach. It is a stare that is sizing us up; measuring us. One that speaks that if you are entertaining the thought to take him home it would be foolish. For he, not you, will choose if he stays or runs off to roam.</td>', 'I wander. I roam.I dare youto take me home. You captured great detail on the eyes and face. And that stare. That full on stare at us is trying to measure whether he should run for it or *allow* us to approach. It is a stare that is sizing us up; measuring us. One that speaks that if you are entertaining the thought to take him home it would be foolish. For he, not you, will choose if he stays or runs off to roam.', '2012-02-19 19:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
