(6683781, 996566, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a great capture. The contrast of the aged face and the young face, the lines of worry and care and the innocence of youth. Great detail, and colors.</td>', 'What a great capture. The contrast of the aged face and the young face, the lines of worry and care and the innocence of youth. Great detail, and colors.', '2012-02-19 21:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
