(6683791, 998027, 77196, '<td valign="top">Takes a while, with a break from all the realistic photos in the challenge, but this has some interesting facets to it. The white face that looks like is unresolves on its right side (especially the nose), and firms up into a flesh colored mostly in focus ear on his left side. My impression is of an older guy struggling to resolve his life''s experiences with the remainder of his life.</td>', 'Takes a while, with a break from all the realistic photos in the challenge, but this has some interesting facets to it. The white face that looks like is unresolves on its right side (especially the nose), and firms up into a flesh colored mostly in focus ear on his left side. My impression is of an older guy struggling to resolve his life''s experiences with the remainder of his life.', '2012-02-19 21:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683793, 994762, 77196, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like cut paper. Love the four-tone picture. Not sure the towers are a favorite - suppose you couldn''t get them to take them down so you could get a clean picture. ;-p</td>', 'Almost looks like cut paper. Love the four-tone picture. Not sure the towers are a favorite - suppose you couldn''t get them to take them down so you could get a clean picture. ;-p', '2012-02-19 21:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
