(6683866, 998086, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is a nice broad view of the farm. Nice processing, pleasing composition. You might want to consider trying to find a perspective that shows a lot less, but captures the "essence" of the farm. For example, I don''t have to see the whole barn to get the concept of "barn". I like the creek running through it.</td>', 'This is a nice broad view of the farm. Nice processing, pleasing composition. You might want to consider trying to find a perspective that shows a lot less, but captures the "essence" of the farm. For example, I don''t have to see the whole barn to get the concept of "barn". I like the creek running through it.', '2012-02-19 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683869, 995766, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a cutie! Great use of white background, bright color, and interesting pose.</td>', 'What a cutie! Great use of white background, bright color, and interesting pose.', '2012-02-19 22:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683870, 998047, 77196, '<td valign="top">In our civilized complexity, too often we forget that happiness does not depend on what we have, but on who we are, who we love, and who loves us.</td>', 'In our civilized complexity, too often we forget that happiness does not depend on what we have, but on who we are, who we love, and who loves us.', '2012-02-19 22:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683875, 993772, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not your traditional expectation of female beauty (or even male beauty for that matter). What interesting juxtaposition of the model, and the bright red dress &amp; umbrella. The right side of his face is a bit dark, but really doesn''t detract.</td>', 'Not your traditional expectation of female beauty (or even male beauty for that matter). What interesting juxtaposition of the model, and the bright red dress & umbrella. The right side of his face is a bit dark, but really doesn''t detract.', '2012-02-19 22:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683877, 998108, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and well done crowd shot.</td>', 'Very interesting and well done crowd shot.', '2012-02-19 22:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683878, 997840, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. Very nice use of color, transitioning from one side to the other. Distorted enough so you can''t really figure out what it was originally. Like the motion projectiles on the left side that keep this from being too static.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. Very nice use of color, transitioning from one side to the other. Distorted enough so you can''t really figure out what it was originally. Like the motion projectiles on the left side that keep this from being too static.', '2012-02-19 22:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683880, 995732, 77196, '<td valign="top">Oh, you believe in challenges, don''t you? This is a very nice shot from below the falls. Love the vivid green of the moss on the left side, the subtle difference between the blue of the water and the sky, the whites of the mist and clouds.</td>', 'Oh, you believe in challenges, don''t you? This is a very nice shot from below the falls. Love the vivid green of the moss on the left side, the subtle difference between the blue of the water and the sky, the whites of the mist and clouds.', '2012-02-19 22:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6683882, 995389, 77196, '<td valign="top">Almost give me a neck ache just looking at the picture. Very nice perspective and interest floor after floor as your eye goes up the tower. Nice processing.</td>', 'Almost give me a neck ache just looking at the picture. Very nice perspective and interest floor after floor as your eye goes up the tower. Nice processing.', '2012-02-19 22:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
