(6683899, 994896, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Equal possibilities is that the next thing she''ll do is rip your head off with her bare hands, or that she''ll suddenly laugh. I wouldn''t describe her expression as neutral - it is anything but. Perhaps enigmatic. Very nice lighting and capture of skin tones.</td>', 'Great capture. Equal possibilities is that the next thing she''ll do is rip your head off with her bare hands, or that she''ll suddenly laugh. I wouldn''t describe her expression as neutral - it is anything but. Perhaps enigmatic. Very nice lighting and capture of skin tones.', '2012-02-19 22:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
