(6683905, 997695, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not your typical view. Not sure what the line markings on the floor mean. Not sure what is means by "box" - there is a black square on the floor, but the boards around the edge provide clear definition of the height of that part, and make the wall (which it looks like he''s pressing against) looks like it is behind the boards bordering the floor, and there is obviously not a visible fore or side wall. It also does not appear to be a "mime ''box''".</td>', 'Not your typical view. Not sure what the line markings on the floor mean. Not sure what is means by "box" - there is a black square on the floor, but the boards around the edge provide clear definition of the height of that part, and make the wall (which it looks like he''s pressing against) looks like it is behind the boards bordering the floor, and there is obviously not a visible fore or side wall. It also does not appear to be a "mime ''box''".', '2012-02-19 22:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
