(6684036, 996902, 42013, '<td valign="top">Mount Banner -- AHHHH, fantastic! I spent 5 nights in and around the Minarets/Banner/Lyell range this summer. One of our campsites was at the west end of 1000 Island Lake, at the feet of Banner. I had a similar shot as yours that i considered entering but yours is 10x better than mine so I''m glad I held back. :) Good luck and I''d like to get some details from you regarding the technicals of your shot. Stacked images?</td>', 'Mount Banner -- AHHHH, fantastic! I spent 5 nights in and around the Minarets/Banner/Lyell range this summer. One of our campsites was at the west end of 1000 Island Lake, at the feet of Banner. I had a similar shot as yours that i considered entering but yours is 10x better than mine so I''m glad I held back. :) Good luck and I''d like to get some details from you regarding the technicals of your shot. Stacked images?', '2012-02-19 23:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
