(6685353, 995911, 50695, '<td valign="top">The Ballerina<br/> <br/> <br/>I make my body art.<br/>I make my body lines<br/>and fine French words.<br/>I make my body lives<br/>and terrible deaths.<br/>I make my body not a body<br/>but a story.<br/> <br/>My body is not me.<br/>My body speaks<br/>but I am silent to you<br/>and my heart<br/>is in the dressing room.</td>', 'The Ballerina  I make my body art.I make my body linesand fine French words.I make my body livesand terrible deaths.I make my body not a bodybut a story. My body is not me.My body speaksbut I am silent to youand my heartis in the dressing room.', '2012-02-20 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
