(6685374, 998136, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, colors, light and shadow. I sometimes tire of the silky smoothness of  water taken with a longer exposure, but this one has a lot going on that complements that smoothness.</td>', 'Lovely composition, colors, light and shadow. I sometimes tire of the silky smoothness of  water taken with a longer exposure, but this one has a lot going on that complements that smoothness.', '2012-02-20 16:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685406, 997874, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great choice of angle to get that wonderful reflection. The angled horizon works really well too.</td>', 'Great choice of angle to get that wonderful reflection. The angled horizon works really well too.', '2012-02-20 17:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685410, 997410, 7327, '<td valign="top">I like how the horizon almost disappears in the mist, beautiful color gradient.</td>', 'I like how the horizon almost disappears in the mist, beautiful color gradient.', '2012-02-20 17:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685412, 995223, 7327, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, I like how the wave frames the birds on the beach.</td>', 'Interesting composition, I like how the wave frames the birds on the beach.', '2012-02-20 17:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685414, 998111, 7327, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I like the sharpness throughout. Beautiful color  too.</td>', 'Nice composition, I like the sharpness throughout. Beautiful color  too.', '2012-02-20 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685418, 998038, 7327, '<td valign="top">Great stop action shot, the splash tells the story of the capture. I cant wait to see the specifics on shutter speed, ISO etc. Nice shot!</td>', 'Great stop action shot, the splash tells the story of the capture. I cant wait to see the specifics on shutter speed, ISO etc. Nice shot!', '2012-02-20 17:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685437, 993778, 7327, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to understand what I was looking at; its close to a pure abstraction. I like the flow of the hand below the eye and the contemplative feel.</td>', 'It took me awhile to understand what I was looking at; its close to a pure abstraction. I like the flow of the hand below the eye and the contemplative feel.', '2012-02-20 18:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685469, 994594, 117717, '<td valign="top">Nice tones &amp; textures.  I like your framing.</td>', 'Nice tones & textures.  I like your framing.', '2012-02-20 18:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685471, 997200, 117717, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen many shots of this subject, but none with quite the emotion behind this photo.  The moody sky, the lighting &amp; the b&amp;w conversion are wonderful.</td>', 'I''ve seen many shots of this subject, but none with quite the emotion behind this photo.  The moody sky, the lighting & the b&w conversion are wonderful.', '2012-02-20 18:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685472, 993604, 117717, '<td valign="top">Like the graphic look.</td>', 'Like the graphic look.', '2012-02-20 18:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685473, 997856, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very rare nature shot, in that it conveys a mood to me. A warm spring morning, and I''m out for a pleasant bike ride (of course) shortly after dawn. I stop under this tree near the river to enjoy the sound of the leaves rustling in the light breeze. The moment of quiet helps to put things into perspective for me.<br/> <br/>I will admit that I had to look at this shot a few minutes for it to grow on me. Not one that can be fully appreciated in 3 seconds. Something about it made me pause and linger over it longer, and that is always worth some extra pointage.</td>', 'A very rare nature shot, in that it conveys a mood to me. A warm spring morning, and I''m out for a pleasant bike ride (of course) shortly after dawn. I stop under this tree near the river to enjoy the sound of the leaves rustling in the light breeze. The moment of quiet helps to put things into perspective for me. I will admit that I had to look at this shot a few minutes for it to grow on me. Not one that can be fully appreciated in 3 seconds. Something about it made me pause and linger over it longer, and that is always worth some extra pointage.', '2012-02-20 18:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685474, 994157, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice usage of B/W. I''ve got a lot of herons near me, and I hope to nail as good a shot as this one some day.</td>', 'Very nice usage of B/W. I''ve got a lot of herons near me, and I hope to nail as good a shot as this one some day.', '2012-02-20 18:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685475, 997554, 117717, '<td valign="top">Terrific mood, I keep coming back for another look!</td>', 'Terrific mood, I keep coming back for another look!', '2012-02-20 18:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685477, 998010, 117717, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, love the reflections.</td>', 'Beautiful colours, love the reflections.', '2012-02-20 19:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685478, 995665, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, though there are some serious artifacts around the edges of the jellyfish. Not sure what may have caused this particular appearance. I expect it will do well in spite of that problem.</td>', 'Lovely scene, though there are some serious artifacts around the edges of the jellyfish. Not sure what may have caused this particular appearance. I expect it will do well in spite of that problem.', '2012-02-20 19:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
