(6685777, 996974, 119419, '<td valign="top">Yes, been there, ouch doing the half pass out. Maybe the rosettes are too tight. Good landing though, but that''s probably a small part of the story. Great in the moment shot.</td>', 'Yes, been there, ouch doing the half pass out. Maybe the rosettes are too tight. Good landing though, but that''s probably a small part of the story. Great in the moment shot.', '2012-02-21 00:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685804, 993656, 86218, '<td valign="top">To comment on this feels like Im commenting on countless trips to the mountains, experiences, adventures, nerve wrecking moments, storms and memories...just to find myself without words... How do you describe it? Maybe the best way is to capture it in a image like you have done here. The silence and calmness portrayed here prompts enough emotions to relive everything at once. You have done a superb job of capturing the essence of what makes it all worth it. Photography has always been just an extension of going to the mountains but in this image maybe it''s more than that. It WAS the hike and Im so glad you have a figure in it as well. It turns this into the ultimate tourist shot making everybody whish that they were part of the experience. <br/>Thanks Steve</td>', 'To comment on this feels like Im commenting on countless trips to the mountains, experiences, adventures, nerve wrecking moments, storms and memories...just to find myself without words... How do you describe it? Maybe the best way is to capture it in a image like you have done here. The silence and calmness portrayed here prompts enough emotions to relive everything at once. You have done a superb job of capturing the essence of what makes it all worth it. Photography has always been just an extension of going to the mountains but in this image maybe it''s more than that. It WAS the hike and Im so glad you have a figure in it as well. It turns this into the ultimate tourist shot making everybody whish that they were part of the experience. Thanks Steve', '2012-02-21 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685834, 995635, 114233, '<td valign="top">Now that I know which one is yours Harvey... (not voting)<br/>Nice comp and clarity with good DOF control. DOF helps to isolate the subject nicely but it looks like there might be a bit of noise creeping in?<br/>Would love to have seen some more detail in the dark underside but being in shadow and knowing the light from above makes it almost impossible I think you did ok.<br/>Here''s looking at you Kid!</td>', 'Now that I know which one is yours Harvey... (not voting)Nice comp and clarity with good DOF control. DOF helps to isolate the subject nicely but it looks like there might be a bit of noise creeping in?Would love to have seen some more detail in the dark underside but being in shadow and knowing the light from above makes it almost impossible I think you did ok.Here''s looking at you Kid!', '2012-02-21 02:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685843, 997200, 24486, '<td valign="top">I have seen this photographed so many times.Even I have entered it in a challenge but this is quite unique. I really like how you have captured this. Good choice to go B&amp;W too.</td>', 'I have seen this photographed so many times.Even I have entered it in a challenge but this is quite unique. I really like how you have captured this. Good choice to go B&W too.', '2012-02-21 03:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6685892, 996154, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wings beat a quick tune<br/>flit flight flower to flower<br/>wee bird hums on by<br/> <br/>Fabulous detail and rich color in the body of this tiny bird. Still amazing to me that while one part of the body is in full hypersonic motion that we can still see razor sharp detail in the rest of body...this is true live in person as it is in camera.</td>', 'Wings beat a quick tuneflit flight flower to flowerwee bird hums on by Fabulous detail and rich color in the body of this tiny bird. Still amazing to me that while one part of the body is in full hypersonic motion that we can still see razor sharp detail in the rest of body...this is true live in person as it is in camera.', '2012-02-21 08:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
