(6685974, 995484, 43463, '<td valign="top">A wild flower is she,<br/>dressed for the hunt<br/>in yellow with tattooed stripes.<br/>Her mane of hair flares<br/>and painted claw extends,<br/>the tiger lily is on the prowl.<br/> <br/>Great lighting and detail on this model portrait! Her pose and how she is dressed conjures up imagery of a wild flower AND that of a wild cat - thus, in my mind, tiger lily is an apt combination/description of this photo.</td>', 'A wild flower is she,dressed for the huntin yellow with tattooed stripes.Her mane of hair flaresand painted claw extends,the tiger lily is on the prowl. Great lighting and detail on this model portrait! Her pose and how she is dressed conjures up imagery of a wild flower AND that of a wild cat - thus, in my mind, tiger lily is an apt combination/description of this photo.', '2012-02-21 09:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
