(6685981, 996456, 114225, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it crazy seeing this in person?<br/>Unfortunately, it seems you may have had the same problem I had on a similar trip: no polarizing filter to reduce the glare and give more impact to the shark.</td>', 'Isn''t it crazy seeing this in person?Unfortunately, it seems you may have had the same problem I had on a similar trip: no polarizing filter to reduce the glare and give more impact to the shark.', '2012-02-21 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
