(6685986, 995003, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool looking candle, I would like one like that.<br/>However, this photo doesn''t offer me a lot of context. This cool of a candle leads me to believe that this is in a cool place, so I would like to see it.</td>', 'That''s a really cool looking candle, I would like one like that.However, this photo doesn''t offer me a lot of context. This cool of a candle leads me to believe that this is in a cool place, so I would like to see it.', '2012-02-21 10:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
