(6686084, 993680, 67258, '<td valign="top">Talk about perfect timing! The ultra fast shutter speed lends a really interesting quality to this - forever suspended in time. The mono conversion is a bold move for nature photography, but works well, and sets the image apart.</td>', 'Talk about perfect timing! The ultra fast shutter speed lends a really interesting quality to this - forever suspended in time. The mono conversion is a bold move for nature photography, but works well, and sets the image apart.', '2012-02-21 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
