(6686172, 995800, 141409, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot and scored appropriately.  My only criticism is that the eyes look a little dark but I guess that''s more an image size issue than a make up one.  Lovely colours and a striking pose.</td>', 'I like this a lot and scored appropriately.  My only criticism is that the eyes look a little dark but I guess that''s more an image size issue than a make up one.  Lovely colours and a striking pose.', '2012-02-21 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
