(6686868, 997997, 114233, '<td valign="top">You captured the expressions on the faces wonderfully! The border may be a bit strong and heavy for this shot - I would rather see a bigger shot with more detail.</td>', 'You captured the expressions on the faces wonderfully! The border may be a bit strong and heavy for this shot - I would rather see a bigger shot with more detail.', '2012-02-22 05:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686869, 997397, 114233, '<td valign="top">The fly is a nice touch and adds interest. Well spotted</td>', 'The fly is a nice touch and adds interest. Well spotted', '2012-02-22 05:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686870, 998155, 114233, '<td valign="top">Probably <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=4517" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">marbo</a>. A lovely scene and captures the beauty of IR nicely with the dark sky and bright foliage with black water too.<br/>The comp is good and the eye gets led on a journey through the pic up the stream along the banks and onto the nice pink / red coloured tree on the far bank and onto the nice swirling cloud sin the sky. <br/>Thanks for the lovely entry!</td>', 'Probably  marbo. A lovely scene and captures the beauty of IR nicely with the dark sky and bright foliage with black water too.The comp is good and the eye gets led on a journey through the pic up the stream along the banks and onto the nice pink / red coloured tree on the far bank and onto the nice swirling cloud sin the sky. Thanks for the lovely entry!', '2012-02-22 05:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686872, 997791, 114233, '<td valign="top">I can see that you tried to include some foreground interest so that is a good thing. The horizon is smack bang in the middle of the shot so it feels like it cuts the picture in half.</td>', 'I can see that you tried to include some foreground interest so that is a good thing. The horizon is smack bang in the middle of the shot so it feels like it cuts the picture in half.', '2012-02-22 05:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686875, 998106, 114233, '<td valign="top">A still life by someone that looks like they know what they are doing with light. Not the most interesting subjects but the light is used well to capture all the different surfaces from the smooth vase to the slightly textured pear. Exposure is spot on to show just a hint of texture in the wooden surface too! Well done</td>', 'A still life by someone that looks like they know what they are doing with light. Not the most interesting subjects but the light is used well to capture all the different surfaces from the smooth vase to the slightly textured pear. Exposure is spot on to show just a hint of texture in the wooden surface too! Well done', '2012-02-22 06:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686878, 997323, 114233, '<td valign="top">Yes that certainly is a broken home. <br/>The exposure looks very well controlled but the composition feels a bit bottom heavy to me. There is a lot of sky and the horizon is almost dead in the middle of the shot. Would work much better for me by cropping off a chunk of sky just above the clouds on the top.</td>', 'Yes that certainly is a broken home. The exposure looks very well controlled but the composition feels a bit bottom heavy to me. There is a lot of sky and the horizon is almost dead in the middle of the shot. Would work much better for me by cropping off a chunk of sky just above the clouds on the top.', '2012-02-22 06:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686879, 997647, 114233, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting and great exposure. Glad you kept some texture in the skin and didnt soften it too much. Face is beautifully sharp without being unflattering.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting and great exposure. Glad you kept some texture in the skin and didnt soften it too much. Face is beautifully sharp without being unflattering.', '2012-02-22 06:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686880, 996747, 114233, '<td valign="top">Would have been fantastic irony if it was actually raining when you took this!<br/>Nice crisp clean shot and I like the processing on this</td>', 'Would have been fantastic irony if it was actually raining when you took this!Nice crisp clean shot and I like the processing on this', '2012-02-22 06:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686881, 998178, 114233, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely<br/>DOF and comp excellent! clarity and processing top notch</td>', 'Simply lovelyDOF and comp excellent! clarity and processing top notch', '2012-02-22 06:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686882, 997779, 114233, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=89723" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sempermarine</a> is that you? I think I recognise this shot from the WPL so I wont vote. Processing is nice and the dark grungy feel obviously works well with this type of shot. The only bits that looks a bit odd is the left (model''s right) ear - the lighting changes from a dark tip to a much brighter section where it joins the head as well as the neck just below the same ear.</td>', ' Sempermarine is that you? I think I recognise this shot from the WPL so I wont vote. Processing is nice and the dark grungy feel obviously works well with this type of shot. The only bits that looks a bit odd is the left (model''s right) ear - the lighting changes from a dark tip to a much brighter section where it joins the head as well as the neck just below the same ear.', '2012-02-22 06:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686883, 997862, 114233, '<td valign="top">This thumbnail stood out when viewing all 400+ images and its even better when looking at it big! Border is big but it works for me. Not sure if it is a lensbaby but the OOF areas really help to make you focus on the one mask in focus and the other look ghostly in apprearance. Hope it does well!</td>', 'This thumbnail stood out when viewing all 400+ images and its even better when looking at it big! Border is big but it works for me. Not sure if it is a lensbaby but the OOF areas really help to make you focus on the one mask in focus and the other look ghostly in apprearance. Hope it does well!', '2012-02-22 06:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6686888, 996974, 114233, '<td valign="top">Superb timing and shutter speed to match! Pity the railing cut the horse''s foot off but how can I penalise you for that?? Those jods are not going to be white in about 1/500 seconds time.</td>', 'Superb timing and shutter speed to match! Pity the railing cut the horse''s foot off but how can I penalise you for that?? Those jods are not going to be white in about 1/500 seconds time.', '2012-02-22 06:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
