(6687792, 997677, 41129, '<td valign="top">i personally would have liked to see smaller, less distracting earrings on the model but still a lovely shot, her eyes really draw you in and for that you get an 8 from me :)</td>', 'i personally would have liked to see smaller, less distracting earrings on the model but still a lovely shot, her eyes really draw you in and for that you get an 8 from me :)', '2012-02-22 20:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
