(6687879, 993681, 69324, '<td valign="top">That must be quite remarkable to see in real life, nice work. NV</td>', 'That must be quite remarkable to see in real life, nice work. NV', '2012-02-22 22:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687880, 995597, 69324, '<td valign="top">My favorite part is that the one in the middle looks like he is scratching the other ones back.  Nice job. NV</td>', 'My favorite part is that the one in the middle looks like he is scratching the other ones back.  Nice job. NV', '2012-02-22 22:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687884, 996203, 69324, '<td valign="top">Not sure I can fully equate the attire with my perception of a manifesto writer, but I like the execution and thought process, bumping up.</td>', 'Not sure I can fully equate the attire with my perception of a manifesto writer, but I like the execution and thought process, bumping up.', '2012-02-22 22:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687900, 996747, 77196, '<td valign="top">I really like the balance of the wall painting and the girl, with her red flower matching the red in the painting.</td>', 'I really like the balance of the wall painting and the girl, with her red flower matching the red in the painting.', '2012-02-22 22:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687901, 997621, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of celebration. Great silhouettes against the wonderful colors in the sky.</td>', 'Nice capture of celebration. Great silhouettes against the wonderful colors in the sky.', '2012-02-22 22:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687905, 997788, 77196, '<td valign="top">This looks like the Southern U.S., with the moss hanging from the trees. The picture just draws you in and makes you wonder what waits at the end of the road - a wonderful Southern Plantation? a spooky deserted house? an open field? The greens really pop in this.</td>', 'This looks like the Southern U.S., with the moss hanging from the trees. The picture just draws you in and makes you wonder what waits at the end of the road - a wonderful Southern Plantation? a spooky deserted house? an open field? The greens really pop in this.', '2012-02-22 22:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687908, 993697, 77196, '<td valign="top">The lack of ability to identify where this might be adds to the captivating quality of the shot - likewise the man on his knees, looking towards the picture of the woman. The hanging lines of balls (Christmas ornaments?) and the shadows from the skylight grills add texture. Also, the lack of furniture.</td>', 'The lack of ability to identify where this might be adds to the captivating quality of the shot - likewise the man on his knees, looking towards the picture of the woman. The hanging lines of balls (Christmas ornaments?) and the shadows from the skylight grills add texture. Also, the lack of furniture.', '2012-02-22 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687913, 995297, 77196, '<td valign="top">Various elements are overdone - e.g., the size of the chain - but I''m not sure it adds to the effect. Her expression, at least, does not look happy, and the little wrinkle above her eyebrow at least indicates concern about her condition. Nice lighting &amp; skin tones.</td>', 'Various elements are overdone - e.g., the size of the chain - but I''m not sure it adds to the effect. Her expression, at least, does not look happy, and the little wrinkle above her eyebrow at least indicates concern about her condition. Nice lighting & skin tones.', '2012-02-22 22:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687915, 993654, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great intense capture with lots of bright, vibrant colors. I like the wet - you can''t tell if it is currently raining, tho the umbrella indicates it might be - how it adds reflection to the tracks.</td>', 'Great intense capture with lots of bright, vibrant colors. I like the wet - you can''t tell if it is currently raining, tho the umbrella indicates it might be - how it adds reflection to the tracks.', '2012-02-22 23:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687917, 996456, 77196, '<td valign="top">Found ME you did. Ummm. Great stop motion capture, with all the droplets of water frozen mid-air. The offset frame adds tension to the shot.</td>', 'Found ME you did. Ummm. Great stop motion capture, with all the droplets of water frozen mid-air. The offset frame adds tension to the shot.', '2012-02-22 23:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687920, 997217, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect  on the green lighting, shiny surfaces and floor. Loos seldom being attractive places (visually), this is a very different subject.</td>', 'Interesting effect  on the green lighting, shiny surfaces and floor. Loos seldom being attractive places (visually), this is a very different subject.', '2012-02-22 23:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687922, 996871, 77196, '<td valign="top">Lady is nicely framed by the doorway and white containers. Not enough here to really get a sense of what you are trying to convey. She definitely has l - o - n - g legs.</td>', 'Lady is nicely framed by the doorway and white containers. Not enough here to really get a sense of what you are trying to convey. She definitely has l - o - n - g legs.', '2012-02-22 23:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687924, 996301, 77196, '<td valign="top">I really want to like this picture, but something just doesn''t seem right about it - I think it is the shadows on the blue background, which seem to indicate that it isn''t sky. The yellow and reddish brown in the leaves is pretty, but just seems a tad off of real maple leaves. Composition is good.</td>', 'I really want to like this picture, but something just doesn''t seem right about it - I think it is the shadows on the blue background, which seem to indicate that it isn''t sky. The yellow and reddish brown in the leaves is pretty, but just seems a tad off of real maple leaves. Composition is good.', '2012-02-22 23:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687925, 996407, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, and the flowers just add a nice splash of color.</td>', 'Wonderful capture, and the flowers just add a nice splash of color.', '2012-02-22 23:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687928, 993947, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of lighting and interesting angle to convey the essence of this classic machine.</td>', 'Very nice use of lighting and interesting angle to convey the essence of this classic machine.', '2012-02-22 23:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687929, 998197, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice flyover shot. I kind-of like the tilted tower. Great sky &amp; clouds.</td>', 'Very nice flyover shot. I kind-of like the tilted tower. Great sky & clouds.', '2012-02-22 23:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687932, 993706, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice reflective picture. It interestingly captures two aspects of her face, which looks thoughtful. The placement of her hand against the reflective surface adds a poignancy to the shot, and the multiple star earrings add a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice reflective picture. It interestingly captures two aspects of her face, which looks thoughtful. The placement of her hand against the reflective surface adds a poignancy to the shot, and the multiple star earrings add a nice touch.', '2012-02-22 23:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687934, 993604, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of dof to isolate her from the crowd on the sidewalk, plus framing her with the lines of the crosswalk. The papers she''s holding make a nice contrast to her black coat.</td>', 'Very nice use of dof to isolate her from the crowd on the sidewalk, plus framing her with the lines of the crosswalk. The papers she''s holding make a nice contrast to her black coat.', '2012-02-22 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687936, 995828, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and sky. The rocky coast looks like Maine. Very nice lines leading the eye through the shot.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and sky. The rocky coast looks like Maine. Very nice lines leading the eye through the shot.', '2012-02-22 23:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6687937, 997002, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very crisp with lots of detail. Is the black shading on the flower PP-induced or there on the real flower? Nice contrast between the green leaves &amp; white flower.</td>', 'Very crisp with lots of detail. Is the black shading on the flower PP-induced or there on the real flower? Nice contrast between the green leaves & white flower.', '2012-02-22 23:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
