(6687968, 995125, 77196, '<td valign="top">Evidently not totally, judging by the gold or silver armband on her night arm. Not sure why she''d be sitting naked on a cold tile floor along a wall - maybe a corner, but just along a wall? Not sure her curled up right foot adds to the image or not, but it does stand out as a difference from the rest of her pose. You''ve done a pretty good job of balancing subdued light for the mood with adequate light to capture skin tone. Having her hair cover her face gives more of an impression of hiding than being forgotten. This seems like a really tough shot - a high bar to reach, and I''m being really picky...</td>', 'Evidently not totally, judging by the gold or silver armband on her night arm. Not sure why she''d be sitting naked on a cold tile floor along a wall - maybe a corner, but just along a wall? Not sure her curled up right foot adds to the image or not, but it does stand out as a difference from the rest of her pose. You''ve done a pretty good job of balancing subdued light for the mood with adequate light to capture skin tone. Having her hair cover her face gives more of an impression of hiding than being forgotten. This seems like a really tough shot - a high bar to reach, and I''m being really picky...', '2012-02-22 23:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
