(6688036, 993924, 43463, '<td valign="top">The clock struck six. Elias packed up his sketches, placed them in his briefcase, and left for home. As he walked out the door, his mind still danced with grand and magical ideas. Much like the architecture of the building, Elias'' imagination was sweeping &amp; swirling. The lines of thought were curving and curling, free from rigid constraints.<br/> <br/>The architecture of this building is wonderful - the mind''s eye just follows the flow of curved and free lines. This is what can be build when imagination is not locked in the rigid rectangular shape of thought. B&amp;W tones are great for it really highlights the beauty of the buildings shape and curves.</td>', 'The clock struck six. Elias packed up his sketches, placed them in his briefcase, and left for home. As he walked out the door, his mind still danced with grand and magical ideas. Much like the architecture of the building, Elias'' imagination was sweeping & swirling. The lines of thought were curving and curling, free from rigid constraints. The architecture of this building is wonderful - the mind''s eye just follows the flow of curved and free lines. This is what can be build when imagination is not locked in the rigid rectangular shape of thought. B&W tones are great for it really highlights the beauty of the buildings shape and curves.', '2012-02-23 00:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
