(6688358, 997323, 43463, '<td valign="top">Beyond the valley green,<br/>down in fields of gold<br/>lays a broken dream<br/>empty and forgotten.<br/> <br/>I find the juxtaposition of the broken house with the golden fields and green valley very symbolic of the lost dream. A house to call home perhaps for generations. But here is lies empty and abandoned - the green valley I see as spring and renewal - but for this broken home there will be none. The fields of gold being the realm where fond memories of the past can be revisited (the golden years) offer no shelter for the broken dream of ''home'' is not just physically broken &amp; forgotten but that of the spirit as well.</td>', 'Beyond the valley green,down in fields of goldlays a broken dreamempty and forgotten. I find the juxtaposition of the broken house with the golden fields and green valley very symbolic of the lost dream. A house to call home perhaps for generations. But here is lies empty and abandoned - the green valley I see as spring and renewal - but for this broken home there will be none. The fields of gold being the realm where fond memories of the past can be revisited (the golden years) offer no shelter for the broken dream of ''home'' is not just physically broken & forgotten but that of the spirit as well.', '2012-02-23 09:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
