(6688688, 996394, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautifully clear and I love the irridescence on the feathers.  Also like the depth of field and bokeh background colours complementing the hummingbird.</td>', 'Beautifully clear and I love the irridescence on the feathers.  Also like the depth of field and bokeh background colours complementing the hummingbird.', '2012-02-23 13:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
