(6688690, 994113, 44611, '<td valign="top">Terrific colours and fabulously sharp.  Not just any flower and insect shot.  I really like the depth of field blurring the colours at the top of the image.</td>', 'Terrific colours and fabulously sharp.  Not just any flower and insect shot.  I really like the depth of field blurring the colours at the top of the image.', '2012-02-23 13:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
