(6688692, 993927, 44611, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for cats, and if I''m not mistaken this is a Havana Brown?  Great focus and I love how the cat is looking straight at you.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for cats, and if I''m not mistaken this is a Havana Brown?  Great focus and I love how the cat is looking straight at you.', '2012-02-23 14:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
