(6688890, 995911, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Standout image from this amazing POV. Great overall composition actually and the structure in her skirt adds much to it''s texture. I also like the very subtle floor textures too and the interplay between the dancer and her shadow is most compelling.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really<br/> <br/>Overall: A lovely image that will do well.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Standout image from this amazing POV. Great overall composition actually and the structure in her skirt adds much to it''s texture. I also like the very subtle floor textures too and the interplay between the dancer and her shadow is most compelling. Critical stuff: Nothing really Overall: A lovely image that will do well.', '2012-02-23 16:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6688891, 997554, 76335, '<td valign="top">Disorienting yet captivating. And most of all, magical.</td>', 'Disorienting yet captivating. And most of all, magical.', '2012-02-23 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
