(6689522, 997648, 77196, '<td valign="top">I''m so mad at you. These are fascinating tombstones, and I stayed up way too late to see if I could find close-ups of the markers, and some idea of when they were erected. Great capture of the church and its surrounding ocean, headlands, etc. 1110 is quite early for a surviving building. Love history, and this just totally sucked me in.</td>', 'I''m so mad at you. These are fascinating tombstones, and I stayed up way too late to see if I could find close-ups of the markers, and some idea of when they were erected. Great capture of the church and its surrounding ocean, headlands, etc. 1110 is quite early for a surviving building. Love history, and this just totally sucked me in.', '2012-02-23 22:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689523, 995488, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the Juniper (I think) to frame the Butte. The B&amp;W makes it look old. Nice contrast and texture in the wood, and rock of the butte.</td>', 'Nice use of the Juniper (I think) to frame the Butte. The B&W makes it look old. Nice contrast and texture in the wood, and rock of the butte.', '2012-02-23 22:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
