(6689527, 994049, 140305, '<td valign="top">I''m getting close to the end of voting so you know that''s a lot of photos! There are some that just make me stop and linger for while though. This is definitely one of those. Great job.</td>', 'I''m getting close to the end of voting so you know that''s a lot of photos! There are some that just make me stop and linger for while though. This is definitely one of those. Great job.', '2012-02-23 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689528, 996155, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful romantic shot. The white wedding dress, red/brown hat, standing so close together, light on the water, sky tones, water texture, boats &amp; pier in the distance - all blend very nicely.</td>', 'What a wonderful romantic shot. The white wedding dress, red/brown hat, standing so close together, light on the water, sky tones, water texture, boats & pier in the distance - all blend very nicely.', '2012-02-23 22:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
