(6689531, 998196, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great editing. Great expression - kind of a quizzical, appraising expression, and definitely the feel that asking for a light is just an excuse to start a conversation. What do you know that he doesn''t? Be careful what you say.</td>', 'Great editing. Great expression - kind of a quizzical, appraising expression, and definitely the feel that asking for a light is just an excuse to start a conversation. What do you know that he doesn''t? Be careful what you say.', '2012-02-23 22:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689533, 993908, 77196, '<td valign="top">Old Faithful if I don''t miss my guess. If only one could transfer the energy of youth to the grandpa sitting quietly, combined with an attentive, interactive mom. A very touching photograph, and the lighting on the wet surfaces adds a very nice touch.</td>', 'Old Faithful if I don''t miss my guess. If only one could transfer the energy of youth to the grandpa sitting quietly, combined with an attentive, interactive mom. A very touching photograph, and the lighting on the wet surfaces adds a very nice touch.', '2012-02-23 22:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689535, 997554, 75618, '<td valign="top">A very summery winter. The best of both worlds 8</td>', 'A very summery winter. The best of both worlds 8', '2012-02-23 22:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689536, 996902, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great sky capture! I firmly believe that where there is nothing to lift one''s gaze above the horizon, people get a bit careless in being realistic about their importance in the overall scheme of things. It is views like this that remind you of just how much is out there - beyond your understanding and experience! Very nice capture.</td>', 'Wow! Great sky capture! I firmly believe that where there is nothing to lift one''s gaze above the horizon, people get a bit careless in being realistic about their importance in the overall scheme of things. It is views like this that remind you of just how much is out there - beyond your understanding and experience! Very nice capture.', '2012-02-23 22:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689537, 997543, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great detail, patterns, textures. I had no idea their legs were so long (or exposed).</td>', 'Great detail, patterns, textures. I had no idea their legs were so long (or exposed).', '2012-02-23 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689540, 997856, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the feel and colors in this, but feel it is too overexposed. As a result, this mutes the colors, and renders almost the top 1/3 of the shot very very light. Maybe this was your intent, but IMO it makes a picture that has great potential just so-so.</td>', 'I like the feel and colors in this, but feel it is too overexposed. As a result, this mutes the colors, and renders almost the top 1/3 of the shot very very light. Maybe this was your intent, but IMO it makes a picture that has great potential just so-so.', '2012-02-23 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689544, 993917, 77196, '<td valign="top">Evidently the prison has been freed - no longer behind bars or wearing clothes. A rather interesting sculpture. You picture does a nice job of contrasting the silver with a darker background.</td>', 'Evidently the prison has been freed - no longer behind bars or wearing clothes. A rather interesting sculpture. You picture does a nice job of contrasting the silver with a darker background.', '2012-02-23 22:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689549, 998158, 77196, '<td valign="top">Tough shot - the light does a great job back-lighting the butterfly''s wing, but blows out the flower. Nice use of DOF, but the butterfly nor the flower is in focus - looks like the focus was on the stem below the flower.</td>', 'Tough shot - the light does a great job back-lighting the butterfly''s wing, but blows out the flower. Nice use of DOF, but the butterfly nor the flower is in focus - looks like the focus was on the stem below the flower.', '2012-02-23 22:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689550, 995911, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely photo. Beautifully composed and executed.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely photo. Beautifully composed and executed.', '2012-02-23 22:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
