(6689566, 996709, 140305, '<td valign="top">I feel as though I am running out of appropriate things to say in relation to all the truly amazing images in this challenge! I''m getting anxious to get to the end, but I had to stop and look at this one for a long time. Just a really moody, lovely photo. I''m hoping it ends up in ribbon territory.</td>', 'I feel as though I am running out of appropriate things to say in relation to all the truly amazing images in this challenge! I''m getting anxious to get to the end, but I had to stop and look at this one for a long time. Just a really moody, lovely photo. I''m hoping it ends up in ribbon territory.', '2012-02-23 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689570, 994155, 77196, '<td valign="top">I started out really liking this shot - nice golden tones, interesting pose and action capture. But, with a longer look, found just too many distracting things to it. The flying ring on a string, the strand of hair in front of her face, her open mouth, closed eyes, arms down at her side, massive hair behind her with only empty space of well-defined tendrils coming up from her head, spots of bluish in the background. That, combined with the overall blur to the shot really works against it, IMO.</td>', 'I started out really liking this shot - nice golden tones, interesting pose and action capture. But, with a longer look, found just too many distracting things to it. The flying ring on a string, the strand of hair in front of her face, her open mouth, closed eyes, arms down at her side, massive hair behind her with only empty space of well-defined tendrils coming up from her head, spots of bluish in the background. That, combined with the overall blur to the shot really works against it, IMO.', '2012-02-23 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689571, 995602, 69668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with terrific DOF....could lose the border though, it distracts from the overall appeal of the image.</td>', 'Beautiful image with terrific DOF....could lose the border though, it distracts from the overall appeal of the image.', '2012-02-23 22:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689575, 994579, 77196, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a great job with the purple color (which, as I''ve discovered, is difficult to shoot), but very little of the shot is in focus, and the blurry area overwhelms the in-focus parts.</td>', 'You''ve done a great job with the purple color (which, as I''ve discovered, is difficult to shoot), but very little of the shot is in focus, and the blurry area overwhelms the in-focus parts.', '2012-02-23 22:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
