(6689593, 997581, 77196, '<td valign="top">Night shots like this are very difficult to get the lighting right on - not to mention getting a sharp focus. To me, the colors of the main two balloons are a bit muddied and yellowish. It really isn''t until you get to the Scandia balloon that you get some vivid colors. I bet this was an amazing sight in person.</td>', 'Night shots like this are very difficult to get the lighting right on - not to mention getting a sharp focus. To me, the colors of the main two balloons are a bit muddied and yellowish. It really isn''t until you get to the Scandia balloon that you get some vivid colors. I bet this was an amazing sight in person.', '2012-02-23 23:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
