(6689600, 994155, 25787, '<td valign="top">Beutiful but a bit too soft for my taste.</td>', 'Beutiful but a bit too soft for my taste.', '2012-02-23 23:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689601, 994052, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is a different perspective, but the strong shadow and window glare combine to force this into a medium shot without lots of appeal. The lines of the tree &amp; roof edge are interesting.</td>', 'This is a different perspective, but the strong shadow and window glare combine to force this into a medium shot without lots of appeal. The lines of the tree & roof edge are interesting.', '2012-02-23 23:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689602, 997734, 69668, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset....the image looks peaceful.  I like were you have put the sun in the frame.</td>', 'Lovely sunset....the image looks peaceful.  I like were you have put the sun in the frame.', '2012-02-23 23:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689603, 998066, 69668, '<td valign="top">I know who''s this is...so I will comment only.  I love the DOF....but most importlantly I love the pose and expression!!  That pose is sooooo difficult to achieve without alot of editing....so amazing that you caught this.  Great shot of such a sweet little guy.  I am sure the parents love this!!!</td>', 'I know who''s this is...so I will comment only.  I love the DOF....but most importlantly I love the pose and expression!!  That pose is sooooo difficult to achieve without alot of editing....so amazing that you caught this.  Great shot of such a sweet little guy.  I am sure the parents love this!!!', '2012-02-23 23:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689604, 995635, 69668, '<td valign="top">LOL....his face looks proud.  Almost like he is saying "Yeah, I did it!!"</td>', 'LOL....his face looks proud.  Almost like he is saying "Yeah, I did it!!"', '2012-02-23 23:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689607, 994334, 77196, '<td valign="top">Something really doesn''t work in this photo for me - not sure if it is the people in much darker lighting with the products displayed in very bright lighting, the ghost arms of the sales person, a seeming lack of sharpness, angle of the display table across the shot - not sure any of these are all that bad in themselves, but their combination that seems to bother me.</td>', 'Something really doesn''t work in this photo for me - not sure if it is the people in much darker lighting with the products displayed in very bright lighting, the ghost arms of the sales person, a seeming lack of sharpness, angle of the display table across the shot - not sure any of these are all that bad in themselves, but their combination that seems to bother me.', '2012-02-23 23:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689608, 994896, 69668, '<td valign="top">Terrific lighitng....very professional portrait.</td>', 'Terrific lighitng....very professional portrait.', '2012-02-23 23:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689609, 997451, 69668, '<td valign="top">Not the biggest fan of the selective.....however, she is an adorable girl.</td>', 'Not the biggest fan of the selective.....however, she is an adorable girl.', '2012-02-23 23:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689610, 998107, 69668, '<td valign="top">Nice layers throught this image.  It does look a bit overdone for my taste.  However, what an amazing place to visit.</td>', 'Nice layers throught this image.  It does look a bit overdone for my taste.  However, what an amazing place to visit.', '2012-02-23 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689611, 993777, 69668, '<td valign="top">I like the happy story being told here, and also a bit frightening.  Hope the baby ''got on'' OK.</td>', 'I like the happy story being told here, and also a bit frightening.  Hope the baby ''got on'' OK.', '2012-02-23 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689612, 995763, 69668, '<td valign="top">I never get tired of these slot canyons.  Nice image!!</td>', 'I never get tired of these slot canyons.  Nice image!!', '2012-02-23 23:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689613, 993915, 77196, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me ask, "Why?" Nice contrast, but no apparent reason for the bike parked where it is, or the selective desat of all but orange. Plus, the tires look to clean for it to have been ridden recently. Maybe this is a gift, waiting to be discovered...</td>', 'This shot makes me ask, "Why?" Nice contrast, but no apparent reason for the bike parked where it is, or the selective desat of all but orange. Plus, the tires look to clean for it to have been ridden recently. Maybe this is a gift, waiting to be discovered...', '2012-02-23 23:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689615, 994200, 69668, '<td valign="top">LOL....funny title.  I like the ''stalking'' nature of the pelican.</td>', 'LOL....funny title.  I like the ''stalking'' nature of the pelican.', '2012-02-23 23:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689616, 993598, 43463, '<td valign="top">She waits for love to arrive<br/>but stays locked behind the fence.<br/>Her chains link together shielding<br/>from any hurt or harm.<br/>But love never ventured <br/>far from the gate,<br/>withers as a flowering vine <br/>that has not been watered. <br/> <br/>The overall mood of the composition speaks sadness to me. The processing and focus is very artsy in that it is a thought provoking portrait. She waits behind the fence and there is that flowering vine that is all withered. Because she is behind the fence and unsmiling it invoked the thought that while she awaits love and affection but she shields herself from hurt and harm by erecting a chainlink fence. Because she never ventures far from her mental barriers meant to protect love dies on the vine.</td>', 'She waits for love to arrivebut stays locked behind the fence.Her chains link together shieldingfrom any hurt or harm.But love never ventured far from the gate,withers as a flowering vine that has not been watered.  The overall mood of the composition speaks sadness to me. The processing and focus is very artsy in that it is a thought provoking portrait. She waits behind the fence and there is that flowering vine that is all withered. Because she is behind the fence and unsmiling it invoked the thought that while she awaits love and affection but she shields herself from hurt and harm by erecting a chainlink fence. Because she never ventures far from her mental barriers meant to protect love dies on the vine.', '2012-02-23 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689617, 994123, 77196, '<td valign="top">Probably me, but a bright, starred light at the top of a long stair doesn''t do much for me. I could see a ghostly figure ascending the stairs or something to add interest.</td>', 'Probably me, but a bright, starred light at the top of a long stair doesn''t do much for me. I could see a ghostly figure ascending the stairs or something to add interest.', '2012-02-23 23:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689618, 994152, 69668, '<td valign="top">I would be curious to see this in color.  I think it was a bold choice though to go with black and white.</td>', 'I would be curious to see this in color.  I think it was a bold choice though to go with black and white.', '2012-02-23 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689620, 994149, 69668, '<td valign="top">This is what the realtors would call ''cozy''.</td>', 'This is what the realtors would call ''cozy''.', '2012-02-23 23:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689621, 996867, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute fella, but to me the focus is off / too soft on the face, paw, and around the eyes, especially.</td>', 'Cute fella, but to me the focus is off / too soft on the face, paw, and around the eyes, especially.', '2012-02-23 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689622, 997201, 69668, '<td valign="top">"The Breakfast Club"....looks like old fishing buddies.</td>', '"The Breakfast Club"....looks like old fishing buddies.', '2012-02-23 23:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689623, 998140, 69668, '<td valign="top">Generation gaps....unique capture.</td>', 'Generation gaps....unique capture.', '2012-02-23 23:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689624, 997976, 77196, '<td valign="top">I kind-of like the abstractness of this, and don''t like it at the same time. I think a complete fill-the-frame with no white jaggies or corners and without the white frame would work better.</td>', 'I kind-of like the abstractness of this, and don''t like it at the same time. I think a complete fill-the-frame with no white jaggies or corners and without the white frame would work better.', '2012-02-23 23:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689625, 997101, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Colors pop and nice contrast between drab and colorful. Great scene.</td>', 'Great photo. Colors pop and nice contrast between drab and colorful. Great scene.', '2012-02-23 23:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689626, 997777, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, the colors are too muted. Looks a tad over-processed with just a shade too much detail.</td>', 'For me, the colors are too muted. Looks a tad over-processed with just a shade too much detail.', '2012-02-23 23:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689627, 994053, 25787, '<td valign="top">A snowy! I would love to see one someday.</td>', 'A snowy! I would love to see one someday.', '2012-02-23 23:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689628, 998136, 108069, '<td valign="top">Soothing. Great lines and subtle tones and colors. Very nice.</td>', 'Soothing. Great lines and subtle tones and colors. Very nice.', '2012-02-23 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689629, 994233, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. Big spiral cages reflected in what looks like a shallow pool. Not enough context to relate to this. Nice contrast &amp; detail. This might work better as a B&amp;W.</td>', 'OK. Big spiral cages reflected in what looks like a shallow pool. Not enough context to relate to this. Nice contrast & detail. This might work better as a B&W.', '2012-02-23 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689630, 997883, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. That''s a heck of a fire pit and some gorgeous-looking forrest. Nice one.</td>', 'Cute photo. That''s a heck of a fire pit and some gorgeous-looking forrest. Nice one.', '2012-02-23 23:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689631, 995395, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the jacket. For me, the centered composition and busy background (tho nicely blurred) don''t help the picture.</td>', 'Great detail on the jacket. For me, the centered composition and busy background (tho nicely blurred) don''t help the picture.', '2012-02-23 23:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689632, 996488, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great color, and focal depth really makes it. Nice stuff.</td>', 'Great color, and focal depth really makes it. Nice stuff.', '2012-02-23 23:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689634, 996067, 77196, '<td valign="top">Obviously a very different perspective, but for me, a bit too much the same, and a bit too much shadow. This is very tone on tone with almost nothing contrasty going on. Might work better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Obviously a very different perspective, but for me, a bit too much the same, and a bit too much shadow. This is very tone on tone with almost nothing contrasty going on. Might work better in B&W.', '2012-02-23 23:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689635, 993630, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, lovely scene. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Nice colors, lovely scene. Beautiful photo.', '2012-02-23 23:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689636, 997848, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, you have "natural" lighting inside the store (behind the clerk), and very yellow lighting in the foregound. The fg is very very busy, with all the small olives, and the colors are muted, which reduces the contrast between the different shades. Also, the clerk''s lower lip / face looks strange and he''s looking vacantly out of the shot - not at his wares or the camera.</td>', 'For me, you have "natural" lighting inside the store (behind the clerk), and very yellow lighting in the foregound. The fg is very very busy, with all the small olives, and the colors are muted, which reduces the contrast between the different shades. Also, the clerk''s lower lip / face looks strange and he''s looking vacantly out of the shot - not at his wares or the camera.', '2012-02-23 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689637, 994082, 25787, '<td valign="top">Now that''s interesting!</td>', 'Now that''s interesting!', '2012-02-23 23:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689638, 994155, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Mix of numerous emotions and stories. Nice one.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Mix of numerous emotions and stories. Nice one.', '2012-02-23 23:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689639, 995245, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a precious shot - the little one imitating the older girls. Not sure why it doesn''t seem very sharp to me. Nice reflections in the foreground floor.</td>', 'What a precious shot - the little one imitating the older girls. Not sure why it doesn''t seem very sharp to me. Nice reflections in the foreground floor.', '2012-02-23 23:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689641, 997887, 69668, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit on the soft side.  Nice colors and exposure.</td>', 'A tiny bit on the soft side.  Nice colors and exposure.', '2012-02-23 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689642, 997757, 69668, '<td valign="top">Wild looking landscapre.  The over-editing killed the original image though.</td>', 'Wild looking landscapre.  The over-editing killed the original image though.', '2012-02-23 23:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689643, 997883, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand the black area around the campfire ring. It almost looks like the campfire ring is an island. Cute postures, and great capture of the flames &amp; smoke. Nice bright, vivid colors.</td>', 'Not sure I understand the black area around the campfire ring. It almost looks like the campfire ring is an island. Cute postures, and great capture of the flames & smoke. Nice bright, vivid colors.', '2012-02-23 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689644, 998180, 69668, '<td valign="top">Great tones...wonderful ''slice of life'' image.</td>', 'Great tones...wonderful ''slice of life'' image.', '2012-02-23 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689646, 993634, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the color in the sky, and the peaceful feel to this.</td>', 'Love the color in the sky, and the peaceful feel to this.', '2012-02-23 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689647, 995671, 77196, '<td valign="top">The stars above the borealis just make the shot. You''ve done a great job of keeping mostly-normal colors in the water and snow-covered land.</td>', 'The stars above the borealis just make the shot. You''ve done a great job of keeping mostly-normal colors in the water and snow-covered land.', '2012-02-23 23:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689648, 996622, 69668, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the song "You Took the Long Way Home", by Supertramp.  This would be a great album cover for that song.</td>', 'Reminds me of the song "You Took the Long Way Home", by Supertramp.  This would be a great album cover for that song.', '2012-02-23 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689649, 994628, 77196, '<td valign="top">She''s not sure she likes me - a very appraising look. Love the detail in her face and hands and shawl.</td>', 'She''s not sure she likes me - a very appraising look. Love the detail in her face and hands and shawl.', '2012-02-23 23:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689651, 997840, 114285, '<td valign="top">WOW.</td>', 'WOW.', '2012-02-23 23:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689652, 995870, 69668, '<td valign="top">I have never been successful at shooting water droplets.  Great effort on your part!!</td>', 'I have never been successful at shooting water droplets.  Great effort on your part!!', '2012-02-23 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689653, 996792, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love orange / black coloring on this, wonderful bright colors, excellent water texture.</td>', 'Love orange / black coloring on this, wonderful bright colors, excellent water texture.', '2012-02-23 23:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689654, 997873, 69668, '<td valign="top">I like the high key approach.  I thinks it adds to the image rathers than takes away...it helps me hold my interest longer.</td>', 'I like the high key approach.  I thinks it adds to the image rathers than takes away...it helps me hold my interest longer.', '2012-02-23 23:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689655, 998084, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great shot of mommy and her kittens.</td>', 'Great shot of mommy and her kittens.', '2012-02-23 23:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689656, 994646, 69668, '<td valign="top">This is creepy and dreamy at the same time.  Cool.</td>', 'This is creepy and dreamy at the same time.  Cool.', '2012-02-23 23:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689657, 997411, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very much like the head-on view. Great contrast, composition, texture and feel to this.</td>', 'Very much like the head-on view. Great contrast, composition, texture and feel to this.', '2012-02-23 23:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689658, 997997, 69668, '<td valign="top">Are they praying for their survival?  I know I would be!</td>', 'Are they praying for their survival?  I know I would be!', '2012-02-23 23:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689659, 993660, 69668, '<td valign="top">Lovely serene scene.  I love the fact that you did not push the image over the edge with editing.  Just the perfect amount has been give. 9</td>', 'Lovely serene scene.  I love the fact that you did not push the image over the edge with editing.  Just the perfect amount has been give. 9', '2012-02-23 23:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689660, 997839, 77196, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture. Something''s got Shelby''s attention. Great detail in the fur, nice contrast with the brick. Great idea to use monochrome.</td>', 'Fantastic capture. Something''s got Shelby''s attention. Great detail in the fur, nice contrast with the brick. Great idea to use monochrome.', '2012-02-23 23:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689661, 997874, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp picture with excellent color and detail. Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Nice, sharp picture with excellent color and detail. Interesting perspective.', '2012-02-23 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689662, 993599, 69668, '<td valign="top">I bit to much processing for my taste.  However, what a lovely evening.</td>', 'I bit to much processing for my taste.  However, what a lovely evening.', '2012-02-23 23:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689664, 997061, 108069, '<td valign="top">Certainly one of the most striking images here, if not <i>the </i>most. Have returned to it over and over and can''t really think of anything to say. But I''m very impressed with everything from vision to beauty to execution. It''s quite a photo.</td>', 'Certainly one of the most striking images here, if not the most. Have returned to it over and over and can''t really think of anything to say. But I''m very impressed with everything from vision to beauty to execution. It''s quite a photo.', '2012-02-23 23:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689665, 997880, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the intensity of his eyes and expression. Great use of dof. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Absolutely love the intensity of his eyes and expression. Great use of dof. Nice lighting.', '2012-02-23 23:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689666, 997842, 131284, '<td valign="top">Possibly my favourite image of the challenge. What can I say? A perfect street capture! 9</td>', 'Possibly my favourite image of the challenge. What can I say? A perfect street capture! 9', '2012-02-23 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689667, 998188, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene, and very nicely captured. Great reflections and texture on the water.</td>', 'What a beautiful scene, and very nicely captured. Great reflections and texture on the water.', '2012-02-23 23:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689669, 995087, 77196, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of the tidal pool to get a very nice reflection. Nice sky. Great detail in foreground stone formation, and use of the lines in the stone to point at the lighthouse.</td>', 'Fantastic use of the tidal pool to get a very nice reflection. Nice sky. Great detail in foreground stone formation, and use of the lines in the stone to point at the lighthouse.', '2012-02-23 23:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689670, 997200, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky that just seems to extend the lines of the opera house. Very nice contrast.</td>', 'Wonderful sky that just seems to extend the lines of the opera house. Very nice contrast.', '2012-02-23 23:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689671, 997321, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice mountain scene. Wonderful sky. Great colors.</td>', 'Very nice mountain scene. Wonderful sky. Great colors.', '2012-02-23 23:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689673, 996155, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a setting. Great subtle colors, only offered up by that golden-light time when you''re surrounded by water by the sea. Very nice.</td>', 'Wow, that''s a setting. Great subtle colors, only offered up by that golden-light time when you''re surrounded by water by the sea. Very nice.', '2012-02-23 23:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689674, 998027, 75618, '<td valign="top">breathtaking (forgive the horrible pun) 8</td>', 'breathtaking (forgive the horrible pun) 8', '2012-02-23 23:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689675, 997427, 100831, '<td valign="top">gorgeous... gotta love that light.</td>', 'gorgeous... gotta love that light.', '2012-02-23 23:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689676, 997676, 131284, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. I wasn''t aware of this locations name before but this place is also used for the nik snapseed example shot - I had to get my phone to check it wasn''t the same image... your capture is much better though =). The clouds forming around this tree almost as though they were its leaves is fantastic.</td>', 'Love this shot. I wasn''t aware of this locations name before but this place is also used for the nik snapseed example shot - I had to get my phone to check it wasn''t the same image... your capture is much better though =). The clouds forming around this tree almost as though they were its leaves is fantastic.', '2012-02-23 23:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689677, 997856, 75618, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for lens flares. This is <i>beautiful</i>! 8</td>', 'I''m a sucker for lens flares. This is beautiful! 8', '2012-02-23 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689678, 997629, 131284, '<td valign="top">Fantastic processing on this, I love it. 8 from me.</td>', 'Fantastic processing on this, I love it. 8 from me.', '2012-02-23 23:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689680, 995125, 131284, '<td valign="top">Great emotion here, perfect complimentary processing, great capture. One of my favourites. 8</td>', 'Great emotion here, perfect complimentary processing, great capture. One of my favourites. 8', '2012-02-23 23:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689681, 997912, 75618, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and I''m not talking about the model. 8</td>', 'Gorgeous and I''m not talking about the model. 8', '2012-02-23 23:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689682, 993777, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great mix of detail and motion/focal depth blur. Wonderful scene as well. Awesome photo. Reminds me of a certain best of 2011 photo. In that caliber. Fantastic.</td>', 'Great mix of detail and motion/focal depth blur. Wonderful scene as well. Awesome photo. Reminds me of a certain best of 2011 photo. In that caliber. Fantastic.', '2012-02-23 23:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689683, 993733, 75618, '<td valign="top">I love how the fabric mimics the shape of the waves and the clouds. Wonderful forms! 8</td>', 'I love how the fabric mimics the shape of the waves and the clouds. Wonderful forms! 8', '2012-02-23 23:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689684, 993917, 108069, '<td valign="top">And I just dropped the soap!</td>', 'And I just dropped the soap!', '2012-02-23 23:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689685, 996015, 108069, '<td valign="top">Killer focal depth. Great photo.</td>', 'Killer focal depth. Great photo.', '2012-02-23 23:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6689686, 996015, 131284, '<td valign="top">Really great. I recognise this style but I can''t think who the photographer might be off hand. I''m reminded of Tim Burton movies though. 8</td>', 'Really great. I recognise this style but I can''t think who the photographer might be off hand. I''m reminded of Tim Burton movies though. 8', '2012-02-23 23:44:34.000000', NULL, 1);
