(6689694, 997976, 131284, '<td valign="top">A fantastic painting. My only dislike is how the top right corner merges with the border. 8</td>', 'A fantastic painting. My only dislike is how the top right corner merges with the border. 8', '2012-02-23 23:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
