(6689696, 995382, 131284, '<td valign="top">I''d say ''just on the verge of being over-processed'', but not quite :). Great capture of this scenes, I can vividly imagine being there.</td>', 'I''d say ''just on the verge of being over-processed'', but not quite :). Great capture of this scenes, I can vividly imagine being there.', '2012-02-23 23:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
