(6689712, 996905, 43463, '<td valign="top"><u><b>E</b></u>nchantment alights in the first blush of morning hou<u><b>r</b></u> <br/><u><b>L</b></u>ilies open like water ripples from the center in ringed ech<u><b>o</b></u> <br/><u><b>L</b></u>ady of the lovely locks, your grace blooms in the sunbeam<u><b>s</b></u> <br/><u><b>A</b></u>ttune with the kiss of dawn, the fair maid springs awak<u><b>e</b> <br/></u> <br/>This is indeed a very lovely portrait. There is just an elegant grace that so enchanting that one cannot help but linger. She is like Snow White in that the soft light illuminates and awakens the beauty.</td>', 'Enchantment alights in the first blush of morning hour Lilies open like water ripples from the center in ringed echo Lady of the lovely locks, your grace blooms in the sunbeams Attune with the kiss of dawn, the fair maid springs awake  This is indeed a very lovely portrait. There is just an elegant grace that so enchanting that one cannot help but linger. She is like Snow White in that the soft light illuminates and awakens the beauty.', '2012-02-23 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
