(6689867, 997278, 68947, '<td valign="top">And, the day began with a walk.  All 3 buddies took their morning walk along the water''s edge.  On the way home, one of the 3 amigos noticed a photographer who asked politely to take his photo for a photo challenge she was entering.  Of course, the boy complied with a huge smile.  The photographer was more interested in the dogs of course but, she politely smiled and took a shot of all 3 friends.  <br/> <br/>As a reward for being so nice, she offered them a piece of her famous Cherry Pie.  That was the last the photographer has ever seen of the 3 friends but, she has to wonder why she hasn''t seen them since.  One question keeps running through her head, over and over again....was it the pie?<br/> <br/>LOL...Michelle....I like this one.  :)  Perhaps, the title might have thrown this off a bit.  Maybe.....<br/> <br/>Two Dogs And A Boy  <br/>Two Friends and Their Walker<br/>Who''s Leading Who?<br/>I''m Not In Focus Because It''s The Dogs That Are Important<br/>Which Way Do We Go To Get Away From The Camera?<br/>Hurry Up...Take The Shot<br/>Who''s Got The Treats?<br/>Someone Got A Towel?<br/> <br/>Don''t you just love it when it''s nearly 1 a.m. and I write you these stupid comments? LOL<br/> <br/></td>', 'And, the day began with a walk.  All 3 buddies took their morning walk along the water''s edge.  On the way home, one of the 3 amigos noticed a photographer who asked politely to take his photo for a photo challenge she was entering.  Of course, the boy complied with a huge smile.  The photographer was more interested in the dogs of course but, she politely smiled and took a shot of all 3 friends.   As a reward for being so nice, she offered them a piece of her famous Cherry Pie.  That was the last the photographer has ever seen of the 3 friends but, she has to wonder why she hasn''t seen them since.  One question keeps running through her head, over and over again....was it the pie? LOL...Michelle....I like this one.  :)  Perhaps, the title might have thrown this off a bit.  Maybe..... Two Dogs And A Boy  Two Friends and Their WalkerWho''s Leading Who?I''m Not In Focus Because It''s The Dogs That Are ImportantWhich Way Do We Go To Get Away From The Camera?Hurry Up...Take The ShotWho''s Got The Treats?Someone Got A Towel? Don''t you just love it when it''s nearly 1 a.m. and I write you these stupid comments? LOL ', '2012-02-24 00:49:30.000000', NULL, 0),
