(6689939, 997435, 108580, '<td valign="top">Thilo, really good result in the years toughest FS.<br/>Whilst I thought this Lion was photographed in the bush, I refrained from expanding my comments more than what you see below as there are so many captive Lion shots online that it is hard to be sure. I did however put my money where my mouth is and gave this an 8. 1 off for the cropped ears and one off for the lack of engagement with the camera. 8 for exposure, colour, tones, great dof and detail on the eyes and what I believed to be a Lion in the African veld.<br/> <br/>I noticed you only found useful those comments that expounded beyond "nice shot".</td>', 'Thilo, really good result in the years toughest FS.Whilst I thought this Lion was photographed in the bush, I refrained from expanding my comments more than what you see below as there are so many captive Lion shots online that it is hard to be sure. I did however put my money where my mouth is and gave this an 8. 1 off for the cropped ears and one off for the lack of engagement with the camera. 8 for exposure, colour, tones, great dof and detail on the eyes and what I believed to be a Lion in the African veld. I noticed you only found useful those comments that expounded beyond "nice shot".', '2012-02-24 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
