(6690103, 996060, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by insteps:</b></div><hr/><i> Some great comments and a Posthumous.  I''d consider this success. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Henry!  Yes, I was very pleased with that outcome, although <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> would take the view that the score was rather too high to be entirely convincing.  <br/> <br/>I did get a dismissive and bewildered comment from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=119012" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mike_311</a> which is of course quite encouraging, but I failed to attract one of the many disapproving comments made by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27482" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LalliSig</a>, so maybe I can''t after all count this picture as an unqualified triumph.  Oh, bugger!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-24 04:22:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by insteps: Some great comments and a Posthumous.  I''d consider this success.   Thanks Henry!  Yes, I was very pleased with that outcome, although  bvy would take the view that the score was rather too high to be entirely convincing.   I did get a dismissive and bewildered comment from  mike_311 which is of course quite encouraging, but I failed to attract one of the many disapproving comments made by  LalliSig, so maybe I can''t after all count this picture as an unqualified triumph.  Oh, bugger!', '2012-02-24 04:19:10.000000', '2012-02-24 04:22:27.000000', 0),
