(6690232, 996586, 7327, '<td valign="top">This was my first entry in a challenge and it was fun to watch my score. I''m not too surprised by the winners, and I appreciate all the comments made during the voting. <br/> <br/>To Melethia; Yes that is his real name and he went on to win the Baltimore edition of the Indy Car series.<br/> <br/>To o2bskating; I went on Friday which was during the practice laps, if you go when the event is being televised I suspect most of the best general admission areas will be blocked by adverts placed there for the television cameras. The last I heard there it is going to be held again this year and I definitely plan on going, perhaps upgrading from general admission though to get more access to the pit area and drivers<br/> <br/></td>', 'This was my first entry in a challenge and it was fun to watch my score. I''m not too surprised by the winners, and I appreciate all the comments made during the voting.  To Melethia; Yes that is his real name and he went on to win the Baltimore edition of the Indy Car series. To o2bskating; I went on Friday which was during the practice laps, if you go when the event is being televised I suspect most of the best general admission areas will be blocked by adverts placed there for the television cameras. The last I heard there it is going to be held again this year and I definitely plan on going, perhaps upgrading from general admission though to get more access to the pit area and drivers ', '2012-02-24 07:17:26.000000', NULL, 0),
