(6691683, 994027, 131284, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I don''t remember this shot. With my computer breaking I unfortunately didn''t get to go over all of my votes again and adjust them after my initial quick categorization (which is how I normaly vote). It''d have got a 7 if I had (instead of the 6 I gave it - sorry). I prefer your b&amp;w boat shot (I even favoruited it), but this is still a really fine photo and I think picking the image you''re most happy with is important. The toning is really nice, but it''s the man in the archway the really makes the shot for me.</td>', 'Hmm, I don''t remember this shot. With my computer breaking I unfortunately didn''t get to go over all of my votes again and adjust them after my initial quick categorization (which is how I normaly vote). It''d have got a 7 if I had (instead of the 6 I gave it - sorry). I prefer your b&w boat shot (I even favoruited it), but this is still a really fine photo and I think picking the image you''re most happy with is important. The toning is really nice, but it''s the man in the archway the really makes the shot for me.', '2012-02-25 12:32:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6691690, 995975, 30364, '<td valign="top">Holy Smoke!  This is wee Anil?  I never made the connection at all:  I would have missed my guess by half a world.  I was thinking that we must have a bright new star from the sub-Continent let loose amongst us.  Now that loving craftsmanship falls into place.  The quiet sense of fun as well.  Cheers, R.  It''s a bloody beauty.</td>', 'Holy Smoke!  This is wee Anil?  I never made the connection at all:  I would have missed my guess by half a world.  I was thinking that we must have a bright new star from the sub-Continent let loose amongst us.  Now that loving craftsmanship falls into place.  The quiet sense of fun as well.  Cheers, R.  It''s a bloody beauty.', '2012-02-25 12:51:49.000000', NULL, 0),
