(6691700, 993908, 113016, '<td valign="top">Very nice Allen!  I like the separation not only in the people but the intended separation of the focus fall off from the front of the scene to the rear. Wonderfully crisp in the foreground, with a nice ability to see detail of ''place''.  Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice Allen!  I like the separation not only in the people but the intended separation of the focus fall off from the front of the scene to the rear. Wonderfully crisp in the foreground, with a nice ability to see detail of ''place''.  Very nice!', '2012-02-25 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6691711, 994200, 11854, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to comment as much as I''d have liked to in this challenge. I loved this Deb! The brilliant spotlight on the pelican is just so awesome! I can''t believe a score over 6 ended up in the triple digits. Congrats on the bling too!</td>', 'I didn''t get to comment as much as I''d have liked to in this challenge. I loved this Deb! The brilliant spotlight on the pelican is just so awesome! I can''t believe a score over 6 ended up in the triple digits. Congrats on the bling too!', '2012-02-25 14:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
