(6691742, 994896, 112972, '<td valign="top">Kevin, this is a great work!  Great lighting and great model.  I would not dare to go shallow depth of field in my studio like this, my lights are just too strong for it.  I think the lowest I have tried in my studio is f/4.  I guess I could always cover my lights with an extra layer of diffusion and go even more shallow while setting my ISO to 50.  This should have finished higher.</td>', 'Kevin, this is a great work!  Great lighting and great model.  I would not dare to go shallow depth of field in my studio like this, my lights are just too strong for it.  I think the lowest I have tried in my studio is f/4.  I guess I could always cover my lights with an extra layer of diffusion and go even more shallow while setting my ISO to 50.  This should have finished higher.', '2012-02-25 14:41:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6691808, 997844, 41357, '<td valign="top">Too small?<br/>Ziva said it before<br/></td>', 'Too small?Ziva said it before', '2012-02-25 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
