(6692406, 995003, 3216, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, all are very helpful in learning to be a better photographer. This was not a "staged" or planned shot, i was wandering around the house and found this candle lit in a pretty dark room with curtains drawn. I thought about testing my Sigma 30mm f1.4 hand-held and just took this shot. I liked the way it came out.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, all are very helpful in learning to be a better photographer. This was not a "staged" or planned shot, i was wandering around the house and found this candle lit in a pretty dark room with curtains drawn. I thought about testing my Sigma 30mm f1.4 hand-held and just took this shot. I liked the way it came out.', '2012-02-26 13:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6692414, 995003, 3216, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by giantmike:</b></div><hr/><i> That''s a really cool looking candle, I would like one like that.<br/>However, this photo doesn''t offer me a lot of context. This cool of a candle leads me to believe that this is in a cool place, so I would like to see it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Do you mean sharpen it in post-process or just use a higher f-value as the 1.4 is too soft?</td>', 'Originally posted by giantmike: That''s a really cool looking candle, I would like one like that.However, this photo doesn''t offer me a lot of context. This cool of a candle leads me to believe that this is in a cool place, so I would like to see it.   Do you mean sharpen it in post-process or just use a higher f-value as the 1.4 is too soft?', '2012-02-26 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
