(6703426, 994167, 30982, '<td valign="top">I meant to come back and congratulate you on your PH Blue for the Best of.  That is a marvelous accomplishment, and one very well deserved with this photograph.  An exceptional capture of a split second in time with a whole story in that frame.</td>', 'I meant to come back and congratulate you on your PH Blue for the Best of.  That is a marvelous accomplishment, and one very well deserved with this photograph.  An exceptional capture of a split second in time with a whole story in that frame.', '2012-03-07 19:55:33.000000', NULL, 0),
