(6704833, 994889, 67579, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to thank you all for your comments and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=94265" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Purple_Girl</a> I just wanted to say that there was no license plate on the front of this particular car  so nothing was cloned out at all ;) and the rear wheels may look a little off as they are actually slightly wider than the front so they have a little extra steel on the edge...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-09 00:07:06.</i></td>', 'Just wanted to thank you all for your comments and  Purple_Girl I just wanted to say that there was no license plate on the front of this particular car  so nothing was cloned out at all ;) and the rear wheels may look a little off as they are actually slightly wider than the front so they have a little extra steel on the edge...', '2012-03-09 00:05:30.000000', '2012-03-09 00:07:06.000000', 0),
