(6707712, 997739, 51638, '<td valign="top">Hey Anita. Only just spotted this one. Congrats on a good score. You really did get some nice shots when you were in Balingup.</td>', 'Hey Anita. Only just spotted this one. Congrats on a good score. You really did get some nice shots when you were in Balingup.', '2012-03-12 08:47:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6709186, 996631, 45627, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your constructive comments.<br/>It was an extremely cold afternoon so I didn''t linger too long on the bridge over the tracks. Personally, I find some HDR edited images are "unnatural" and in this image it is presented the way the scene really appeared. In this case I think less is more.<br/>Thanks again for your votes.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-13 21:36:13.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all your constructive comments.It was an extremely cold afternoon so I didn''t linger too long on the bridge over the tracks. Personally, I find some HDR edited images are "unnatural" and in this image it is presented the way the scene really appeared. In this case I think less is more.Thanks again for your votes.', '2012-03-13 21:34:35.000000', '2012-03-13 21:36:13.000000', 0),
(6713765, 995635, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a delightful story to go with your King of the Mountain.  Thanks so much for sharing both!!</td>', 'What a delightful story to go with your King of the Mountain.  Thanks so much for sharing both!!', '2012-03-17 01:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6715084, 995985, 12611, '<td valign="top">Being a musician, I like the focal point of the Barre chord. The blurred foreground and the tinted singer in the background set up the shot nicely. THe girls in the crowd, the beer bottle and the woodgrain guitar are nice details. Also. the light fixture, which oddly looks a lot like a living room fixture, looks like a planet in that black and blue "night sky" of a background.<br/> <br/>People put up flashy sunsets and things in the free study and best of challenges, but its shots like these that make it interesting.</td>', 'Being a musician, I like the focal point of the Barre chord. The blurred foreground and the tinted singer in the background set up the shot nicely. THe girls in the crowd, the beer bottle and the woodgrain guitar are nice details. Also. the light fixture, which oddly looks a lot like a living room fixture, looks like a planet in that black and blue "night sky" of a background. People put up flashy sunsets and things in the free study and best of challenges, but its shots like these that make it interesting.', '2012-03-18 11:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6715348, 997739, 100393, '<td valign="top">And now on 1x!!! Well done!</td>', 'And now on 1x!!! Well done!', '2012-03-18 18:33:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6715889, 997739, 66384, '<td valign="top">It seems I didn''t comment during voting, but I gave this a 10. It is exquisite, and something that would look great hanging on the wall. Congrats on 1X. I can never figure out what they will accept.</td>', 'It seems I didn''t comment during voting, but I gave this a 10. It is exquisite, and something that would look great hanging on the wall. Congrats on 1X. I can never figure out what they will accept.', '2012-03-19 07:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6716154, 997739, 11854, '<td valign="top">Congrats on getting your gorgeous image on 1x!</td>', 'Congrats on getting your gorgeous image on 1x!', '2012-03-19 11:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6718535, 993656, 101668, '<td valign="top">Hi Steve, saw the www.getaway.co.za today and was truly thrilled. The picture printed far better than on the monitor. Once again congratulations on a magnificent shot.</td>', 'Hi Steve, saw the www.getaway.co.za today and was truly thrilled. The picture printed far better than on the monitor. Once again congratulations on a magnificent shot.', '2012-03-21 08:52:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6728765, 993656, 108580, '<td valign="top">Like Ammie, but I only saw it today in the April 2012 Getaway. Well done boys! Fabulous shot. Hope they PAID you!</td>', 'Like Ammie, but I only saw it today in the April 2012 Getaway. Well done boys! Fabulous shot. Hope they PAID you!', '2012-04-01 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 0);
