(7671624, 995669, 67145, '<td valign="top">just having a bit of a wander in dpc .. like dpc surfing .. <br/>and saw this .. as a thumb .. <br/>unfortunately my internet is so slow atm that it actually took two minutes for this to open .. but the thumb was so appealing .. and i loved your comment .. that i just had to wait it out .. <br/>so happy that i did .. ITS UNFORGETTABLE .. what a wonderful moment you have captured .. just oozing personality .. in a really good way .. !! .. <br/>and when i think about it .. it seems that even tho the baby was screaming and crying and making the shoot seem so difficult .. you came away with this .. !! .. <br/>its like the rose among the thorns .. the photo is the rose and the screams the thorns btw .. !! .. <br/>also loving your title so much .. :)<br/>and that little baby would be over 8 years old now .. time warp .. !! .. ;)</td>', 'just having a bit of a wander in dpc .. like dpc surfing .. and saw this .. as a thumb .. unfortunately my internet is so slow atm that it actually took two minutes for this to open .. but the thumb was so appealing .. and i loved your comment .. that i just had to wait it out .. so happy that i did .. ITS UNFORGETTABLE .. what a wonderful moment you have captured .. just oozing personality .. in a really good way .. !! .. and when i think about it .. it seems that even tho the baby was screaming and crying and making the shoot seem so difficult .. you came away with this .. !! .. its like the rose among the thorns .. the photo is the rose and the screams the thorns btw .. !! .. also loving your title so much .. :)and that little baby would be over 8 years old now .. time warp .. !! .. ;)', '2020-08-05 07:17:07.000000', NULL, 0);
